Hearing about someone else's struggles, even when spoken of calmly, could always bring to mind one's own experiences.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu..."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A soft whimper came from beneath the wardrobe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and Gastly exchanged a look, sharing a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
