Before he could finish speaking, Johan felt a cold, soft tongue lick the wound on his hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sensation was icy and gentle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
