It was clear where the Vulpix had hidden again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed inwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pok\u233?mon may have simple hearts, but they were still intelligent creatures capable of thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In some ways, their hearts were both resilient and fragile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Resilient in how they could silently endure for countless years, keeping promises.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fragile in how betrayal or abandonment could leave gaping wounds that might never heal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Vulpix, I bought you a gift," Johan said, sitting beside the wardrobe. "Would you like to see it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He pulled three light blue bows from his pocket.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Alolan Vulpix poked her head out from under the wardrobe, eyeing the bows with bright, twinkling eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Can I put one on you?" Johan asked gently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu..."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Vulpix hesitated, then pulled her head back under the wardrobe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah..."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly drooped its head, disappointed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan gave Gastly a reassuring smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, in a sudden blur of white, the Vulpix darted out from under the wardrobe and leaped straight into Johan's arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Thump!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The force of the jump knocked Johan flat on his back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Vulpix burrowed deep into Johan's embrace, her small body trembling slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed like she had made a big decision\u8212?and was feeling afraid and uncertain about it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sensing the Vulpix's nervousness, Johan smiled softly and gently cradled her in his arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He didn't say anything, just stroked her back slowly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a long while, the Vulpix finally began to calm down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, let's get these on," Johan said, holding up the bows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He tied one around her neck and placed the other two on her ears.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
