{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Alolan Vulpix lifted her head hesitantly, her cheeks turning slightly pink.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah!!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly let out an excited howl, its tone almost wolf-like.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They look great! I must have a good eye," Johan praised, smiling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Vulpix's blush deepened, and she shyly lowered her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, as if making another big decision, the little Pok\u233?mon leaned forward, gently licking Johan's cheek with her cool tongue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah Ka-kah!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Me too! Me too!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
