{\b
Sluuurp\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One side of Johan's face began to frost over, while the other started to go numb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's mouth twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Oddly... not too bad?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Up to this point, it seemed like everything was going perfectly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Gastly was so excited that its tongue stretched out too far, splashing saliva onto one of Vulpix's new bows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
