After all, in the snowy mountains of Alola, Alolan Vulpix is a primary target for Weavile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And judging by Vulpix's reaction earlier\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Could this little one, despite its cute appearance, actually be a hidden bundle of fury?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
