Still, he smiled and pulled out a Luxury Ball as he spoke.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Vulpix\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he could finish, the Vulpix curiously tapped the button on the Luxury Ball with its paw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flash of red light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Click\u8212?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There wasn't even a hint of struggle; the Luxury Ball settled with an almost anticlimactic stillness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, well," Johan sighed dramatically. "I wanted at least a little excitement\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly floated back, its demeanor a little shaken.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Did we get tricked by its cute and weak appearance?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shot Gastly a sidelong glance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Who was the one going "So cute!" and "Hehehe" just a moment ago?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly chuckled sheepishly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Well, it is cute\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"She probably doesn't even realize her own strength," Johan mused as he held the Luxury Ball in his hand. "From now on, let's live together."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Luxury Ball shook slightly in response.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly grinned broadly, delighted to finally have a partner to spar with!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Come to think of it, the Alolan Vulpix shared quite a few moves with Gastly, like {\i
Confuse Ray} and {\i
Hex}...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thinking about it\u8230?" Johan murmured as he thoughtfully rubbed the ball in his hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A centuries-old ghost and a fox spirit...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Sounds like a setup for a mystical duo.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That night\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly enthusiastically showed the young Vulpix around the apartment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is the kitchen. Johan doesn't let me in here, but between you and me\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly lowered its voice conspiratorially.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?you can sneak in sometimes."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly puffed up with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Alolan Vulpix blinked its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Why would you want to go in?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah\u8212?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"To secretly inhale gas, of course! I've got a technique: as long as you don't take too much at once, Johan won't notice!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?! (\u12539?\u12539?)"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly then led the young Vulpix to another room.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is the bathroom, where you can take baths."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastly flashed a mischievous grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?together, hehehe\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu!!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Startled, the Vulpix's latent psychic power surged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka\u8212?kah\u8212?\u8212?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Elsewhere, Johan received an unexpected phone call.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lance?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is there still something wrong with Aerodactyl?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the other end of the line came Lance's somewhat awkward voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem, no, Aerodactyl's fine. Especially after listening to your 'hypnotic audio reinforcement'... Johan, well, there's a new issue. It's not really an issue, just..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lance, since when did you get so hesitant? This doesn't seem like you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well... alright, alright, the problem is me. The video of our battle got uploaded online," Lance admitted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Huh?!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stood up from his chair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...The 'body cam' wasn't turned off. The video was automatically streamed to the control room. Normally, it wouldn't be an issue, since nobody watches those unless we're on a mission. But, as luck would have it, Agatha happened to see it..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And she said, 'This is what a battle should look like\u8212?this is tactical synergy at its finest.' So\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan silently picked up his phone and logged into the official League site.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough, the video was on the homepage, recorded from Lance's perspective. The title read:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Dirty? Skillful? Don't Use Such Words When Talking About Tactics"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had already accumulated over 100,000 views and was rising by the second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There were plenty of comments below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[BurningLeaf]}: "Tried it myself\u8212?yep, it's dirty\u8212?err, I mean strong! Maybe I just wasn't skilled enough, or my opponent was too strong, but I lost. Still, it gave me new insights into battle strategies."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[MaskedMan]}: "Is this an evolution of the 'Toxic Stall' strategy?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[FactoryHead]}: "Rental battle? Such coordination with borrowed Pok\u233?mon is rare."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And many, many more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rubbed his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He could already feel the ripples this video would create.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His research paper's popularity seemed to be picking up traction again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More importantly, his online consultation room had received a sudden surge of new "patients."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had been so preoccupied with helping the Alolan Vulpix all day that he hadn't paid attention to his phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm really sorry, Johan," Lance said. "I only found out today. But Agatha said all revenue from the video would go to you, and she's willing to send you a rare item or a move-learning machine as compensation."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance continued, "Of course, if you think this has negatively impacted you, I can contact them to take the video down right away."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem." Johan cleared his throat as he glanced at the new balance in his bank account.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know, Lance, this video is more impactful on you," Johan pointed out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, this practically meant he was gaining fame at the expense of the renowned Dragon Tamer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wins and losses are part of life. This battle taught me a lot. Everything else is secondary," Lance replied, laughing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was slightly taken aback by his easygoing attitude.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Besides, my face isn't even in the video."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked, dumbfounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since the camera was mounted on Lance's shoulder, it was true that his face wasn't in the footage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, anyone determined enough could figure it out, but Lance's words seemed meant to ease Johan's concerns.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's a joke. Anyway, what do you want to do? It's your call," Lance said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After mulling it over for a moment, Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Leave it," he said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battle had been for treating Aerodactyl, and there was no need to keep it under wraps.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, several of the gardeners and staff at the Stone estate had witnessed the match anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And as far as gaining fame went\u8230? Johan figured it was inevitable. Why else would he have published that research paper?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Plus, with so many people seeking his consultation, he'd be able to help more people and Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It might even bring in a bit of extra income.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it would give him more material for his research.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced over at Gastly and Vulpix, who were now playing together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With an extra Pok\u233?mon to care for, his expenses were only going to increase.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After hanging up the call, Johan turned his attention to the messages in his consultation inbox.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most of the simpler queries were answered quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A few more complex ones remained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For example\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[PsychicGirl]}: "Why won't my Kadabra evolve?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
