Pok\u233?mon Adventures}. In normal battles, Gold often struggled, but when it came to no-holds-barred situations, his precision and stealth were terrifying. Then, of course, there's Agatha and Lance\u8212?though Lance is more of a cautionary tale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
