"Steven, you're here too?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Around the "Tower Climb Zone," more and more people gathered. Initially, they were merely onlookers, but as time passed, their reactions shifted from casual curiosity to shock, then to stunned silence. Roxanne, dressed in a maid outfit, and Flannery, in a hip-hop outfit, squeezed through the crowd and found Steven standing at the front.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
