Granted, these eight Pok\u233?mon were all part of the Academy's training team and not perfectly synchronized with Isaya's commands, but they were far from weak. Isaya herself was known for being adept at leading Pok\u233?mon battles using random choices.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield, Johan looked at Haunter, who was laughing triumphantly, and asked:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Haunter, how are you holding up?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Alolan Vulpix in Johan's arms also glanced over with concern.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
