Haunter licked its claws with confidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This is my hunting hour. Ready or not, I'll keep going!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter's stamina seemed fine, and Johan could see from his visual interface that Haunter's overall condition wasn't bad.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What Johan was really asking was whether Haunter had had enough fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But clearly, Haunter wasn't satisfied yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
