Despite being on the losing end, Isaya showed no signs of frustration. As the overseer of the "Tower Climb Zone," she understood the importance of keeping her cool to ensure fairness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be honest, she was also curious about how far Johan and Haunter could go.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She could sense that while Haunter hadn't sustained any major injuries, the continuous use of moves and abilities had to be wearing on its stamina.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well, sort of\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter occasionally pulled a "Toxic Orb" from its mouth and licked it like a snack, as if tricking itself into feeling better.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Hypno!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next Pok\u233?mon that emerged from the flash of red light was a humanoid Pok\u233?mon with golden fur, a white ruff around its neck, and a small pendulum in its hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Suri."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Psychic-type and a master of hypnosis\u8212?Hypno!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon entering the field, Hypno's eyes glowed with a deep blue hue, and it locked its gaze onto Haunter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
