What just happened?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Hypno, a Pok\u233?mon specialized in Hypnosis, had been outmatched in its own domain by Haunter!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they hadn't seen Hypno fall with their own eyes and witnessed its body twitching, no one would have believed what they saw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter yawned and patted its mouth, a tear forming at the corner of its eye.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whew, that was close. I almost fell asleep myself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, Haunter smirked mischievously as it surveyed Hypno's body, its gaze finally landing on the hypnotic pendulum.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Alolan Vulpix's eyes sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
