69: Vulpix\u8217?s \u8220?Rival\u8221?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smoochum, the Kiss Pok\u233?mon, is of the Ice and Psychic types.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It resembles a small girl with golden hair, pink skin, large eyes, and its signature thick lips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smoochum is naturally curious, and its lips are very sensitive. When it encounters something unfamiliar, it often uses its lips to touch and understand it first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its lips are also used to remember things it likes and dislikes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To keep its lips moisturized, wild Smoochum regularly use tree sap as a lip balm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's not surprising for a Smoochum to constantly check its lips, even after taking a fall. So, its fixation with mirrors isn't unusual.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if it truly feels like it would "die" without a mirror, that's no longer confidence\u8212?it's vanity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't strictly a psychological issue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's somewhat similar to Eevee Eats Cabbage's Feebas. But while that Feebas was excessively self-conscious, this "[Forever Eighteen]" Smoochum is excessively vain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After giving it some thought, Johan offered his advice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "My suggestion is to intervene externally while also redirecting its focus, coupled with some 'hypnotic' guidance."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "What specific method?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "For example, you could hide all the mirrors. Or, you could try taking away its mirror while it's using it and offer it something like a Pok\u233?block to distract it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "One moment."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't long before the person sent over a video clip.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the video, Smoochum was happily looking in the mirror, when suddenly, a pale hand snatched it away. In the next instant, Smoochum burst into tears.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The tears formed a small puddle on the ground, and Smoochum simply used the puddle as a mirror instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for the offered Pok\u233?block, it didn't even spare a glance at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He retracted his earlier judgment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was indeed a psychological issue!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "So\u8230? that's the situation."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan felt a slight headache coming on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If a Pok\u233?mon was overly self-conscious, it could be helped by steadily boosting its confidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if a Pok\u233?mon was overly confident to the point of vanity, it couldn't be cured with a heavy-handed approach.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Otherwise, it could backfire and lead to the opposite extreme\u8212?causing the Pok\u233?mon to spiral into deep self-doubt, which would be much harder to fix.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Otherwise, simply showing Smoochum what it would look like after evolution could suffice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was only one solution left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced at Alolan Vulpix, who was happily watching TV alongside Haunter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
"Well, you probably won't meet it anyway,"} he thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He then sent over a picture of Alolan Vulpix sitting in an ice cream cup from the recent Academy Festival.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "So cute!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Message retracted."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised an eyebrow and pretended not to see that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "Show it this, and let me know its reaction."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon after, a new photo arrived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smoochum was frozen in place, holding the tablet with a stunned expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan let out a sigh of relief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thankfully, Alolan Vulpix's cuteness worked like a charm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "It looks\u8230? a bit lost."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "Are you a Trainer?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "Yes."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "Then tell it that Alolan Vulpix trains hard, and that a Pok\u233?mon who trains is the most beautiful."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "I'll try."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Ding-ding!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another picture arrived. This time, Smoochum was earnestly lifting a pair of tiny dumbbells.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed to be working, at least a little.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "This is just the first step. Keep a close eye on Smoochum's condition, and remember to praise it with words like 'strong,' 'diligent,' and 'hardworking' are what make a Pok\u233?mon truly beautiful. If there's any more trouble, feel free to reach out."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Confidence is a good thing, but if Smoochum becomes too fixated on its appearance, it could lead to a significant drop in self-esteem once it evolves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, it's possible that even after evolving, it could remain confident in its appearance\u8212?but in a more delusional way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That's why it was necessary to shift its focus early on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan specifically asked if they were a Trainer to gauge the best direction for this shift.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they only saw Smoochum as a pet, the focus wouldn't have been as effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Forever Eighteen]:} "Thank you! (sigh of relief emoji)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Grain in The Field]:} "You're welcome."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After that, Johan answered a few more messages.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He set the incubator back in place, took a quick shower, and prepared to go to bed with Alolan Vulpix.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lately, he hadn't needed to "help with sleep" as much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Well, it's not like I can freeload every day\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Silph Academy, Johto}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Heh, little Smoochum working out? Is the sun rising in the west tomorrow?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Karen pushed open the door and found Smoochum diligently lifting its small dumbbells, making little grunting noises. She looked utterly surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lorelei adjusted her glasses and explained what she had consulted Johan about online earlier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh? Seems like our Senior Johan really knows his stuff."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had felt a sense of familiarity with Johan, only to later discover that he had also attended Silph Academy, even though they weren't in the same department. Technically, he was their senior.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Karen, how do you think I should thank him?" Lorelei asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Karen understood this wasn't just about the Smoochum matter. Lorelei had also gained insights from the {\i
