"True." Karen's eyes lit up mischievously. "Didn't Lance meet him too? You could always ask Lance\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
CRACK!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lorelei's tablet suddenly displayed a noticeable crack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the Festival, the Academy granted a short holiday break.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Early in the morning, poverty drove Johan to wake up bright and early.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon waking, he saw Haunter on the ceiling, rubbing its sleepy eyes and looking disappointed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Another failed attempt to lick Johan awake\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
