108: They\u8217?ve Really Picked \u8220?Exciting\u8221? Opponents!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sunday's release time is at 11 EST.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
-------\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two quiet days passed, and finally, the long Academy Festival holiday came to an end.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Students and teachers alike returned to campus, gearing up for the upcoming midterms. But Steven hadn't returned, as he was one of the participants in the "Youth Exhibition Match."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the Kanaz City Pok\u233?mon Academy training grounds\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, the school's training grounds really are nice and peaceful."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the shade of a tree, Johan sipped his coffee while holding a book.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rumble\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ground trembled slightly, a long furrow forming as Vulpix poked her head up from the soil.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a shake, she leapt out of the ground, scattering dust and bits of snow as her muddy fur shimmered back into its usual, pristine white.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But as Vulpix emerged, another head squeezed its way out from underground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter, clearly too big for the tunnel Vulpix had dug, somehow managed to twist and turn his way out. Then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu~ Chu~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A small pink hand wiggled from the tunnel, seemingly stuck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix hurriedly grabbed the little hand with her tail, pulling up Tinkatink, who was holding a metallic stone with a proud grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu! (Heehee!)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Covered in dust, Tinkatink plopped onto the ground, looking down at the metallic stone in her hands and beaming with pride.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was their prize this time\u8212?a stone full of precious metal minerals!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eye twitched as he watched the scene, swallowing the words he had been about to say.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was the result of a "new venture" Haunter, Vulpix, and Tinkatink had been working on lately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatink would use her hammer\u8212?now infused with Nosepass's magnetite\u8212?to search large areas for metallic traces.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter would use his abilities to pass through walls and objects, narrowing down the location precisely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Vulpix would then dig the tunnel, using the "Dig" move she'd just learned two days ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the three Pok\u233?mon working in sync, they were now quite skilled at finding and extracting metal ores from the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Johan had to admit it: each one of his Pok\u233?mon was\u8230? incredibly talented.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
