They were practically a trio of "outlaws!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he hadn't stopped them from this little mining operation, mainly because, in a way, it lightened his own burden. At least for the time being, Tinkatink wouldn't need as many metal ores, easing his expenses a bit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
