A timid Sharpedo? That was unusual.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After seeing the reason for its timidity, Johan finally understood why Wallace had sought him out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At one point, Sharpedo in Hoenn had been hunted nearly to extinction due to overfishing. It was only after the League enacted the Pok\u233?mon Protection Act that their population began to recover.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan studied Sharpedo with a serious expression, Wallace couldn't help but ask, "Professor Johan\u8230? Sharpedo, is it\u8230??"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stepped forward, to Wallace's surprise, and placed a gentle hand on Sharpedo's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
