After that, she hung up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the school gate?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The urgency in Officer Jenny's voice suggested that this was serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan didn't hesitate much longer and called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
