He gathered the three little ones and headed quickly to the academy's entrance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, get in!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the Kanaz Academy gate, Officer Jenny pulled up in an open-top Jeep. The moment she saw him, she called him over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as he got in, the car sped off. "So fast?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was thrown against the seat, quickly fastening his seatbelt and gripping the door handle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
