A large group of frenzied wild Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Officer Jenny went on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We don't know the cause yet. Two of my colleagues patrolling the area have already gone there, but we've lost contact with them."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It did seem serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan opened his mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's urgent, but could we maybe slow down a little?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Officer Jenny's high-speed driving, they soon reached the southern suburbs of Kanaz City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
