In the distance, he could faintly hear crashing and rumbling sounds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After listening to the farm couple's description, Officer Jenny's expression grew more serious, and Johan finally regained some composure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
