Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One thing's for sure: Giovanni's Nidoqueen is a true "move encyclopedia"!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had practically learned every move available and appeared to wield them with impressive mastery.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for her "Sheer Force" ability, it was the perfect fit for Pok\u233?mon like Nidoking and Nidoqueen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Sheer Force: Boosts the power of moves with additional effects, but those additional effects are nullified.]}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For example, Nidoqueen's "Thunderbolt" had a chance of causing paralysis, but with "Sheer Force," that chance was eliminated, and the move's power was boosted instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A common tactic was pairing this ability with the "Life Orb" item.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Life Orb: Increases the power of moves by approximately 30%, but each use drains about 10% of the user's health.]}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When "Sheer Force" and "Life Orb" are combined, the boosted power cancels out the Life Orb's side effect, making for an incredibly potent "Sheer Force Life Orb" strategy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the vast movepool of Nidoking and Nidoqueen, they were once the rage in competitive play.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearly, Giovanni raised this Nidoqueen with that strategy in mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So this Nidoqueen was powerful\u8212?very powerful!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She might not be one of Giovanni's main Pok\u233?mon, perhaps not even in his primary lineup, but Johan estimated she was likely stronger than many Gym Leaders' main Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However\u8230? her "mood"\u8230? was a real concern.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The way she reacted to the pair of Golbat just now made that very clear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
