Move: Dream Eater!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Dream Eater, Haunter quickly restored the energy he'd expended on Substitute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With one Pok\u233?mon down, Homi's side now faced a 2-on-1 disadvantage, making the battle heavily one-sided.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Homi wasn't about to give up easily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Breloom's collapse as a clue, she and Sunflora managed to pinpoint Haunter and Vulpix's location.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three bright green Energy Balls soared through the snowy haze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter chuckled and threw a Shadow Ball to counter the three Energy Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a loud crash and a shockwave clearing some of the snow, the audience saw a single oversized Shadow Ball break through all three Energy Balls, smashing directly into Sunflora.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoa! That Shadow Ball\u8230? How is that even fair?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeed, after nullifying three Energy Balls, the Shadow Ball landed a direct hit on Sunflora, causing it to cry out in pain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Sunflora could split its Energy Ball into three, why couldn't he just make one bigger Shadow Ball?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was only slightly bigger, after all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sunflora!" Homi called, her voice stern. "It's not over! Don't give up!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sunflora's eyes glowed green, and its body emanated the same energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's Overgrow! Homi-sensei still has a\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah! She can still\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The audience was starting to get riled up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ice Beam."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's calm voice came, and a beam of blue light struck from about seven or eight meters away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crack, crack, crack\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A chilling frost instantly encased Sunflora in ice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cutting its Overgrow short, the move's freezing effect instantly extinguished the fans' rising excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire arena went silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One more Ice Beam, solidifying the ice around Sunflora even further.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dead silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix exhaled a soft breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Almost got overturned there.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the snow cleared, the field revealed an array of snowmen and the multitude of shadows from Haunter's Substitute and Shadow Sneak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Imagining Homi's perspective, a few audience members couldn't help shivering.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If the snow wasn't countered, she would be facing a potentially endless number of snowmen, along with seemingly countless shadows from Haunter\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Did this mean\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victory could only be achieved through a minuscule chance\u8212?one that would grow ever smaller over time?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The more experienced students grasped the reality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This\u8230? might be an even "nastier" tactic than "Substitute-Toxic."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan-sensei, that was\u8230? really sneaky\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sneaky?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In strategy, can something truly be called "sneaky"?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was just the beginning\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
----------\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
