The old lighthouse, its walls covered in dust.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Knock knock\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan tapped lightly on the door.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter poked its head through the door.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this point, Johan was almost used to Haunter's casual disregard for physical boundaries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The door's unlocked."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A sound came from inside, and with a creak, the door slowly swung open.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flash of fiery red appeared\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a Vulpix!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Ice Vulpix perched on Johan's head tilted its head in curiosity as it saw the other Vulpix.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The red Vulpix, peeking out from behind the door, also tilted its head, seemingly equally curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Thump\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Ice Vulpix leapt from Johan's head onto the ground. The two Vulpixes stared at each other, their eyes filled with intrigue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Chu?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff rubbed its eyes, confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why are there two Vulpixes? Though... they don't look exactly the same."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This must be Researcher Bill's Vulpix," Johan guessed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Researcher Bill was a renowned figure\u8212?one of the greatest Pok\u233?mon researchers of his time. He was not only the developer of the Pok\u233?mon storage system and time capsule but also a Pok\u233?mon reviewer and an esteemed member of the Pok\u233?mon Association.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the {\i
Pok\u233?mon Adventures} manga, Bill was also a skilled trainer, once teaming up with Lt. Surge to battle against Elite Four Bruno.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this red Vulpix? It was Bill's loyal Pok\u233?mon, primarily tasked with guarding the lighthouse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Johan found himself more impressed with how much the Ice Vulpix had grown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The once-shy, timid little fox that couldn't approach strangers or Pok\u233?mon had now taken the initiative to greet another Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While it was true that the red Vulpix being another Vulpix helped ease the introduction, it was undeniable that the Ice Vulpix had come a long way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't timid anymore, but it had grown noticeably more cautious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Oowu~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two Vulpixes quickly became acquainted, their tails wagging happily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Vulpix, is someone here?" came Bill's voice from inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Researcher Bill, it's me\u8212?Johan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, Johan? Come in, come in! I'm a bit busy at the moment."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
