The interior was as cluttered as he expected: books and devices piled haphazardly, many of them collecting layers of dust. The dim lighting added an air of gloom to the space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reminding his Pok\u233?mon not to touch anything, Johan ventured deeper into the lighthouse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon, he found Bill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The professor was drenched in sweat, struggling to take off what looked like a Magikarp costume.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan paused, bewildered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although it wasn't the {\i
familiar} Omanyte suit, it still perfectly matched the image he had of Bill in his mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't some hybrid fusion of Rattata or Nidorino.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter, however, seemed thrilled. It floated up to Bill and examined him closely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, its outline shifted, and it transformed\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Into a black Magikarp, complete with its tongue sticking out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bill stared in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You like cosplay too?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kah ka-kah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Haunter grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"When it comes to transformations, I'm a pro!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With this shared "interest," the man and Pok\u233?mon clicked instantly, grinning at each other.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ahem."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but clear his throat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, sorry about that, Johan," Bill said, snapping back to reality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scratching his curly brown hair in embarrassment, he finally managed to wriggle out of the Magikarp suit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I was experimenting with the device you and Lance sent over. I was curious about how a Magikarp would react to a unique magnetic field, so I..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Got it. Totally understand."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No, he didn't.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't an experiment\u8212?this was plain eccentricity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bill was a confirmed oddball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"By the way, that equipment you sent solved a huge problem for me!" Bill exclaimed, wiping sweat from his brow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
