Unperturbed, Johan explained,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Team Rocket's activities\u8212?poaching and smuggling\u8212?leave a stain that can't be erased. As long as they remain in the shadows, they'll always risk being exposed by the light."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
