Gengar waved dismissively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How strong could they be?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Retired Champion's Pok\u233?mon," Johan quipped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It immediately fell in line, climbing the steps quietly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "Disciplined."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dratini, as always, tripped over itself trying to ascend the steps, but Johan was used to it. If the day came when Dratini's clumsiness vanished, it would likely signal some great cosmic imbalance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
