"Long time no see\u8230? Johan, sir."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since Johan had saved him during the Spear Pillar incident, Blue had researched him thoroughly and learned about his reputation as the "Cunning One."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hence, even the proud Blue now regarded him with a healthy dose of wariness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
