As fascinating as the origins of the giant Dragonite were, Johan found himself more intrigued by the idea of seeing Mega Evolution vs. Dynamax vs. Terastallization in action.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that would be a sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Hmm\u8230? Am I forgetting something?'\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
