A massive Ursaring, its eyes tinged red with rage, bellowed and charged forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-bu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kabu-kabu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
