Even though these iconic choices held a certain allure for any Pok\u233?mon lover, Johan's current finances were better suited to ensuring he and his Pok\u233?mon didn't starve.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Absolutely not because he feared being burdened with a special Pok\u233?dex, loaded with tasks and responsibilities.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, who typically received those special Pok\u233?dexes?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Red, Green, Ethan, Silver\u8212?all protagonists.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
