Freezing, fires, and relentless attacks from sinister organizations.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not to mention the {\i
real} problem: being targeted by Legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Super Mewtwo was already more than enough trouble for Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The only thing he regretted was missing the chance to meet Red or Ash\u8212?or perhaps even both.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But with their abilities, he was certain they'd cross paths someday.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hopefully\u8230? much later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Home is safe."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Gengar and Alolan Vulpix introduced Dratini to its new surroundings, Johan entered the bathroom and emerged with a mop, bucket, and cleaning cloths.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, you're on ceiling, walls, and all the nooks and crannies."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Vulpix, handle the bed, tables, and surfaces."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tinkatuff, the floors are yours!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The three Pok\u233?mon saluted with enthusiasm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, they'd done this many times before and were quite accustomed to the process.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dratini blinked curiously at Johan, clearly waiting for its task.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a moment of thought, Johan assigned the bathroom to Dratini.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You'll be in charge of cleaning the bathroom with water," he said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was only fitting since Dratini was the only one capable of using water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just remember\u8212?whatever you do, {\i
don't} use Water Gun."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thrilled to be entrusted with a job, Dratini chirped happily and slithered off with a cloth in its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, meanwhile, took charge of the kitchen\u8212?a crucial area that demanded his personal attention.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thus began the grand {\b
Johan's House Cleanup Mission} in earnest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar floated up to the ceiling, a cloth in hand. It huffed lightly at a light fixture, then wiped it meticulously until it squeaked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, use water, not saliva. That's the fifth lampshade you've ruined!" Johan's voice rang out from the kitchen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I know, I know!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar shouted back indignantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't saliva this time\u8212?just a little breath!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As it inspected the light fixture, Gengar froze, realizing the lampshade was thinning before its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka\u8230? Ka-kah\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This should be fine\u8230? probably.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
