"Wu\u8230? Oowu?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Poking its head out from the cozy folds, Alolan Vulpix gave an innocent look, then took a deep breath, savoring the scent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan's scent is so comforting!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tinkatuff, remember\u8212?you're holding a mop, not your hammer! Be gentle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unconvinced, Johan left the kitchen to check.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Snap!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
