Johan groaned, pressing a hand to his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I should've remembered you've all gotten stronger after our travels."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The trio chimed in unison, their faces lighting up with smiles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Don't worry, we forgive you.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was used to this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, where's Dratini?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
