Amid the foam, a familiar thud sounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dratini poked its head out of the bubbles, its face beaming with a silly, bubbly grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan let out a dry laugh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eventually, the cleanup concluded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sitting on the couch with a steaming cup of tea, Johan exhaled in relief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finally done."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While there were plenty of minor hiccups, the process went smoothly overall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least, compared to the first time he'd cleaned with his Pok\u233?mon, when they'd caused a blackout, frozen the house, and shattered the tiles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Things had improved considerably.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With everyone's cooperation, the house was spotless\u8212?and most importantly, still intact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But as he surveyed his cozy home, Johan couldn't help but realize something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This place\u8230? might be getting a bit small."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was charmingly snug, sure, but Gengar's newly evolved bulk was clearly a tight fit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, now a certified pudgy powerhouse, struggled to maneuver in the cramped space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, they could manage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if Vulpix and Dratini evolved? The house would definitely feel crowded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe\u8230? it's time to consider moving."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The idea of leaving his current home made Johan feel wistful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But for the sake of his Pok\u233?mon's growth and comfort, it was something he'd have to seriously consider.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ideally, he thought, a place with an attached storefront would be perfect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
