Tinkatuff, thrilled with its new Metal Coat, was hammering away on the balcony.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With its upgraded hammer, it was likely even stronger now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Vulpix, it was sprawled on the bed, diligently studying a Technical Machine to learn {\i
Pain Split}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Occasionally, it let out thoughtful little hums as it nodded in understanding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Dratini?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its biggest challenge at the moment was figuring out how to consume the massive Dragonite scale they'd acquired.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite breaking the scale into smaller pieces, it remained a daunting task for Dratini's delicate teeth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The solution? Take it slow and steady.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ding-ding!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
