With Dratini settled, Johan clapped his hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"All right, breakfast is ready! Finish brushing, and come eat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On his way to the academy, Johan deliberately took the main road, checking out the surrounding areas for potential new housing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finding a good place wasn't something that could be rushed, but Johan wanted to plan ahead, considering the future growth of his Pok\u233?mon and the possibility of adding new team members.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Rustboro Pok\u233?mon Academy's administration building, Johan arrived at the principal's office on the top floor, where he was greeted by the academic director, Martin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan," Martin said warmly, "the principal is expecting you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded, feeling slightly nervous\u8212?it was his first time meeting the enigmatic principal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Knock knock\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Principal, Mr. Johan is here," Martin called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crash! Bang bang\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
