Johan turned to see a burly teenager, about 17 or 18 years old, clad in armor with a horned knight's helmet. The young man's gaze was burning with excitement\u8212?not at Johan but at the Pok\u233?mon beside him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
A battle!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
