Looking at Johan's team\u8212?Gengar, a delicate-looking Vulpix, the tiny Tinkatuff, and the small, seemingly harmless Dratini\u8212?the Tauros trainer had clearly picked his opponent carefully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'So he's not just some hot-blooded kid. He's got a strategy.' Johan thought, amused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
No wonder he's wearing a bull-themed helmet.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Johan decided to send out Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, it's your stage."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wearing its vibrant red armor, Gengar licked its lips before leaping into the cleared space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Would you like to dance too?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
