With a chuckle, Gengar spat out a cloud of dense, purple fog.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The poisonous mist obscured Gengar from sight, and as Tauros inhaled it, a faint purple hue spread across its body\u8212?it was poisoned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tauros, charge through!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The boy's excitement was palpable as he ordered Tauros forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But when Tauros burst through the fog, Gengar was nowhere to be seen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Venoshock."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
BOOM!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A purple explosion erupted behind Tauros, blasting it off its hooves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
