{\i
THUD!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hippowdon collapsed, unconscious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd gasped audibly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"One-hit KO!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What kind of monster is that Gengar?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
