"Hic~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"A little sand won't even touch me!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan glanced at Gengar with a raised eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
How do you even memorize Madara's lines so fast?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the victories continued. If the festival participants were all this... average, Gengar might just go undefeated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
