Steven, in particular, had other plans. Having learned that the nearby Tree of Beginning contained rare fossils, he was itching to start excavating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, the whispers of "thirty wins" had piqued their curiosity\u8212?especially Flannery's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Did you hear that? Thirty consecutive wins! Let's go see who's pulling it off. I want a match with them!" she exclaimed, eager to investigate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven and Roxanne exchanged another look before nodding in agreement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When they reached the packed street, they had to summon Steven's shiny Metagross just to get a better view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As they rose above the crowd, they heard a voice shout:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dratini, Dragon Rush!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A blue dragon-shaped aura enveloped Dratini as it charged downward, slamming into its opponent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
