The resulting shockwave drew gasps from the crowd.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mega Drain is unable to battle! That's win number 39!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The castle guard's raspy but excited announcement rang out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd murmured with astonishment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Unbelievable! That Dratini's Water Gun and Dragon Rush never miss!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That pink little hammer-wielding one? It's a one-hit wonder!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't forget that Vulpix. Everything it touches turns to ice!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From atop Metagross, Roxanne squinted. "That... looks like Professor Johan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven also recognized him and blinked in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
