Before she could call out to him, another voice rang out from below:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll be next!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Down in the street, Johan sighed, glancing at his Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
