Vulpix and Dratini nodded\u8212?they had each fought seven or eight matches and were thoroughly satisfied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, however, was still brimming with energy, while Tinkatuff, chewing on a berry, looked just as eager.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another challenger\u8212?a bearded man with a backpack\u8212?stepped forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan felt exasperated. {\i
They're too enthusiastic!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he couldn't deny the experience was paying off. The Pok\u233?mon's mastery of their moves was visibly improving.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, Tinkatuff\u8212?use Stone Edge. Let's end the day on a high note."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff's hammer struck the ground with force, summoning jagged stones that pierced through the Coalossal before it could react.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd roared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smiled faintly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thanks for the battles, everyone. That's all for today."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
