185: Mew Appears\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Cameran Palace.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside the Pok\u233?mon Center.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan handed his Pok\u233?mon over to Nurse Joy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Gengar and the others hadn't suffered much damage, and Gengar's stamina was still abundant, it was necessary to conduct a thorough recovery and examination after so many battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry, Professor Johan. Leave it to us," Nurse Joy said with a warm smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lucky~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was slightly surprised that Cameran Palace's Nurse Joy recognized him, but he trusted the Pok\u233?mon Center's medical expertise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you," he said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though the royal family had invited them to stay in the castle that evening, Johan decided to stay at the Pok\u233?mon Center to be closer to his team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven and the others chose to stay there as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
The next day.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Cameran Palace Arena.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amid thunderous cheers, the team exhibition matches officially began.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Teams formed by invited trainers and participants gathered at the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since this was just an exhibition, Johan felt no pressure as the team leader. With Steven, Flannery, and Roxanne's capabilities, he had no concerns at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After giving the trio a few instructions, Johan took a seat in the audience.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike traditional inter-university team competitions, where tactics and rotation order were crucial, this event featured all three participants battling simultaneously in a 3v3 format.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Each trainer commanded one Pok\u233?mon at a time, and each had three Pok\u233?mon total. The matches were fast-paced, emphasizing aggressive strategies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was said that these team battles were initially designed to allow people in peaceful times to experience a glimpse of the chaos and destruction of the wars that once plagued the Pok\u233?mon world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battles served as a reminder of the horrors of war and the preciousness of peace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Over time, however, the competition evolved into a performance-oriented spectacle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar raised its hand at a nearby snack vendor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Popcorn!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching the vendor expertly serve snacks, Johan suddenly thought:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
If the Rocket Trio were here with their business skills, they'd probably make a killing at this event.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Next time, should I bring them along for such large-scale events?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The idea of a potential windfall for his caf\u233? made Johan slightly tempted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sir?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The vendor's voice pulled him out of his thoughts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan snapped back to reality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Turning his head, he saw Gengar clutching two giant tubs of popcorn, with Vulpix, Tinkatuff, and Dratini each holding their own.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He sighed but still paid the bill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sir, there are also macarons, cakes, and other desserts over there. If you're interested, feel free to bring your Pok\u233?mon to check them out," the vendor added before leaving.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Turning to his side... the four little ones were gone!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Forget it. It's a rare festival, a rare...," he muttered, trying to console himself, shifting his focus back to the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven didn't send out his shiny Metagross, but even with Aggron alone, he easily dominated the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A soft cry brought Johan's attention back to his side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hm? You came back?" he asked, smiling when he saw Vulpix.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Still the one who cares about me the most."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He patted his lap invitingly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Vulpix's pale blue eyes showed hesitation, curiosity, and doubt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the next moment, Vulpix jumped lightly onto his lap.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After kneading his legs a few times like a cat, it curled up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As someone who knew his Vulpix best, Johan quickly realized something was off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This... didn't seem to be his Vulpix.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To confirm his suspicion, Johan hesitated briefly before placing his hand on its head and gently petting it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The little one closed its eyes in contentment, purring softly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The texture and feel were identical to his Vulpix, yet Johan was more certain than ever\u8212?this wasn't his Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Did someone's Vulpix run off and mistake me for its trainer?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait a minute!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An idea suddenly struck Johan, making his expression turn strange.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He took out a transparent energy cube and offered it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The little one's eyes lit up, its nose twitching as it gobbled up the cube in one bite, cheeks puffing out adorably.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its movements confirmed Johan's suspicion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His own Vulpix would eat energy cubes delicately, taking small bites to avoid choking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was now certain of the identity of the Pok\u233?mon on his lap.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still unaware of its discovery, the little one sniffed curiously at Johan's chest, mimicking Vulpix's behavior.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, its ears perked up, twitching slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, it leaped off Johan's lap and scurried away, disappearing into the crowd.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Taillow soon flew out from another part of the audience.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's Pok\u233?dex lit up, displaying its data:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Mew, the New Species Pok\u233?mon. Psychic-type.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good grief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was indeed the playful shapeshifter!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew was known for its mischievous nature, often transforming into other Pok\u233?mon to interact with children or curious Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While typically lively and curious, Mew sometimes made bold, adventurous decisions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Frowning slightly, Johan muttered to himself:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"With Mew showing up, why do I feel like things are about to get complicated?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar and the others returned, their arms full of snacks, interrupting Johan's thoughts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix jumped onto Johan's lap, curling up in its usual spot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet, it quickly stood up, sniffing the air suspiciously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Why does it smell like another Pok\u233?mon was here?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stiffened, clearing his throat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, wow! Look at Steven's Aggron\u8212?so brave!" he exclaimed, feigning excitement as he furiously petted Vulpix's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The vigorous head rub left Vulpix dazed and forgetful of its earlier suspicion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match continued smoothly, with Steven's team soon advancing to the semifinals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Compared to last night, this feels like bullying kids," Johan muttered under his breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And now, let us congratulate the team from Hoenn's Rustboro Pok\u233?mon Academy\u8212?Team Johan\u8212?for their triumphant victory in the team exhibition match!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fireworks exploded as the host's enthusiastic voice announced the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Team Johan?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
When did they name the team?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Johan wasn't surprised by their victory\u8212?Steven alone could sweep most opponents\u8212?the name caught him off guard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the crowd dispersed, Johan and his team exited the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor, here are the medal and trophy!" Flannery said, handing him the items excitedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking them, Johan turned and pried open Gengar's mouth, shoving the medal and trophy inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar blinked in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We'll have the principal put them in a display case," Johan explained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor, those are trophies and medals, not certificates!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine, then put them in the showcase."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now that's more like it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With laughter and chatter, the group left the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor, since we won, shouldn't you treat us?" Flannery asked, rubbing her stomach.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course," Johan replied with a sly smile, pointing to a nearby food stall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They have 'Rage Buns.' Eat as much as you want."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flannery puffed up her cheeks indignantly, hands on her hips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor, you're so stingy!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven and Roxanne chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though both were relatively reserved, having someone like Flannery to lighten the mood was a welcome change.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, young man!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the food stall, a muscular man called out, his eyes lighting up when he spotted Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
