"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar floated over immediately, its interest piqued.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You want one?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bruno asked, unphased by Gengar's fearsome grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar nodded eagerly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Good!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bruno laughed heartily, clearly pleased by Gengar's enthusiasm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ten minutes later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sitting on a nearby bench, Johan and the others watched Gengar and Bruno, now walking side by side with arms slung around each other's shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor, Gengar sure can eat," Flannery remarked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eye twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
*Can eat? If there were an eating competition, Gengar would probably out-eat\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
a Snorlax.*\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Honestly, if I hadn't seen it myself, I'd never believe the Kanto Fighting-type Elite Four would buddy up with a Gengar," Roxanne added.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
