In the grand banquet hall, Johan stared at the Lucario, its eyes tightly shut, emanating an aura of intense frustration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, he turned to look at Gengar, who was awkwardly grinning and trying to sneak back to his side unnoticed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
