Giratina was known to observe the Pok\u233?mon world through reflective surfaces like mirrors, water, or glass. A smartphone screen could technically serve the same purpose.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But why {\i
Gengar's} phone?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was it because Gengar often cosplayed as Giratina?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
...Actually, that wasn't impossible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan let out a long sigh, resigned to the absurdity of it all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The screen shimmered briefly before displaying a single line of text:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Young Man]: You're welcome.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...What?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
