Then it hit him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
The self-proclaimed 'Destroyer' who wanted to 'take back what's his'... That was Giratina?!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recalled how Giratina had introduced itself in their first online conversation, declaring itself the "Master of Destruction" with a slew of dramatic titles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the time, Johan had dismissed it as the ramblings of an edgy teenager.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What's worse, Giratina had {\i
believed} him when he suggested it find a hobby, like watching TV dramas or training Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was that why it started "mentoring" Gengar?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan inhaled deeply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be fair, after dealing with Mewtwo, Giratina wasn't as much of a shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, how did he keep attracting these legendary Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least Giratina was currently stuck in the Distortion World. As long as Dialga and Palkia didn't mess with spacetime, and Shaymin wasn't captured, it should stay that way...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah," Gengar said, tugging Johan's sleeve.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
