Before he could ponder further, a sudden sense of danger surged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar stepped forward, shielding Johan as it conjured a swirling {\i
