Gengar hurled the {\i
Shadow Ball} without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lucaa!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucario deftly deflected the attack with an {\i
Aura Sphere}, the two energies colliding in a loud {\i
boom}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The commotion brought the banquet to an abrupt halt as everyone turned to look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan?" Steven frowned, reaching for a Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Queen Ilene raised her hand, her voice calm but firm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lucario, stop this! Look around you\u8212?this is no place for battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucario hesitated, its gaze flickering to the surroundings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When it locked eyes with Gengar, who grinned maliciously while juggling two more {\i
Shadow Balls}, it froze in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[That Aura... It's gone?]}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucario's expression shifted to one of bewilderment as it took in its surroundings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Where... Where am I? And... Aaron! Why did he run? Why?!]}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, put it to sleep," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar closed the distance in an instant, locking eyes with Lucario.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its gaze rippled hypnotically, and Lucario's body swayed under the effects of {\i
Hypnosis}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stepped closer, his voice low and soothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sleep now..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a soft {\i
thud}, Lucario collapsed, succumbing to slumber.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the room erupted into murmurs, Johan rubbed his temples again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Thanks, Giratina. Really. Thanks for waking up this mess.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, elsewhere in the hall...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The playful Mythical Pok\u233?mon froze mid-air, sensing an ominous, dark Aura.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was far more distinct and menacing than what Lucario had perceived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu?" Vulpix tilted her head, puzzled by Mew's sudden shift in demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew hesitated only for a moment before its body glowed with a kaleidoscope of colors.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a flash of light, it vanished on the spot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dratini returned moments later, carrying a plate of desserts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Driii?! (*\u12444?\u12525?\u12444?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Where's Mew?!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix's expression turned serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was Mew in trouble?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry," Johan reassured Queen Ilene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's just disoriented. Give it some time, and it'll recover."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The queen nodded, trusting Johan's expertise as a Pok\u233?mon psychologist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sir, is everything alright?" Steven approached with Roxanne and Flannery in tow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan waved them off. "It's fine. Just a little misunderstanding."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
