A thousand years ago, a devastating war swept across regions, with Cameran Palace and the Tree of Beginning caught in the chaos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sir Aaron, the original Hero of Aura, sacrificed his life to transfer all his Aura to Mew, who then used it to halt the war.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To protect Lucario, Aaron sealed it within his staff, leaving behind a cryptic message: {\i
I will not return once I leave the castle.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucario had interpreted this as desertion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without Ash present to inadvertently trigger the same drama as in the movie, Johan had assumed Lucario's seal would remain undisturbed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
But no... Giratina just had to meddle.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed, glancing at Lucario's still-slumbering form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its misunderstandings would never be resolved unless it learned the truth about Aaron's sacrifice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Vulpix, help it out," Johan instructed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu?" Vulpix trotted over, her demeanor slightly distracted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What's wrong?" Johan asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix explained how Mew had suddenly disappeared after sensing something frightening.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Mew... Another mischievous little troublemaker.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Mewtwo knew its genetic blueprint came from such a playful Pok\u233?mon, it would probably be speechless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under Vulpix's {\i
Hypnosis}, Lucario's tense expression gradually eased.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Outside, Tinkatuff stood alone on the palace balcony, eyeing a massive, gleaming blue crystal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its grip tightened around its hammer as it tilted its head in contemplation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Is this thing metal? Could I forge it into my hammer?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It looked expensive.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff's eyes lit up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Only one way to find out!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just as it raised its hammer, the crystal's surface shimmered with dark red veins spreading ominously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Wait, I didn't even hit it yet!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
