The basic effects of awakened Aura Power included enhanced physicality, reaction speed, and sensory acuity, as well as improved sight and hearing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At higher levels, abilities like night vision, Aura perception, and even full sensory awareness emerged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
