"Don't let me catch you slipping\u8212?I'll challenge you one day!" she muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rubbed his temples, exasperated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
This spiky little hedgehog\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If she kept pushing him, he might just bring Mewtwo around to teach her a lesson about the vastness of psychic power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
The Next Day}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the Tree of Beginning's summit, Mew happily played with Vulpix, Gengar, Dratini, and the others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar popped out of the shadows, pulling a goofy face at Mew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Meeww~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew froze momentarily before bursting into laughter, twirling in midair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar scratched its head, sipping milk tea as a puzzled expression crossed its face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Does this kitten have a screw loose?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Vulpix approached Mew to seek advice on using {\b
Aurora Veil}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew tilted its head thoughtfully, then conjured a transparent barrier with a wave of its paw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Vulpix shook its head. That was {\b
Light Screen}, not what it wanted to learn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew, thinking it was part of the game, spun happily in circles instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Elsewhere, Johan was busy setting up {\b
Mew's Happy House}, assisted by Tinkatuff, Aggron, Metagross, Garchomp, Lucario, and others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thanks to Steven's pre-made setup, the assembly was quick and simple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gaming consoles, televisions, smartphones, and other electronics filled the space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Internet wasn't necessary\u8212?everything ran on downloaded single-player games or preloaded TV shows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for power?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Electric-type Pok\u233?mon living nearby could handle that, or Mew itself could generate electricity with its moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Happy House also included a Mew-themed slide, cradle, and other childlike toys\u8212?fitting for Mew's playful, childlike nature.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its favorite? A small exercise wheel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside it, Mew gleefully ran like a tiny hamster.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, no house would be complete without snacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Small refrigerators and shelves were stocked with treats, ensuring Mew's transformation into the ultimate homebody.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just don't let it meet Mewtwo," Johan mused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
The last thing I need is Mew undoing all of Mewtwo's hard-won character growth\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as the Happy House was ready, Mew darted inside eagerly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With impressive dexterity, it retrieved a soda from the fridge and a bag of chips from the shelf.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Curling up on its plush sofa, it began watching {\b
Bubble Piplup Adventures} with great enthusiasm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a moment, Johan couldn't help but wonder:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Is Mew trolling me?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Back in Cameran Palace}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To thank everyone for their efforts, Johan treated the group\u8212?and their Pok\u233?mon\u8212?to a hearty meal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It nearly bankrupted him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aggron and Garchomp, in particular, devoured food like black holes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Afterward, the group shared stories of their adventures and exchanged experiences, with Johan finally getting a good look at Caitlin's peculiar Duosion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He offered precise diagnoses and suggestions for its unique evolutionary quirks, which Caitlin accepted with rare humility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Have you been overloading your Duosion with too much psychic energy?" Johan asked pointedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't entirely her fault\u8212?her immense psychic power was difficult to control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, the issue wasn't severe. Once Duosion evolved, it would likely stabilize.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, Johan advised Caitlin to prioritize rest and relaxation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the day wound down, Steven set off to explore the mineral deposits around the Tree of Beginning with Mew's permission.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, their Pok\u233?mon engaged in various activities:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Gengar and Garchomp} huddled in a corner, giggling like fanboys as they binge-watched {\i
Bubble Piplup Adventures.}{\b
Vulpix and Cynthia's Eevee} sparred with {\i
Iron Tail,} the resounding clangs leaving Johan apprehensive.{\b
Dratini and Milotic} struck up an unlikely camaraderie, prompting Dratini to wonder if they were distant relatives.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By evening, the group strolled through Cameran Palace one last time, basking in the festival's lingering charm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't a particularly busy day, but it was fulfilling nonetheless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On a sunny Tuesday morning, Johan confirmed that Mew was thoroughly immersed in its games and shows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He felt a slight pang of guilt.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Am I corrupting an innocent child?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But at least Mew wouldn't feel so lonely anymore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With everything in order, it was time to return home.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
