195: Gengar: \u8220?What the heck, he actually pulled it off!\u8221? (BONUS)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Private Airstrip on the Outskirts of Cameran Palace}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Young Miss, Miss Cynthia, the plane will be ready to depart in about an hour."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An elderly butler in a tailored uniform spoke respectfully to Cynthia and Caitlin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since Cynthia's work exploring ruins wasn't finished yet, she needed to return to Unova with Caitlin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
