Unova was far away, so preparing the plane required extra time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Steven's plane, it was ready long ago, but his gentlemanly nature compelled him to wait until the ladies departed before leaving himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you visiting Mr. Drayden of Opelucid City?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing Cynthia's plans, Johan raised an eyebrow in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know him?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, he's the Dragon-type Gym Leader of Opelucid City, headmaster of Opelucid Academy\u8212?who {\i
wouldn't} know of him? Of course, he doesn't know me," Johan replied with a casual shrug and a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia nodded thoughtfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Drayden doesn't know Johan?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not necessarily, she thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Drayden discovered something with significant historical value and reached out to my grandmother for insight. She asked me to go check it out for her," Cynthia explained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked, then teased: "So you decided to make a quick detour to Cameran Palace while heading to Opelucid City?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia gave him a playful wink, but didn't answer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her words sparked a thought in Johan's mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Drayden found something historical... could it be?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan, battle me!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin suddenly interjected, clenching her little fists, her cheeks slightly flushed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her psychic energy stirred around her, causing her golden locks to float as if in a breeze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Finally, a chance!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're adorable, Caitlin," Cynthia said with a soft smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan cast Cynthia a sidelong glance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Are you serious right now? Where's this sour jealousy vibe coming from?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be fair, Caitlin did resemble an elegant porcelain doll when she was upset.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"W-well, not really!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin's fierce expression melted into bashful embarrassment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But when she noticed Johan's bemused look, her eyes narrowed again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Floating up into the air, she gazed down at him imperiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So? What do you say?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled and replied with a simple: "Sure."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Cynthia and Steven looked at him in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In their experience, Johan wasn't one to casually accept battle challenges. He wasn't exactly a battle junkie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Caitlin could speak, Johan added:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How about this? The loser owes the winner a favor. Deal?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin smirked, her gaze briefly flicking to Cynthia before returning to Johan with determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
So this is a fight for Cynthia!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her conviction was palpable, though Johan had no idea why. He let her believe whatever she wanted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine!" she declared. "But give it your all\u8212?I don't want to yawn mid-battle out of boredom. Got it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rubbed his chin thoughtfully before responding:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Noted. But let's be honest, there's a clear gap in our strength."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Caitlin chose to disregard the rules, he'd have to resort to some "unsporting" measures.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, Caitlin's pride made her susceptible to provocation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Quiet!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She huffed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This lady aims for a {\i
graceful} victory."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Graceful, huh? You're addicted to arrogance.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
The Battle Begins}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On an open grassy field near the airstrip:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Bronzong!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin sent out her Psychic/Steel Pok\u233?mon with an air of confidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, you're up," Johan said calmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Against a Psychic-type opponent, Gengar was the obvious choice, even if Bronzong was immune to Poison-type moves due to its Steel typing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar emerged from the shadows with a sinister grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin seemed unsurprised by his choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What she didn't know was that Johan had also anticipated her selection.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Begin!" Roxanne declared as referee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Trick." Johan's voice was calm and measured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation, Gengar stood its ground, beginning to gather an unsettling energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just a heartbeat later:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Hum\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ancient Bronzong emitted a faint vibration, and a dark, rectangular barrier expanded outward, enclosing the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Trick Room.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin blinked in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
What kind of opening is that?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Trick Room on Bronzong was standard for setting up slower Pok\u233?mon, but opening with a stat-boosting move like {\i
Nasty Plot} on Gengar? Risky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wasn't he afraid of being hit and fainting immediately?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For the first time, Caitlin felt a strange sensation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Did he predict my move?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Psychic like her... being outmaneuvered?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Johan knew what Caitlin was thinking, he'd probably roll his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Bronzong's options were hardly endless: Trick Room, Calm Mind, Iron Defense, and maybe a Psychic-type move like Future Sight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Knowing that, leading with Gengar's {\i
Nasty Plot} was almost always a safe bet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And once Johan saw Bronzong's stats in his Pok\u233?dex, his confidence solidified further.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin shook off her surprise and refocused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if Gengar had boosted its Special Attack, Trick Room had flipped the speed advantage in her favor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Use Psychic!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Bronzong let out a deep, metallic hum as its Psychic energy surged, forming a sharp arrow aimed at Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, Sucker Punch," Johan ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark energy enveloped Gengar as it launched a surprise attack, bypassing the Trick Room effect to strike first.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its shadowy figure darted behind Bronzong and delivered a vicious blow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
CLANG!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait\u8212?what?" Caitlin was stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Who uses a physical move after boosting Special Attack?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She quickly regained her composure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bronzong, Gyro Ball!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But before Bronzong could act, Gengar had already charged another move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shadow Ball!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's voice cut through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A swirling, ominous orb formed in Gengar's hands and shot toward Bronzong with incredible force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The powered-up Shadow Ball collided with Bronzong just as it moved to counterattack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When the dust settled, Bronzong was down. The Trick Room field dissipated with its defeat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match had ended faster than Caitlin could process.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Aftermath}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin stared in disbelief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
I lost?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She struggled to accept it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
I only lose to Cynthia!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Worse, this meant...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had lost Cynthia?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her psychic energy surged uncontrollably, rippling outward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Caitlin!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's voice cut through her distress.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing it, Caitlin's power subsided.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She turned to Cynthia, tears welling in her eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, meanwhile, walked over with Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin braced herself for some triumphant proclamation of victory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Instead, Johan handed her a notebook.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Here."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"My condition is that you follow the methods in this book to better control your psychic powers," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin blinked in confusion, then opened the notebook.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"These are..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The notes were techniques Johan had acquired from Sabrina to help stabilize psychic energy. They had worked for Vulpix, so they might help Caitlin too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why?" she asked, still dazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shoved his hands in his pockets, tilted his head back at a dramatic angle, and sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're strong, but you're not using your psychic powers properly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And as a Pok\u233?mon psychologist, I have a duty to help my 'patients.'"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roxanne, Flannery, Steven, and Cynthia all looked at Johan with newfound admiration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Gengar...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It bared its teeth in a wry grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
What the heck, he actually pulled it off!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
On the Plane to Unova}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin curled up like a kitten on Cynthia's lap, mumbling softly:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cynthia... sometimes I wonder if I'm good at anything... if I can do anything right..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia smiled warmly and gently stroked Caitlin's hair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Didn't Johan say you're strong?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin sniffled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thinking of Johan made her angry at first, but then she remembered how much effort he had put into helping her Duosion...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine, I'll forgive him... this time!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia chuckled and ruffled Caitlin's hair playfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had earned her trust, even if he made her cry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flipping through the notebook, Caitlin muttered under her breath:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's... not so bad, actually..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Isn't he?" Cynthia replied with a knowing smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
