{\qc
196: Meowth and Pichu (BONUS)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The four-day work trip came to an end.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After bidding farewell to Cynthia, Johan boarded a Devon Corporation plane and returned to the Hoenn region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia, meanwhile, had to continue her unfinished ruins exploration, and so she and Caitlin headed back to Unova together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their trip to Cameran Palace for the festival? Strictly speaking, it was a bit of a getaway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, they'd accomplished something significant: saving the Tree of Beginning and setting up a "Dreamscape Playhouse" for the legendary Mew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Back at Johan's Caf\u233?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Word of Johan's return had reached the Rocket Trio. Under the temporary leadership of Wobbuffet (as acting "boss"), they eagerly awaited his arrival at the caf\u233? entrance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cad... Cadre... {\i
Waaah!}" Jessie began, but James and Meowth quickly tackled her, clamping her mouth shut.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Together, they greeted Johan enthusiastically:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Welcome back, Johan-sensei! And you too, Boss Gengar! Thank you for all your hard work, nya!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stoof! ({\i
salutes dramatically})"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wobbuffet, wearing its usual bear cap and suspenders, gave a sharp salute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the trio, Johan suddenly remembered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Oh, right... I kinda forgot about them.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Is the house still intact?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced past them, eyeing the caf\u233? and living quarters behind it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To his relief, both seemed unscathed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, now wearing sunglasses, crossed its arms in a display of mock authority.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan-sensei, per your instructions, I've been working on new dessert recipes! Please try them!" James eagerly presented his creations.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Jessie quickly followed, offering a cup of coffee:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And here's your coffee, Johan-sensei!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And the earnings report, nya! Here's the revenue for the past few days!" Meowth chimed in, holding up the books.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm. Not bad," Johan said with a nod of approval.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The trio's faces lit up with joy, immediately lost in fantasies of promotion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Could it finally be our turn to be acting boss?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dock them 500 Pok\u233?dollars."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their daydreams shattered instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trio: {\i
(\u9583?\u176?\u9633?\u176?)\u9583?\u65077? \u9531?\u9473?\u9531? (in fantasy)} \par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
 Trio: {\i
(\u9573?_\u9573?) (Why does this always happen to us?)}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, sir..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan settled into his chair, Wobbuffet waddled over and began massaging his shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stoof! Stoof~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled. "Good work, Wobbuffet. You've managed things well."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stoof!! ({\i
blushes furiously, vibrating with excitement})"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine. I won't dock your pay."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan-sensei, you're the best!" they cheered in unison.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flipping through the earnings report, Johan smiled in satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
See? As long as they're not chasing Pikachu, they're geniuses in any field.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, just managing a caf\u233? seemed like a waste of their talents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
What else could I have them do?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And yet...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without their classic {\i
"What a horrible feeling!"} antics, something just felt missing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Oh well, maybe inspiration will strike later.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
A Week Later}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On a crisp, sunny day perfect for drying laundry, Johan decided to air out his bedding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Having spent days away, and considering how often Vulpix's cold air froze his blankets stiff, they could definitely use some sunshine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Gengar's help, he set up makeshift drying poles in the yard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The once-green lawn had begun to yellow with the season, but bright orange flowers dotted the grass, adding a touch of vitality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is shaping up to be a harsh winter," Johan mused as he and Gengar lightly dusted the blankets with bamboo beaters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar gave him a thumbs-up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
