They'd seen Pok\u233?mon evolve before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this\u8230? this glow was far too intense!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Half the beach was lit up, and those closer felt as though it were daytime.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When a trainer gives their all, a Pok\u233?mon responds in kind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Perhaps this is the benefit of bonds forged through encounters, trust, and inseparable companionship between humans and Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, part of it was due to the deep energy Dratini had accumulated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the radiant glow, Johan closed his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Through his Aura, he could feel the surging power within Dratini's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some of it was accumulated before Johan caught it, but much of it was gained after joining him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the top-tier Pok\u233?blocks to the Dragonite scale, to Johan's daily care and training\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had a thought that made his expression change.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh no.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Dratini's unusual blend of luck and misfortune\u8230? could something go wrong now?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it seemed he was overthinking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dratini never faltered in critical moments.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, it should be called\u8230? {\b
Dragonair!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the glow faded, an ethereal, melodious cry echoed through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And there it was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A sleek, elegant Pok\u233?mon covered in sapphire-like scales, with a small horn on its forehead and feathery wings on either side of its head. Around its neck and tail were three crystal-like orbs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moonlight fell gently on its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its wings fluttered slightly, growing larger with each movement. With graceful, rhythmic motions, it began to fly!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragon Pok\u233?mon, {\b
Dragonair!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The evolved form of Dratini!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu Chu?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff gawked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flying\u8230? it's flying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed like Dragonair was one step closer to being a Dragon Knight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I think its body length is almost six meters," Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ordinary Dragonair were about four meters long, but his Dratini seemed to have reached nearly six meters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what truly surprised him was its ability to fly right after evolving.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whether Dragonair could fly had always been a topic of debate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some said Dragonair couldn't fly because it had no wings (the tiny ones didn't count).\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Others claimed to have seen Dragonair soaring through the skies, even manipulating the weather.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan knew that Dragonair's ability to fly depended on one move\u8212?{\b
Dragon Dance.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the anime, there was a place called Dragonite Paradise on a vast ocean where many Dragonite, Dragonair, and Dratini lived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some of the Dragonair there could fly because they had mastered Dragon Dance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fact that his Dragonair could fly immediately after evolving proved it had learned the move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Dragonair entry in Johan's Pok\u233?dex confirmed this as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I wish I could send a photo to Cynthia's Garchomp," Johan muttered to himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Click\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he finished, Gengar had already snapped a photo with its phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, under Johan's stunned gaze, it swiftly sent the picture to Cynthia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Afterward, it gave Johan a smug look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but give it a thumbs-up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You're bold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Next time Garchomp comes for you, don't drag me into it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After joyfully flying a lap in the night sky, the newly evolved Dragonair returned to Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Thud\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And pounced right onto him, pinning him to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
