Since the Pok\u233?mon had expressed their desire to take a cruise, Johan, who had already completed his teaching duties and had nothing else to do, naturally agreed to their request.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, they were aboard the {\i
S.S. Rapidash} cruise ship, heading toward Cinnabar Island, located in the southernmost part of the Kanto region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
