Even the power of its Hydro Pump had greatly increased.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this point, it could hardly be called a Hydro Pump\u8212?it was more like a {\b
"Water Release: Who Broke the Dam?!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Coupled with the newly learned {\i
