"Draaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonair seemed a bit apologetic about what had happened to Raticate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its recent evolution had left it a little too excited, and it had lost control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This drew a round of knowing laughter from Johan and his Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Battles are like this."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They'd work on control gradually through training.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
