"Oowu~~ (//\u9661?//)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Pok\u233?mon thought their shopping trip was over, but Johan wasn't done yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Since we're buying gifts, we should get something for everyone."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Poor wallet: {\i
