As if my luck could ever hit that 30%.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless, of course, Dragonair was the one using it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unfortunately, Dragonair couldn't learn {\i
Rock Slide}\u8212?at least not until it evolved into Dragonite. For now, Johan decided to give it to Tinkatuff.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
