With its reputation as an adventurer's haven, the forest entrances were equipped with Pok\u233?mon Centers to handle emergencies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After their battle, Johan and Flint both had Pok\u233?mon that needed tending to. Flint also temporarily abandoned his camping plans.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the familiar healing tune played in the Pok\u233?mon Center's lobby, they stepped inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unsurprisingly...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Miss Joy, allow me to introduce myself! I am Flint\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
WHAM!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could even react, Flint\u8212?who had just grabbed Joy's hand\u8212?was struck squarely on the head by a club thicker than a human thigh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The assailant?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
