Johan's eyes flicked to the counter, where a second club\u8212?this one with an exposed handle\u8212?rested ominously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Fair enough. A lone boy out in the wild needs to protect himself.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
