"Lucky~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed. "It's no trouble."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As his gaze landed on Flint, now sprawled on the floor and twitching, Johan's lips twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This here is Flint, Pewter Gym's Leader," he said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
