{\i
Is my reputation really bigger than his here?} Johan wondered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Chansey tended to Johan's Pok\u233?mon, he kept a close eye on it, silently marveling at the sheer disparity between its cutesy demeanor and brutal combat prowess.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Later, after their Pok\u233?mon were treated and checked, Nurse Joy handed Dragonair over for a relaxing spa session.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint, meanwhile, remained unconscious on the floor, his twitching growing faint.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While watching Chansey slap Dragonair with expert massage techniques, Johan's Pok\u233?dex lit up with a data entry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
[Chansey]}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Type}: Normal\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Ability}: Serene Grace\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Moves Known}: Charm, Wish, Sweet Kiss, Minimize, Rock Slide, Heal Bell, Calm Mind, Egg Bomb, Assist Power...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Serene Grace and Rock Slide?} Johan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He turned to Joy. "Can I ask you something?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why not have Chansey fight off intruders instead of, uh\u8230?" he gestured to the club.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Joy and Chansey blinked in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fight? Chansey?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For most people, Chansey was synonymous with healing and support\u8212?not battling. Its weak offensive stats and association with Nurse Joys only reinforced that perception.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
This must be what they mean by ingrained stereotypes,} Johan thought, scratching his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Want me to show you?" Johan offered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Show me?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Joy's eyes sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Minutes later. Pok\u233?mon Center's Outdoor Arena.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint stood on one side of the arena, still groggy but excited. Opposite him, Joy and Chansey faced off nervously, with Johan coaching from the sidelines.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flint, just a demonstration\u8212?don't take it too seriously," Johan called.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Understood!" Flint grinned, releasing a {\b
Rhyhorn} onto the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match began, and Flint started his introduction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Miss Joy, allow me to\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
CRASH!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Flint could finish, Chansey summoned a {\b
Rock Slide} that pummeled Rhyhorn, leaving it flinching and unable to act.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint: "???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smirked from the sidelines. "Rock Slide with Serene Grace. Don't underestimate it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The match continued, with Chansey using {\b
Snatch} to steal Rhyhorn's stat boosts from {\b
Swords Dance}, followed by {\b
