Johan massaged his temples. {\i
It's always the lucky ones who think this strategy is foolproof.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the end of the demonstration, Rhyhorn was reduced to a trembling wreck, while Flint stood in stunned silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I-I\u8230?" Flint stammered. "What just happened?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Joy and Chansey happened," Johan quipped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For the final blow, Chansey used {\b
Assist Power}, dealing a surprisingly effective hit thanks to its boosted stats.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Flint's Rhyhorn fainted, Johan couldn't help but feel a pang of sympathy for it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Who would've thought the most dangerous thing here wasn't Flint's recklessness but Joy's newfound confidence?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
