{\qc
223: The Plump Cat, Mew, and the Lost Soul\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rain that had fallen throughout the night stopped the next morning, but the temperature had dropped significantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For Johan, though, a slight chill like this was nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Between Gengar's frequent {\i
licks}, which seemed to make him immune to paralysis, and his natural resilience to cold, Johan believed his resistance to cold weather was his true superpower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That said, given winter's approach, Johan still threw on a hoodie before dragging his Pok\u233?mon out of bed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, lead the team\u8212?brush your teeth! Let's go!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
