The Pok\u233?mon all perked up at the mention of the beach.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Truth be told, despite spending so much time in Rustboro City, Johan had rarely visited the local shores.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, plans were made to be broken.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just as Johan packed everything for the day\u8212?lunchboxes, picnic blankets, fruit juice, and Moomoo Milk\u8212?a {\i
little visitor} appeared at the caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
