And not just any Eevee\u8212?it was a {\b
slightly chubby Eevee}!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Eevee curiously padded around the caf\u233?, stepping on the soft cushions before hopping onto the counter. It pawed at the glass jars and utensils, producing a series of crisp, clinking sounds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The noise caught Gengar's attention.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Poking its head through the ceiling like a phantom, Gengar peered down and froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When it saw the chubby Eevee on the counter, it hesitated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee~~(\u65377?\u65381?\u969?\u65381?\u65377?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Eevee, completely unbothered, waved cheerfully at Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar scratched its head, a faint sense of familiarity tugging at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, Johan also walked downstairs to check the commotion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When he spotted the Eevee licking its paws atop the counter, his heart skipped a beat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That feeling...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could speak, the Eevee took two bounding steps and leapt straight into his arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Feeling its soft weight, Johan smiled wryly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You've gotten chubbier, haven't you, Mew?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The chubby Eevee looked surprised that Johan had recognized it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it soon giggled, covering its mouth. A flash of white light surrounded it as its form shimmered and transformed back into its true self\u8212?{\b
Mew}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~ Mew~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure enough, it was Mew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thanks to his Aura powers, Johan could sense the familiar energy radiating from it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew's ability to transform wasn't limited to appearances\u8212?even its Aura signature could change.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If not for the fact that Johan's Aura had awakened through Mew's help, he might not have recognized it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised an eyebrow as he stared at the slightly plumper Mew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Have I really turned Mew into a housecat?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A tender smile crossed Johan's face. Holding the rounder, fluffier Mew, he couldn't resist pressing his face into its soft belly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The plush little Mew was even more huggable now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite its smooth appearance, Mew was covered in a fine layer of fur, making it incredibly satisfying to pet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~ Mew~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blushing slightly, Mew squirmed in Johan's arms before giving up and settling down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"W-wooo?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix appeared at the top of the stairs, stunned by the scene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
