Meanwhile, Gengar was busy downloading movies and games for Mew on her phone, handling the process with the skill of a tech professional.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew had come here not only because it missed Johan, Gengar, and the others, but also because...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had run out of games to play and shows to watch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, the World Tree didn't have Wi-Fi.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Feeling Vulpix's occasional jealous glances, Johan rubbed his temples.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Caught red-handed cuddling Mew.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem." Johan cleared his throat. "Gengar, download this episode for Mew, too."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He handed Gengar his phone, which contained the unreleased first episode of {\i
Meowth and Pichu}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar nodded confidently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
