Satisfied with its haul, Gengar put on its sunglasses and struck a pose, its body now glowing faintly from the consumed fireflies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sight sent the others into peals of laughter, including Mew, who rolled on the ground, clutching its sides.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
