Amid the gasps and murmurs of nearby onlookers, a young woman with curled orange ponytails, stylish glasses perched on her forehead, and a chic brown coat staggered out of the car. Her makeup was impeccable, but her movements betrayed a hint of clumsiness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
