{\qc
228: A Sigh of Relief, and Then... Despair\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mountains, rivers, towns, and plains swept past the horizon, blurring into one mesmerizing panorama.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
