fast}. Too fast. The stones Tinkatuff had flung had missed completely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Defeated, it resigned itself to sitting still, hammer in hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
