If one of those stones had hit its wing, it might've shed feathers. And if it had struck its head... well, the thought was too grim to entertain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The driver, however, remained impressively calm, betraying no hint of alarm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
