It wasn't hard to imagine why.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luckily, Johan's Tinkatuff was strong\u8212?too strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If this Corviknight hadn't been skilled, it might have ended up grounded and plucked bald.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After what felt like an eternity, the driver called out, "We're almost there!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ahead, a sprawling island came into view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
The Isle of Armor.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The island's size was impressive, featuring forests, wetlands, dunes, caves, and a variety of wild Pok\u233?mon habitats.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without adequate strength, wandering freely here could be perilous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, perched against the window, pointed to the island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two towering structures loomed in the distance, one to the east and the other to the west.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Approaching from the west, the western tower was more visible. From afar, the sound of rushing water could be faintly heard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The eastern tower, shrouded in black mist, was less distinct.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The driver chuckled, noticing Johan's curiosity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Those are the Towers of Two Fists. The western one is the Tower of Waters, and the eastern one is the Tower of Darkness. Each teaches a different martial art."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The Tower of Waters practices the 'Rapid-Strike Style,' focusing on seamless, continuous attacks like flowing water or crashing waves, with each strike more powerful than the last."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The Tower of Darkness emphasizes the 'Single-Strike Style,' favoring devastating, one-hit blows that end battles in an instant."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff's eyes gleamed as it pointed toward the Tower of Darkness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan gave a small nod of understanding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The renowned Elite Four member Bruno had once suggested that Tinkatuff might benefit from studying the Single-Strike Style.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, too, was familiar with the towers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Each corresponded to a specific evolution for Kubfu\u8212?either the Rapid-Strike Urshifu from the Tower of Waters or the Single-Strike Urshifu from the Tower of Darkness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu was one of Mustard's signature Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Leon, Mustard's prot\u233?g\u233?, hadn't inherited his master's martial expertise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rumor had it Leon once got lost trying to find the towers with his Kubfu, derailing the entire training process.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Classic Leon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar suddenly produced its phone, swiping to a picture of a younger Mustard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the photo, Mustard stood proudly with two imposing Urshifu\u8212?one on either side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other Pok\u233?mon crowded around, expressions serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chu."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkatuff muttered, seemingly impressed by the strength the Urshifu radiated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
