At the same time, Dragonair unleashed a torrent of water, sweeping Heatmor off its feet and dousing its flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowu!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vulpix fired an Ice Beam, freezing the poacher and the captive Snover in a block of ice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
