{\i
"I want to flee, but I can't."}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Add Kubfu's opportunistic {\i
toll collector} nature and Tinkaton's {\i
sticky fingers}, and it wouldn't just be impossible to escape\u8212?hiding possessions would be futile, too!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
The New Unlawful Trio} would make their grand debut.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, Johan hadn't sleep-talked, and Gengar had remained unusually well-behaved for the night, likely drained from recent travels.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
