The thought was both thrilling and terrifying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shaking off these musings, Johan stretched and got out of bed. Pulling open the curtains, he was greeted by the chilly embrace of winter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Frost sparkled on the streets, and a hazy condensation fogged the windows. Though snow hadn't fallen, the growing chill hinted that it was only a matter of time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
