Before Johan even got out of his room, the siblings had already cleaned both the upstairs living quarters and the caf\u233? downstairs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeedee's Psychic powers made household chores a breeze:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
