With two Psychic Pok\u233?mon in the mix, the caf\u233? was spotless in record time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet, Johan couldn't help noticing something peculiar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sister's Psychic power was leagues ahead of her brother's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, Gengar and Vulpix privately confided to Johan that her Psychic strength might even surpass Vulpix's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The realization left Johan slightly dazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
