"They're absolutely adorable!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan watched the siblings handle their work with grace, he nodded in satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Outside in the backyard, Johan tended to his special radish seedlings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar crouched near the bed containing the "Spirit Cloth" soil, excitedly pointing at a sprout poking through the earth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
