Inwardly, however, he began contemplating ways to further enhance the crop's growth rate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe... I need a little help from a certain crown-wearing Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Far away, in Galar's Crown Tundra, a peculiar Pok\u233?mon resembling a white rabbit sneezed, rubbing its nose before settling back into a deep slumber.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
