267: Let\u8217?s Show Off for Once!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Be careful.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan prepared to open the scroll gifted by Agatha, Ninetales immediately warned him to stay cautious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's fine," Johan reassured her with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ka-kah had already checked it earlier. Slowly unfurling the scroll, Johan discovered it contained Agatha's expertise in training Gengar and similar Ghost Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike the broader advice given in the {\i
Fear Guide} sent by Lance, this scroll focused solely on maximizing Gengar's potential.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
