It had once hesitated about Johan's "Perish Strategy," as the move risked taking itself out along with opponents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now, Ka-kah had a new perspective: if it could target an entire group instead of just one...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ka-kah laughed with glee, hands on its hips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finally, it could show off its singing prowess!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ha..." Johan rubbed his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Other Pok\u233?mon sing for money; his Gengar sings to take lives.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As he read further down the scroll, Johan's gaze sharpened. Without a word, he prepared to close the scroll.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next move listed was {\i
Spectral Trickery}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
**[{\i
Spectral Trickery: Power 110. Detects the target's held item and uses it against them.}]**\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Ka-kah mastered this alongside Tinkaton's {\i
Thief}, opponents' items wouldn't just be stolen\u8212?they'd be weaponized. It would be too dirty a trick even by Johan's standards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ka-kah tilted its head, already sensing Johan's hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah? |\u969?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Noticing its trainer's reluctance, Ka-kah leaned in with its signature mischievous grin, threatening a playful lick if Johan didn't share.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed and relented.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine. Take it. All yours."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ka-kah cheered, clutching the scroll like treasure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Later that afternoon, Johan received a call from Steven.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher, we've arrived. Where are you?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon after, Steven, Roxanne, and Flannery found him in the training area, keeping his Pok\u233?mon sharp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Already finished your exams?" Johan asked with curiosity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not entirely," Flannery replied candidly. "We finished the battle assessments and came right over!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roxanne clarified, "The battle exams are earlier than the written ones, so we had a few days of free time."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How did you do?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Steven went all-out. Total annihilation," Flannery said dramatically.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I wouldn't say that," Steven replied, smiling modestly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled, feeling a strange sense of relief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He no longer felt guilty about his own high-stakes tactics in the league.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven handed him a bag. "We also brought you something\u8212?straight from home."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Curious, Johan opened the bag to find it filled with coffee from his own caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How did you manage this?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It wasn't easy," Roxanne said. "The caf\u233? was packed. We had to wait ages!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fourth day of the Indigo League arrived\u8212?the Round of 16.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's flawless victories had created a buzz, but the previous day's match broke his streak of sweeping opponents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu had stubbornly insisted it hadn't fought enough, so Johan let it start the battle against a trainer specializing in Flying Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though Kubfu defeated two opponents, Johan withdrew it to avoid overexertion and let Dragonair finish the job.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The 3-0 streak was gone, but Johan's zero-loss record remained intact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the competition narrowed to 16 contestants, heated debates about the favorites erupted online.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some viewed Johan as a rising star. Others leaned toward familiar faces like Reizo from Sinnoh, Ilima from Alola, or Gudrian from Unova.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Predictions varied:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Reizo's Pok\u233?mon are on another level."}{\b
"Johan's Gengar and Ninetales haven't even appeared yet!"}{\b
"Ilima might be the dark horse\u8212?he's multi-talented!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan noticed one glaring omission: no one mentioned Tinkaton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That wouldn't do.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
