Unlike the six-on-six format used in earlier rounds, the Battle Tower's final match was a three-on-three battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's first Pok\u233?mon was {\b
Alakazam}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's choice?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, of course.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two glass-cannon speedsters stared each other down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In battles like these, the one who struck first would likely win.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alakazam versus Gengar? A classic showdown!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoever attacks first will probably sweep the match!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is this the moment Johan finally struggles?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The referee raised the flags, signaling the start of the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without a word, Anabel gave her command telepathically.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alakazam's eyes glowed blue as it crossed its spoons. Psychic energy surged around it, forming a powerful {\b
Psychic Terrain}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But just as Alakazam was about to unleash its power, a dark {\b
Shadow Ball} appeared out of nowhere, hurtling toward it at breakneck speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's eyes widened in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She hadn't heard Johan give any instructions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the speed of that Shadow Ball\u8230? how was it so fast?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Block it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alakazam's telepathic command kicked in, and a psychic barrier flickered to life just in time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Shadow Ball exploded against the barrier, sending shockwaves across the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But before Anabel and Alakazam could catch their breath, they noticed Gengar's shadow shifting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't a trick of the light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was {\b
Shadow Sneak}!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing the danger, Alakazam teleported across the field using {\b
Teleport}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel sighed in relief \u8212? until she saw where Alakazam had reappeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Right in front of Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar grinned wickedly, its hand glowing with dark energy as it launched another {\b
Shadow Ball}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alakazam hit the ground, knocked out cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alakazam is unable to battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In just a few seconds, the first round was over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The chat exploded with questions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What just happened?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Did Johan even say anything?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is this the pinnacle of training \u8212? no commands needed?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Or maybe\u8230? Johan is a telepath too?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Alakazam fainted, a strange, distorted barrier spread across the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was {\b
Trick Room}!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though Alakazam had fallen, it had managed to set up Trick Room before fainting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A priority -7 move like Trick Room? How did it activate so fast?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"These trainers and their battle tricks\u8230?" Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
None of them follow the basic battle rules!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced at Gengar and grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, break that Trick Room for me!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
