{\qc
300: How Can Gengar Be This Cool?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar curiously observed the Trick Room spreading outward from Alakazam's center.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't the first time it had experienced Trick Room, but for some reason, it found it... fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike the first time, when it passively endured the move's effects, this time Gengar seemed to gain a bit of insight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The round, purple creature scratched its behind and raised one hand. In its palm, a strange energy began to gather.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan narrowed his eyes in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could it be... Trick Room?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In his view, the move list under Gengar's profile solidified as the name {\b
Trick Room} appeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unbelievable!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but feel impressed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His Gengar's talent for learning unconventional and tricky moves was so absurdly high that even Johan occasionally felt a twinge of fear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you able to communicate with your Pok\u233?mon telepathically, too, Johan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel, whose Alakazam had just been defeated, showed no sign of frustration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rather, she was intrigued by how Johan seemed to be silently directing his Gengar \u8212? much like how she commanded her Pok\u233?mon through telepathy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She felt like she had found a kindred spirit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation, she threw out her second Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Metagross!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The four-legged Steel/Psychic-type Pok\u233?mon appeared, its massive body made of solid metal and an unmistakable red-eyed "X" emblem on its face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar tilted its head in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why does this Metagross look normal?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike Steven's famous shiny Metagross, this was the standard coloring for the species.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that's why Alakazam had set up Trick Room \u8212? to prepare the stage for Metagross.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Initially, Johan planned for Gengar to brute-force the Trick Room out of existence, a strategy he'd seen in high-level battles from trainers like Cynthia or Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But seeing Gengar start to conjure Trick Room on its own? That simplified things.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Metagross, Zen Headbutt!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the Trick Room effect, Metagross's speed was swapped with Gengar's. The giant Pok\u233?mon lunged forward with surprising speed, its body glowing blue as it prepared to smash into Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, use Trick Room!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The only way to cancel out Trick Room was to cast it again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Whoosh!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar spread the Trick Room energy it had gathered, and the two opposing forces canceled each other out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Metagross slowed down, while Gengar regained its usual nimbleness.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~ (U-)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the surprise on both Anabel and Metagross's faces, Gengar smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Three blue flames materialized around Gengar and flew toward Metagross.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Will-O-Wisp!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Fwoosh!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ghostly blue flames engulfed Metagross, burning it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Metagross barreled through the flames, landing a powerful punch squarely on Gengar's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Bam!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar flew backward, skidding across the floor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Due to the burn, Metagross's attack power had been halved, so the Zen Headbutt wasn't enough to knock Gengar out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar staggered to its feet, wiping its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah! (Tough!)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It pretended not to be hurt, even though tears welled up in its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, using his aura abilities, could feel what Gengar was really thinking:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
It hurts so much...!!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed, his lips twitching into a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, Hex!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar's eyes glowed purple as it unleashed a powerful curse on the burned Metagross.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, before the attack could land, Anabel recalled Metagross.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A sleek {\b
Espeon} appeared in its place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Hex hit Espeon, but without any status ailment to double the damage, it wasn't particularly effective.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Battling someone who could silently communicate with their Pok\u233?mon was troublesome.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Espeon activated {\b
Psychic Terrain}, spreading a shimmering psychic aura across the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the field effect take hold, Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why do Psychic, Fairy, and Electric types get special terrain moves, but Ghost and Poison types don't?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It didn't seem fair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, however, wasn't concerned with fairness. It launched a {\b
Shadow Ball} at Espeon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Espeon was hit directly but managed to hold on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had consumed a {\b
Psychic Seed} upon entering the battlefield, boosting its Special Defense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Baton Pass."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Espeon's body shimmered as it prepared to pass its boosted stats to Metagross.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eyes narrowed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No way."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment he saw Espeon eat the Psychic Seed, he knew what Anabel was planning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, Encore!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Espeon could finish the Baton Pass, it was locked into repeating its last move \u8212? {\b
Baton Pass} \u8212? over and over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Espeon was forced to switch out without ever transferring its stat boosts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A second Shadow Ball knocked out Espeon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Viewers in the livestream exploded with comments:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He read her! Johan predicted it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, isn't that Encore? Gengar knows Encore?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Seriously, why isn't Johan in the Masters Tournament?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Metagross returned to the battlefield, still burned but now with its Special Defense boosted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Metagross, use Spread Force!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the Psychic Terrain, Metagross's {\b
Spread Force} gained an immense boost, sending waves of psychic energy crashing toward Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar split into shadows, avoiding the blast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Johan's face grew serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Metagross's boosted Special Defense, even Gengar's most powerful attacks wouldn't be enough to take it down in one hit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was time for a risky move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar," Johan said softly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar turned to look at him, its expression resolute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan gave a small nod.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Destiny Bond."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar grinned wickedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Boom!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next Spread Force hit Gengar, knocking it out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But as Gengar's shadow connected to Metagross's, the burn damage from Destiny Bond pulled Metagross down with it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Pok\u233?mon collapsed simultaneously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The room fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The livestream chat froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, it exploded:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"WTF?! HE DID IT!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Forty-five wins!! Gengar soloed the Battle Tower!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Destiny Bond clutch!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar is the coolest Pok\u233?mon ever!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rushed over to his exhausted Gengar, cradling it in his arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He fed it a Revive and patted its head, his expression a mix of pride and worry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why do you always have to act tough?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar stuck out its tongue, licking Johan's cheek.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Sometimes you have to act tough... even if it hurts.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wasn't I cool? Did you capture that, Rotom?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed, unable to hide his grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You were brave. And yes, you were cool."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He looked down at his partner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How can a Gengar be this cool?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
