{\qc
301: Time to Test Our Luck!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the skyrocketing viewership numbers in the livestream, Scott was over the moon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially when Gengar stood its ground against Metagross in the final match, refusing to retreat and forcing a mutual knockout with Destiny Bond \u8212? that moment caused the stream to reach its peak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
When was the last time our Battle Frontier was this popular?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scott was practically hearing the cha-ching of Pok\u233?dollars as the flood of comments in the livestream showed hundreds, if not thousands, of people expressing their desire to challenge the Battle Frontier.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
This prosperity... exactly as I wished!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scott glanced at the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Additionally...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There had always been rumors that Johan's battles were {\i
notoriously destructive} to the arenas.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But after witnessing today's matches...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Turns out rumors aren't always true.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battlefield only needed minor repairs here and there, nothing that would cost much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
What a profitable day~!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scott hummed a cheerful tune.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ten minutes later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~ (\u714?\u12295?\u715?*)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar stretched lazily, yawning while munching on a Revive Seed. Though it had physically recovered, its energy seemed a bit drained.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You really don't want to try this?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan held up a bottle of Energy Root, raising an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No way!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar crossed its arms in a firm X, shaking its head without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was exhausted from the battle, not brain-dead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Energy Root?} That bitter stuff was something only Kubfu would enjoy, often brewing it into tea and reciting some philosophical nonsense like:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
"One must endure bitterness before tasting success!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why torture yourself on purpose?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Anabel approached after tending to her Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, this is proof that you've conquered the Battle Tower \u8212? the Symbol of Ability."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She handed over a golden badge engraved with the Battle Tower's silhouette.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar quickly grabbed it, biting down lightly. Its eyes sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It tugged at Johan's sleeve.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah! \u8807?(\u9661?\u65344?)\u8806?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
It's real gold!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled, shaking his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Look at you, acting all stingy."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, it was gold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the real reward was the prize money and points from clearing the tower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you," Johan said, accepting the badge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel then smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, if you have a moment, may we have a chat?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Chat?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan hesitated briefly before nodding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sure."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At a nearby caf\u233? within the Battle Frontier, Johan, Steven, Flannery, Roxanne, and the Pok\u233?mon \u8212? including Gengar, Ninetales, and Jirachi \u8212? gathered at an outdoor table.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar sneakily invited Jirachi to try some coffee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moments later, Jirachi's face scrunched up in disgust, tears welling in its eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In Johan's mind, the telepathic complaints were relentless:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Gengar... mean! Gengar... bad!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only after Charcadet offered Jirachi a slice of sweet cake and Johan bought it a plush toy did the little creature finally stop pouting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, it clung to the plushie and shot Gengar the occasional glare, its cheeks puffed in frustration.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's odd that it chose a Mimikyu doll," Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel couldn't help but chuckle at the scene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Such an adorable little thing," she said, her gaze softening as she watched Jirachi.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once the Pok\u233?mon were settled, Johan and Anabel moved to a quiet corner inside the caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel got straight to the point.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, do you know who those people last night were?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan feigned confusion, tilting his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Weren't they just poachers?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Johan knew they were Team Aqua members.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But explaining that \u8212? along with how he knew their identities \u8212? would raise far too many questions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel nodded, not suspecting anything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's what they claimed. But after digging deeper, we discovered they belong to a group called {\i
Team Aqua}."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Team Aqua..." Johan echoed, pretending to process the name.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're still investigating their goals, but it's clear they're not just ordinary poachers."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's expression turned more serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I wanted to warn you to be cautious. Something about them feels... dangerous."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Dangerous?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
You have no idea.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I also have another matter to discuss."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's tone became even more formal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"On behalf of the International Police, I'd like to officially invite you to join us."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His expression grew complicated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Join the International Police?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why did this plotline feel oddly familiar?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Undercover? Double agent?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Let's not forget \u8212? Johan was already an undercover Rocket executive!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Giovanni hadn't officially confirmed it, Johan was well aware of his hidden status.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could respond, Anabel continued:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This invitation comes at the recommendation of Champion Drake, Elite Four Agatha, the Officer Jenny family, and Looker himself."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Wait... Agatha?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake and the Officer Jenny family made sense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But why would Agatha be involved?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh, right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Agatha, like Drake, was the head of Kanto's investigative division.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the investigative division worked closely with the International Police.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ms. Anabel, I'm just an ordinary teacher. I don't know if I'm suited for such a role..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ordinary?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel couldn't help but chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What "ordinary" teacher could almost sweep a seasoned Frontier Brain like herself?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, she explained patiently:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You wouldn't be an active agent. We're offering you a special advisory position \u8212? rank: Superintendent."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Superintendent?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the manga, Black held the same rank.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And {\i
advisor}?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but smirk internally.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Advisory positions were often honorary \u8212? a title given to people of influence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The cases we handle often involve complex, dangerous situations..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's expression darkened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Many agents, and their Pok\u233?mon, suffer trauma that leaves lasting scars..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Like Nanu?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan immediately thought of the retired police chief from Ula'ula Island, who once worked for the International Police.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel's words resonated with Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The more he thought about it, the more he realized he wasn't entirely against the idea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And I've heard you're particularly... opposed to poachers."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's expression hardened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No proper trainer would condone poaching."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wasn't lying.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Several of Johan's Pok\u233?mon \u8212? like his Ninetales and Indeedee siblings \u8212? had tragic histories involving poachers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel seized the moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're currently cracking down on a cross-regional poaching ring. The International Police could use your expertise."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The offer was tempting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Helping to heal trauma, fighting poachers...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I need some time to think it over," he finally said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anabel nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They exchanged contact information before parting ways.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan sat quietly, his thoughts were interrupted by a message from Matori.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She explained how Team Aqua had attempted to gather information on Johan through Rocket channels \u8212? and how those responsible were now "indefinitely reassigned" to the mines.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Honestly... being a Rocket executive has its perks.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Team Aqua too scared to make direct moves, and the League handling official investigations...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maybe he could play both sides?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Why not aim for the top in both worlds?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The idea made him grin, but he shook his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
It can't be that easy.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, should we head back to the hotel?" Flannery asked as they left the caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Back to rest?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan glanced at the setting sun and grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We've barely started."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roxanne blinked in confusion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You want to challenge another Frontier facility?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar's exhausted," Flannery pointed out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah! (\u65506?\u1079?\u65506?)\u963?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
False accusation!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan patted Gengar's head with a laugh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar deserves a break. But the rest of you seem eager."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He turned to the Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They all nodded enthusiastically \u8212? especially Jirachi.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Johan, keep going! Let's keep going!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, which one should we try next?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Jirachi pointed excitedly toward the {\b
Battle Pike}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Battle Pike resembled a giant Seviper, with 140 randomly generated rooms inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was all about luck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan gulped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Luck-based?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His companions gave him skeptical looks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you sure about this?" Steven asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan glanced at Jirachi.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Maybe its Serene Grace can help?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a determined smile, he declared:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"All right!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Today... let's test our luck!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
