Johan channeled his Aura into Charcadet, strengthening its body. The flames on Charcadet's body grew hotter and brighter, and its reddish hue intensified.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, this kind of tactic would be illegal in an official League battle. But here? Rules didn't matter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Charcadet!" Johan shouted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka\u8212?!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Charcadet let out a deafening roar as its flames surged to unprecedented heights.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
