The chaos erupted quickly but subsided just as fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When the flames finally cleared, all that remained was scorched ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the center of the battlefield, Charcadet knelt on one knee, bracing itself with its arms and gasping for air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its flames had dimmed, and its body was visibly weakened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the other side, Entei stood tall and majestic. Yet its gaze toward Charcadet carried a hint of respect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
ROAR!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Golden flames flared around Entei.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
