{\i
Oh, so you still want more? Let's all gang up on you!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just as the group prepared to charge, Entei moved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But instead of attacking, Entei's golden flames engulfed Charcadet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Surprisingly, the flames caused no harm. Instead, they seeped into Charcadet's body, healing its injuries.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moments later, Charcadet stood up, fully recovered, with no sign of its previous exhaustion. A faint golden light flickered where its wounds had been.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The Flames of Life? Entei's blessing?" Morty exclaimed, his eyes wide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entei's blessing?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan pondered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Similar to Suicune's "Blessing of the North Wind"?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
