"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Understanding the situation, Gengar patted Charcadet's shoulder with a grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good thing it didn't try anything foolish.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entei nodded at Charcadet and then cast a deep glance at Johan before preparing to leave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, Entei!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan called out, causing Entei to pause and glance back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearing his throat, Johan said, "Uh... I wasn't kidding earlier. Can I borrow a flame?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
