{\b
{\qc
325: This Punch Holds Ten Years of Power\u8212?How Will You Block It?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gym Leader Pryce?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked at Pryce, then at the Quagsire that had frozen mid-bite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, this Quagsire actually belonged to Pryce?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Gengar\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had thought it had invited a wild Pok\u233?mon over to join their meal, but it turned out to be Pryce's Pok\u233?mon instead!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, it's you," Pryce said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He recognized Johan, his sharp gaze sweeping over the Pok\u233?mon sitting around the picnic blanket and Johan himself, who was casually eating with them. Pryce's brows furrowed slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I thought you might have some potential," he said, his tone cold, "but seeing how you interact with your Pok\u233?mon\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He shook his head faintly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A Trainer and their Pok\u233?mon shouldn't behave like this."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing this, Johan frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As expected\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pryce's "illness" ran deep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Come here!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Woopa\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
