The two Pok\u233?mon together were a harmonious sight, like elegant sprites dancing in a wintry wonderland.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, it evolved," Johan said with a small smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia nodded. "Yes, I finally decided to evolve it into Glaceon. Your Ninetales influenced that choice."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the snowstorm thickened, Glaceon's figure seemed to merge into the swirling frost, becoming nearly indistinguishable from the wintry landscape.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its {\b
Snow Cloak} ability was a perfect match for Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, unlike the serene reunion between Ninetales and Glaceon, the Aerodactyl grew increasingly agitated at the onset of the storm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its crimson eyes blazed with fury as it let out a deafening roar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrrr\u8212?!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales immediately adopted a serious expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Aerodactyl was strong\u8212?too strong to be underestimated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One after another, layers of {\b
Aurora Veil} shimmered into existence, and a thin layer of frost climbed up Ninetales' fur, amplifying its defensive stance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Glay!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
