thud} as an icy sculpture.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The workers, who had been observing cautiously from a distance, gasped in awe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Aerodactyl had been a fearsome menace. Even Roark, the Oreburgh Gym Leader, had struggled to contain it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And now? It had been subdued so easily, with almost no resistance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
