{\b
Later That Night}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After finishing their meal, Johan and Cynthia stayed up chatting for a bit before finally heading to bed, yawning as they went.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For the Pok\u233?mon, however\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The night was just beginning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
