{\qc
337: The \u8220?Parental Love\u8221? of Magmortar, Blazing Aura Burst\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Celestic Town \u8211? Cynthia's Training Field}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had to admit, Flint wasn't entirely wrong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, nothing accelerated growth like battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the games, battling a rival like Flint usually meant your Pok\u233?mon would level up at least three times after one round.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In reality, battling tested tactics and moves in ways that traditional training simply couldn't replicate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
