Meanwhile, Aaron finally caught on to what was happening. He clapped his hands together and exclaimed, "Wait, Flint's battling Johan?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This reaction speed... It made Johan wonder if Aaron's eventual Elite Four position would only come from Sinnoh running out of candidates.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian took charge, announcing, "Both sides, call out your Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a hearty laugh, Flint grabbed a Pok\u233?ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan, I've been waiting for this battle for a long time!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had watched Johan's record-breaking run through the Battle Frontier, almost in its entirety.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Flint missed Johan's final match against Brandon, he was inspired enough to try the Sinnoh Battle Frontier himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With his Infernape leading the charge, Flint nearly matched Johan's pace at the Battle Tower, earning an impressive streak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When he reached the Battle Factory, reality hit hard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint's aggressive style worked wonders with his own Pok\u233?mon but fell apart when using unfamiliar rental teams.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The harsh lessons at the Battle Factory only made Flint want to battle Johan even more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is our first battle, so I'm giving it everything I've got!" Flint declared, his fiery spirit flaring.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
