Not to mention, Sinnoh and Johto shared a deep connection. Hundreds of years ago, some of Sinnoh's inhabitants migrated to ancient Johto, with the northernmost area of Johto still bearing the "Sinjoh Ruins" as proof of this shared history.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The bond between the two regions ran deep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's show Johan just how fierce our flames are!" Flint said, his excitement evident.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Typhloooosion!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Typhlosion roared once more, the flames on its back erupting skyward, filling the area with scorching heat. The Pok\u233?mon's fighting spirit was blazing, as was Flint's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
