When your opponent radiated such fiery intensity, it inevitably influenced you and your Pok\u233?mon as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well then\u8212?nothing to hold back now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan reached for the next Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
