Aaron froze for a moment before realization dawned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When battling Flint, it was easy to find yourself drawn into his pace and emotions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pok\u233?mon battles weren't just exchanges between Pok\u233?mon; they were a form of communication between trainers as well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, for a tactical trainer like Johan, falling into the rhythm of an emotional opponent could be a major disadvantage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How would Johan handle this?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Dragonite!" Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From within a Luxury Ball, a streak of red light materialized into a Dragonite. Its entrance brought a fierce gust of wind that swept across the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint stood with his hands in his pockets, the breeze ruffling his spiky afro, but the fiery passion in his eyes remained undimmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His gaze locked onto the Dragonite, and he could feel the sheer power radiating from the pseudo-legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So, it's Dragonite from the Kanto region."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now we're really getting somewhere!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite looked at Typhlosion and Flint with a cheerful grin. It playfully thumped its fists together, the sound reverberating like a deep drum: {\i
Duang! Duang!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It, too, was ready for battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Typhlosion, Flamethrower!" Flint roared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Typhloooosion!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Typhlosion took a deep breath before expelling a stream of searing flames, surging forward like molten lava toward Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
