But he wasn't about to find out\u8212?not like this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!" Johan commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite was surrounded by a white aura and shot forward like a streak of light, delivering a decisive strike.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
WHAM!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Typhlosion collapsed with a heavy thud, its flames flickering out as it fainted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aaron: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a moment, Flint looked like he'd swallowed a lump of charcoal. His lips moved, but no words came out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eventually, it was Lucian who broke the silence with an awkward chuckle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well... that was... precise."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly, it wasn't just precision\u8212?it was almost unfair. Extreme Speed had a higher priority than Overheat, allowing Dragonite to interrupt the attack entirely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For Flint, it was the battle equivalent of gearing up to launch a massive fireball, only to get bopped in the face before the words "Fireball Jutsu" could leave his mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was worse than never getting fired up at all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite flew back to Johan's side, looking sheepish as it rubbed the back of its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was that too much?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan patted Dragonite on the arm, his smile sly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry. He's got something even stronger."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draa?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
