"Let's go, Infernape!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With an acrobatic flip, a monkey-like Pok\u233?mon emerged. Its head was crowned with roaring flames, its body adorned with golden armor-like markings that gleamed in the sunlight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Infernape!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite instinctively tensed, sensing the overwhelming power radiating from the blazing Pok\u233?mon before it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For most trainers, Flint's team was divided into two categories:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Infernape... and everything else.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
