Even in official battles, this Infernape had been known to take down two of Cynthia's Pok\u233?mon in succession before finally being bested by her Garchomp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With or without Infernape, Flint was essentially two different trainers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
