"Infernapppppe!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fire atop its head flared wildly as Infernape dashed forward, its fists igniting in blazing orange flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite surged forward, its form blurring as it closed the distance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
