That thing would jump with excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aside from wanting to beat Arceus senseless, the only thing Giratina seemed to enjoy was bullying Dialga and Palkia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With this claw, Johan now had a very valuable "bargaining chip" in any future dealings with Giratina.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been a while since he last contacted Giratina\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar had probably been keeping in touch with it all this time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan turned to Gengar, who was grinning with a "praise me!" expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He patted its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Actually, this Uxie's Claw wasn't useless right now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Pok\u233?dex description said it could make young Pok\u233?mon smarter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Johan just so happened to have an egg.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If the hatchling ended up as a genius, it would be perfect for his role as a Pok\u233?mon psychologist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Charcadet, this claw is for the egg."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Charcadet tilted its head, puzzled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it trusted Johan's decisions, so it solemnly nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It strung the claw onto a piece of string and carefully tied it to the egg.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rustle\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The egg wobbled slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a Pok\u233?mon with the Flame Body ability, Charcadet was accelerating the incubation process.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The little one inside would likely hatch very soon\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Next Day.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nothing unusual happened in Snowpoint City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When Battle Pyramid's Head Brandon heard about what happened at Snowpoint Temple, he immediately flew over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Brandon stationed here, even if something else happened, he could hold the fort until the League arrived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That meant\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and the others were finally free to leave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before departing, Johan specifically visited Matori and Team Rocket's trio, giving them gifts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, he asked Matori to deliver a "special gift" to Giovanni.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the trio tearfully waved goodbye, Johan boarded the plane and left Snowpoint City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arrival at Celestic Town.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Here, the group went their separate ways.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aaron headed to Eterna Forest, looking for a Bug/Water-type Pok\u233?mon. Cynthia stayed behind to finish a historical research report with Professor Carolina. Once the report was done, the League would approve a new round of research funding. Some of that funding was Johan's. (This had absolutely nothing to do with Cynthia's training facility being newly renovated.)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At first, Johan planned to stay and help.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint mentioned he was heading back to Sunyshore City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Johan changed his mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan hadn't forgotten how Volkner's Pikachu once asked him for help.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner was suffering from severe battle fatigue, and even Cynthia's attempts to help him hadn't fully worked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, now that Johan was in Sinnoh\u8230? and Flint just happened to be heading back\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He decided to go too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Lucian\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At first, he wanted to return to Canalave City to rest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had absorbed too much historical knowledge lately. The constant crisis situations had worn him out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a single conversation, Flint changed his mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint claimed he couldn't afford to rent a private plane. Meaning he had to go with Lucian to Canalave City first. And Lucian instantly knew\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Flint followed him home\u8230? he'd never leave.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian chose to take the long route.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and Flint secured a free ride. Celestic Town, Departure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia stood in the plaza, hands in her pockets, her black trench coat sharp and elegant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She smiled slightly and gave Johan a small nod.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded back, feeling a bit sentimental.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, he boarded the plane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, take off!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Understood, Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Vrrrrooom\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The engines roared to life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Lucian was filthy rich.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This wasn't just any plane\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a high-tech aircraft powered by a Rotom engine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was already fantasizing about a "Rotom Mecha."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If that ever happened\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Anti-Regigigas Armor." "Anti-Groudon Suit." "Anti-Arceus Exoskeleton."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, these were no longer just dreams.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He might single-handedly rewrite the world's tech tree.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint, face swollen from bruises, suddenly shouted:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That website from last night\u8212?it's gone!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia deleted it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She found out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luckily, he saved the good parts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
