{\qc
364: Johan \u8211? How About a Bet?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Gym Challenge?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wearing a work jacket and safety goggles, Volkner looked up, slightly surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everything had been fine just moments ago, so why did the Gym's electricity suddenly vanish?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Compared to the challenge, this issue concerned him more.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His carefully designed Gym circuitry shouldn't have any problems, unless\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, he saw Johan, Flint, and Buck standing at the entrance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flint, Buck\u8230? and Johan?" Volkner frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pika~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pikachu ran up to Volkner, gesturing excitedly\u8212?there was a strong challenger here.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Gym challenge?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sitting on the floor, Volkner took off his goggles and lazily scratched his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The badges should be outside the Gym. If you want one, just take it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Volkner!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint called out sternly, "Someone's challenging the Gym\u8212?get up and react! Where's your energy?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner glanced at his passionate friend and gave a mild smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Aren't I already up?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint clenched his jaw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Battle me, Volkner!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner ignored him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm\u8230? He doesn't seem quite like the rumored eighth Gym Leader of Sinnoh," Buck remarked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Neither Flint's encouragement nor Buck's provocation worked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Johan, who had just shouted about a Gym Challenge, was now casually surveying the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He nodded approvingly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This arena looks good."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar nodded along.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed sturdy\u8212?less likely to be destroyed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Volkner," Johan suddenly called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had met in Rustboro City and even worked together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Later, Johan participated in the Indigo League and speedran the Battle Frontier. Volkner hadn't watched much, but he had heard about him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wasn't too familiar with Johan, but he wasn't a stranger either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's make a bet," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A bet?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner chuckled. "If I lose, I have to 'get my spirit back'? I think I'm doing just fine."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No, no, no."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan waved a finger, smiling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you win, I'll tell you why your Gym's electricity suddenly disappeared."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Volkner paused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That actually caught his interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was confident there were no issues with his Gym's electrical system, yet it had completely blacked out. That meant there was a flaw somewhere.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know electricity?" Volkner asked, his tone gaining a bit more energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Electricity?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's mind flashed back to the horrors of Ohm's Law, resistance and conductance, electrical work and power, Joule's Law\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I know a little."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint nudged Buck and whispered, "Why does Johan always 'know a little' about everything?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buck adjusted his glasses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"When most people say 'a little,' they mean it literally. When Johan says it, he's just being humble."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint looked enlightened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
