Wallace immediately called out his attack without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even a {\i
Physical} Gyarados finishing with Hydro Pump?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint never stood a chance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Wallace could call for the next challenger, Winona silently stepped forward, releasing her Altaria.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From an outsider's perspective, it looked like Wallace was avenging Winona.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But in Winona's eyes, Wallace was showing off his strength\u8212?which was exactly why they had broken up in the first place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had never wanted to be seen as "Wallace's girlfriend" or respected {\i
because} of him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She wanted to earn that respect herself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire group instinctively went silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Flint and Lance, who weren't the most perceptive, could feel the tension.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the audience, only Gengar continued crunching on popcorn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Winona\u8230?" Wallace frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Please take this battle seriously, Wallace," she said flatly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was the first time she had spoken to him all night.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace took a deep breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nearly fell off his chair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alright, my ass!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These two were about to fight to the death!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia gently tugged Johan's sleeve.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We {\i
can't} let them finish this battle," she whispered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they fought to the end, their relationship would be beyond saving.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Okay. I have a plan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan took a deep breath and said, "Cynthia, Lance, when I give the signal, step in and stop them."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Got it!" Cynthia nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?" Lance blinked. "Aren't they battling just fine\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But after a sharp glare from Clair, he quickly shut his mouth and sighed. "...Fine, I got it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield, Altaria and Milotic clashed once again before separating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the moment Johan called out, "Now!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garchomp!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragonite!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's Garchomp and Lance's Dragonite instantly rushed onto the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the stunned gazes of Wallace and Winona, the two Pok\u233?mon firmly blocked Altaria and Milotic from continuing the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's it?" Clair asked, tilting her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan adjusted his glasses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No, now we move to the next step."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He stepped onto the battlefield and called out, "Gengar!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar let out a mischievous laugh and raised its hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hypnosis!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace and Winona, caught completely off guard, were immediately put to sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You two keep saying you can't talk things out properly, right?" Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine. Then you can {\i
talk} in a dream."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He and Gengar were experts in dream manipulation, especially nightmares.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They would recreate the events of the Hoenn Crisis\u8212?when Team Aqua and Team Magma had held Winona hostage, forcing Wallace into a terrible dilemma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if that wasn't enough\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well, if one nightmare wasn't enough, they'd make it two. If two weren't enough, they'd make it three.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because deep down, Johan knew\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace still loved Winona.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Winona still loved Wallace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the foundation of everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If that didn't exist, no amount of "shared experiences" would help.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To the rest of the group, only a few minutes had passed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But for Wallace and Winona, inside the dream, they had gone through countless crises together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When they finally woke up, both looked disoriented.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And yet, as soon as their eyes met\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They understood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everything was clear now.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if they weren't ready to get back together immediately, at least their relationship could start to heal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan let out a long sigh of relief, motioning for Gengar to stop applying nightmares.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in the seating area, Clair suddenly approached Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her face was slightly red, and she hesitated before whispering, "Um\u8230? That thing you just did\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan turned to her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Can you\u8230? do that to Lance too?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Flint, who had finally caught on, gasped in realization.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait a second\u8230? Does this mean Professor Johan is actually a love expert?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Somewhere in Sinnoh\u8212?White Forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the hazy moonlight, a shadowy figure stood alone, gazing up at the night sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its expression flickered slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nightmares\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
