January 10th, Light Snow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales leaped gracefully across the cat towers scattered throughout the house before landing softly on the plush sofa, curling up into a ball, and licking its paws before using them to clean its face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite happily rolled across the floor, then found its favorite blanket and buried its face in it, sniffing intensely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Confirmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales was "feline," and Dragonite was "canine."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom skillfully dove into the robotic vacuum cleaner and diligently started cleaning the floors.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Charcadet sat in the middle of the living room on a small stone stool, cradling a Pok\u233?mon egg in its arms. It took out a handkerchief and carefully wiped the egg, emitting a gentle warmth from its body, like a living heater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton sat beside it, occasionally pulling out a small piece of metal from somewhere and comparing it to Charcadet's body, seemingly measuring for something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku~zzZ"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu sat in front of the television, dozing off as the warmth lulled it into sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, meanwhile, was in the kitchen with the Indeedee siblings and Alcremie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the occasional sounds and the delicious aroma wafting out, it was clear that something tasty was being prepared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Outside the window, snow mixed with rain drizzled down, casting a misty veil over the streets.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar peeked its head in through the door, smoothly opening it to let Cynthia in.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're here?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing the movement, Johan poked his head out of the kitchen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mm."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia's cheeks were slightly flushed. With Gengar's enthusiastic assistance, she took off her coat, revealing her slender, alluring silhouette.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan wanted to ask\u8212?whoever said Cynthia didn't have a great figure?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The snow in Kanaz City doesn't feel cold at all."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hoenn is further south than Sinnoh, after all. If it weren't for the ocean, we probably wouldn't see snow at all."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Noticing the Garchomp and Lucario behind her, Johan naturally retracted his gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Earlier, after capturing the Pok\u233?mon hunters, Johan had gone to the Kanaz Police Station to submit a brief report since he was the one who initiated the operation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After that, he came home to start preparing dinner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, Cynthia had gone out sightseeing in Kanaz City with Gengar as her guide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
According to Gengar, it wanted to show her the "empire" it had built!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeedee's sharp awareness of unfamiliar faces wasn't just due to its own vigilance. The many stray Pok\u233?mon that Gengar had "convinced" to help out in Kanaz City also played a big role.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The caf\u233? provided free food for them, and in return, they were happy to help out with small tasks\u8212?like handing out flyers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mm."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia nodded. "We went to the supermarket and bought some ingredients."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As she spoke, Gengar began pulling out bag after bag of groceries from its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You two went to the supermarket?" Johan's eyes widened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He glanced at Cynthia and Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A "chronic indecisive" shopper and a "never-thought-about-it" impulse buyer went to the supermarket together?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching as Gengar pulled out its seventh, eighth, and ninth large bag, Johan realized\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That purple chubby ghost had taken advantage of Cynthia to buy everything Johan usually refused or limited it from getting!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Did you buy out the whole supermarket?" Johan couldn't help but ask.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia chuckled. "Gengar liked them."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Exactly!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar floated behind Cynthia and started massaging her shoulders, looking smug, as if it had found a new "patron" and "financial backer."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Besides," Cynthia added with a playful smile, blinking at him, "you're cooking for us anyway."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Making\u8230? this much?" Johan felt his head ache.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Garchomp, standing behind Cynthia with its arms crossed, let out a low growl and cast a cold, sidelong glance at him, flashing its sharp scythes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You spent {\i
our} money, so this better be good\u8212?otherwise, beware of my blades!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though it sounded threatening, its gulping betrayed its true intentions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's cooking skills were well-known. Otherwise, Garchomp wouldn't have let Gengar and Cynthia buy so much food in the first place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pretty please~?" Cynthia teased.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who could resist that?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry!" Johan straightened his back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a wave of his hand, he declared,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, everyone, move out!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With so many ingredients and hungry mouths, plus the chilly weather\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nothing would be more fitting than hotpot!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The group cheered and quickly got to work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Kubfu, who had been dozing off, snapped awake when its snot bubble popped, dazed but instinctively joining the activity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
In the Garden\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~ Ka-kaah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar and Dragonite stretched out a massive oilcloth over the open space, forming a makeshift tent. Supporting it were Garchomp, Roserade, Milotic, and Tinkaton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Roserade and Milotic held up the cloth with poles, Garchomp straightened it, and Tinkaton secured it in place with stakes and rope.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, the Indeedee siblings, Alcremie, and Rotom got busy setting up the table underneath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, freeze these meats a little\u8212?it'll enhance the flavor."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
