"Boss, should we\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maxie shot him a calm glance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tabitha immediately shut up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The time isn't right yet."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, sir."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in the present\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Meteorites?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
