Heatran blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Did I say that?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Catching Johan's meaningful look, Heatran quickly nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes! Yes, I said that!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
