Gordie sat in front of his computer, watching Johan's battle footage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Any advice for facing Professor Johan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon, currently lost while looking for a flight path, was surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Your next opponent is Johan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, I just got the news."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie knew that Leon had battled Johan before. He also knew that Johan had defeated Mustard, Galar's former Champion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That fact alone carried massive weight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon thought for a moment, then said:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If you're fighting Professor Johan... be especially careful of his Eevee."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...Eevee?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie was baffled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had watched tons of Johan's battles\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What Eevee?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Besides Eevee, also his Gengar, Ninetales, Tinkaton, Dragonite, Kubfu, Charcadet\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie felt like he had asked the wrong person.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who didn't know Johan's entire team?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon coughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, but seriously\u8212?his Kubfu is the most talented one my mentor has ever seen."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing that, Gordie's expression grew serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Got it. I'll be ready."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a pause, he added, "Thanks, Leon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was about to hang up when\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait! Gordie, do you know how to fly to Ballonlea?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ladies and gentlemen! Welcome to the Lily of the Valley Conference's Top 8 Qualifiers!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The announcer's voice echoed throughout the massive main stadium, igniting the crowd's excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this stage of the tournament, all matches moved from the secondary arenas to the main stadium.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, the format remained 3v3 rotation battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only when competitors reached the Top 8, advancing to the quarterfinals, would the format change to 6v6 full battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Today's challenger is Gordie from the Galar region! Here's his profile."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the private viewing box, Fitzwilliam handed Johan a file on Gordie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan took it, briefly flipping through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly, when he learned yesterday that Gordie would be his opponent, he didn't really need the report.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He already knew plenty about Gordie.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, this was the future Rock-type Gym Leader of Circhester.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing Johan put the file away, Cynthia asked,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So\u8230? have you decided which tricky strategy you're going with?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Did she almost say dirty strategy just now?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmph.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"More or less."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, in another part of the stadium, Officer Jenny and I had uncovered new information.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After speaking to Jenny, we had confirmed that the suspect was a Pok\u233?mon Hunter\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he refused to admit it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not only did he deny his identity, but he also insisted that the Pok\u233?mon Egg he sold me was real,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even going so far as to falsely accuse me of fraud.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I was furious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The problem was\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I had no solid proof that the egg was fake\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
All I had was a transaction record.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But soon, we found a breakthrough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
We managed to contact another victim!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it turned out\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That victim had been scammed for twice the amount I had lost!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At last, the case seemed to be making progress.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
----------\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
