{\qc
415: The Toxic Ladder Strategy, Tactical Rotom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the announcer introduced the match, it was time for Johan and Gordie's battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amid the wave of cheers from the crowd, both trainers stepped onto the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Judging from the audience's reaction, both of them had a solid fanbase.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor Johan, please take care of me!" Gordie was unexpectedly polite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Likewise," Johan responded with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Trainers, send out your Pok\u233?mon!" The referee raised the flag.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, Johan and Gordie each sent out their first Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Barbaracle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie's first Pok\u233?mon was Barbaracle, the Rock- and Water-type Pok\u233?mon known as the Collective Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its appearance was quite peculiar\u8212?at first glance, it looked like seven barnacle-like limbs fixed onto two large rocks, forming its body. Even its "head" was just another barnacle limb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Johan's first Pok\u233?mon was\u8230? Rotom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Barbaracle, the Collective Pok\u233?mon! A Rock- and Water-type. It is said that each of its limbs can move independently, Rotom!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment Rotom appeared, it didn't forget its "primary job."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, is that\u8230? a Pok\u233?dex?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hold on, did Professor Johan just send out a Pok\u233?dex?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But that Pok\u233?dex\u8230? looks like a real Pok\u233?mon\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd was in an uproar when they saw the Pok\u233?dex-shaped Rotom on the field. Even Gordie looked a bit taken aback.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had watched a lot of Johan's battle footage, but\u8230? he had never found the Eevee that Leon mentioned, nor had he ever seen this Rotom before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Gordie didn't think Johan was sending out Rotom to mock him. Instead, he felt\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This might be another one of Johan's hidden aces.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, that legendary super strong Eevee Leon mentioned\u8212?almost no one had actually seen it. It was rumored to be one of Johan's strongest secret weapons.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If that was the case, this Rotom probably wasn't weak either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not to mention, as an Electric- and Ghost-type, Rotom had a strong advantage against Barbaracle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Barbaracle, stay alert. Take this seriously!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Skaaah!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Barbaracle took a battle stance, ready to fight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, Roto! \u931?(\u1076?lll)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Rotom?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom was just a "small, weak, and helpless" photographer! It didn't need this kind of intensity\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While frantically taking pictures, Rotom spun in circles toward the audience stands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It could clearly feel the difference between filming on the field versus off the field\u8212?the opponent, the crowd, the big screen, the torches\u8230? everything was different.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And with so many people and so many cameras watching\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a bit nervous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, you done taking pictures? Switch forms."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From Johan's shadow, Gengar emerged\u8212?then opened its mouth wide and spat out a\u8230? washing machine!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"O-On it, Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom quickly snapped a few more photos, then zipped back to Johan's side before leaving the Pok\u233?dex and diving into the washing machine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment it entered, the washing machine's form changed, taking on Rotom's signature markings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Toxic Ladder Strategy. The Root of All Evil. The Infamous Water-Washing Machine. Wash Rotom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom still wasn't that common at this point, so many spectators were seeing it for the first time\u8212?especially its Washer Form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It transformed?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"First it was a Pok\u233?dex, and now it's a washing machine?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What kind of Pok\u233?mon is Rotom?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wash Rotom, when fused with a washing machine, changed its typing to Electric/Water.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This unique typing, combined with its Levitate ability, meant that its only weakness was Grass-type moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie frowned slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew about Wash Rotom, but this was his first time battling against one. He wasn't entirely sure how to deal with it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan patted Rotom, who was still a little nervous, and said:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I've given you a secret weapon. Don't worry\u8212?if you don't want to fight, just run."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"R-Roto\u8230?" (\u8857?\u65103?\u8857?)\u12446?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom nodded vigorously, feeling relieved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No problem. If things got rough, it could just run away\u8212?after all, it had already taken enough pictures!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Battle, begin!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With both trainers ready, the referee officially started the match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as the flag dropped, Gordie made the first move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Barbaracle, Shell Smash!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shell Smash: Shatters its own shell, lowering Defense and Special Defense while significantly increasing Attack, Special Attack, and Speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was a classic all-out offense strategy for Barbaracle\u8212?trading defense for maximum power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Crack!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A visible crack appeared on Barbaracle's rocky shell, and in return, both its offensive stats and Speed skyrocketed. Its aura surged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Feeling Barbaracle's intimidating presence, Rotom tensed up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But after going through so many crazy experiences with Johan\u8212?even facing Regigigas and Heatran\u8212?it managed to stay calm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, as soon as Gordie shouted his command, and Johan responded, Wash Rotom made its move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, Trick."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trick: Swaps held items with the target, leaving both Pok\u233?mon locked into their new items.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whoooom\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A blue light surrounded Rotom, enveloping both it and Barbaracle. Then, their held items swapped places.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom received Barbaracle's Focus Sash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Barbaracle? It received Rotom's held item\u8230? a Choice Scarf!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait\u8230? what?! Trick into Choice Scarf?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap, Johan, have some mercy!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Barbaracle can only keep using Shell Smash now?! Endless Shell Smash Barbaracle?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some spectators had assumed that Johan had changed his battle style after his past few aggressive matches.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now, today, right in front of them\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was back to his usual dirty tricks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Gordie's eyes widened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Being locked into Shell Smash?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How was he supposed to play like this?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly? Gordie had no idea how to handle this situation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, Thunderbolt."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Trick-Choice Scarf Wash Rotom\u8212?that was textbook toxicity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing that its opponent was stuck in an infinite Shell Smash loop, Rotom immediately relaxed. It unleashed a burst of dazzling golden electricity, striking Barbaracle head-on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Return, Barbaracle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Skaaaah!" Barbaracle staggered back from the electric attack, just as it was recalled into its Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie frowned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As expected of Johan's Pok\u233?mon\u8212?his reaction time was insanely fast. Even though he had managed to withdraw Barbaracle in time, it still took some damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't knocked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Actually, Johan was internally sighing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Withdrawing a Pok\u233?mon mid-attack\u8212?this was one of the annoying loopholes in real-world Pok\u233?mon battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using a recall to dodge damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, since Gordie had withdrawn Barbaracle and was summoning a new Pok\u233?mon, Johan and Rotom had time to act.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom was already charged up and ready to go.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie took a deep breath and threw out his second Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Your turn, Stonjourner!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Emerging onto the battlefield was a massive Pok\u233?mon composed of large, irregularly shaped rocks. Its legs were especially thick and sturdy, making it well-suited for powerful kicking attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bzzzt\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Stonjourner appeared, golden static sparks burst from Rotom, striking the Rock-type Pok\u233?mon right on entry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thunder Wave!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stonjourner was paralyzed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was a little surprised by Gordie's choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had originally thought Gordie would send out his Contrary Shuckle, using its Fortress Strategy to stall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Stonjourner\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was an interesting pick.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because Stonjourner had only one ability: Power Spot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Power Spot: Increases the power of allied Pok\u233?mon's attacks by 30%.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This ability made Stonjourner a great support Pok\u233?mon in doubles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But in single battles?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even as Johan processed this, Gordie remained confident. He clenched his fist and called out:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stonjourner, Wonder Room!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whooom\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stonjourner lifted both arms, and an eerie, shimmering barrier descended onto the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Within this Wonder Room, the Defense and Special Defense stats of all Pok\u233?mon swapped!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, I get it now! Stonjourner has insane physical Defense but terrible Special Defense. With Wonder Room, its Special Defense just skyrocketed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And since Stonjourner is naturally super slow, the paralysis Speed drop doesn't really matter."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom is a Special Attacker, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But\u8230? Stonjourner is already paralyzed, and knowing Professor Johan\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had anticipated this move, so he immediately followed up:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, Will-O-Wisp."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A burst of blue spectral flames ignited around Stonjourner, burning it on the spot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stonjourner is now burned!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The audience instantly knew what was coming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had seen this before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A few days ago, Johan had played the role of an all-out attacker.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Today? He was back to his status-inflicting, stall-heavy, toxic playstyle!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stonjourner, Gravity!" Gordie called out, staying unfazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bzzzt\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcs of energy crackled around Stonjourner as it released a strange, invisible force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, a distorted gravity field spread across the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stonjourner's massive stone legs sank slightly, and dark energy rippled outward from its core.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wash Rotom's Levitate ability was nullified\u8212?forcing it to land on the ground!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Roto!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Rotom was unfazed. The washing machine's front door swung open, and a surge of water burst out, rushing straight toward Stonjourner!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hydro Pump!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The attack hit dead on!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the effects of Gravity, all moves except one-hit KO attacks had increased accuracy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Hydro Pump\u8212?one of Wash Rotom's strongest Water-type moves\u8212?was no exception.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, because of Wonder Room, Stonjourner's Special Defense was now swapped with its high physical Defense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, despite taking a super-effective hit\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It survived!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, again\u8212?Hydro Pump!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Another powerful torrent of water shot out, slamming into Stonjourner!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Stonjourner, Earthquake!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bzzzt\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this time, the paralysis kicked in\u8212?and Stonjourner failed to move!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Gordie had gotten just one successful Earthquake off, Rotom might've been in trouble.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8230? paralysis had finally worked in Johan's favor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And with the burn damage ticking away, Stonjourner collapsed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stonjourner is unable to battle!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gordie\u8230? smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Stone Formation was now complete.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, the real battle was about to begin!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
