He didn't actually think the Sinnoh League was rigging anything\u8212?major organizations didn't operate like that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8230? it was a little suspicious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint rubbed his chin thoughtfully and posed a hypothesis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe\u8230?" he said, stroking his imaginary beard, "it's just Professor Johan's luck?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He smiled and clapped Flint on the shoulder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flint, Garchomp wants to spar with you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nice! Let's do it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint was completely unfazed, even looking excited.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr!! (\u9660?\u30399?\u9660?#)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nearby, Garchomp\u8212?its mouth covered in whipped cream\u8212?bared its fangs with a low growl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why the hell should I listen to you?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan added:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No restrictions."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint: "???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That evening\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Having promised Garchomp a feast, Johan was now hard at work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it was just one Garchomp, things would be manageable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the problem was\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finished!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar held up its empty bowl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar lifted its "bedpan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Me too!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr\u8212?hic\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Garchomp let out a burp, blinking in disbelief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It could accept losing to Gengar in a eating contest\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But to a baby Larvitar?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unforgivable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Give me another half bowl!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rubbed his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This is how my savings disappear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pok\u233?blocks were meant to be snacks, not full meals!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was all Flint's fault.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd pay for this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Somewhere, Flint sneezed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh? Did I catch a cold?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Incoming call, Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom hovered over with Johan's phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, seizing the perfect escape, grabbed the phone and walked onto the balcony.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without even checking the caller ID, he picked up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan, it's me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A familiar voice came through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan glanced at the screen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor Sycamore?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm organizing a research conference soon. Would you be interested in attending?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A research conference?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes\u8212?about Mega Evolution."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan immediately recalled something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Previously, Professor Sycamore had mentioned his plan to publicly release part of his research on Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had even shown Johan a draft paper detailing his current findings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although many aspects of Mega Evolution were still not fully understood, Sycamore believed that such a groundbreaking discovery should be shared with the world as soon as possible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A research conference\u8230?" Johan mused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes. Since you're participating in the Lily of the Valley Conference, I've scheduled it for after the tournament ends," Sycamore said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearly, he had been keeping an eye on the tournament\u8212?both he and his assistant Alain had been following the matches closely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then, as if struck by a realization, Sycamore's voice suddenly took on an excited tone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait a minute\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan could feel the expectation in his voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are you saying\u8230? you'll be showcasing Mega Evolution during this tournament?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That would be huge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Given the massive audience watching the Lily of the Valley Conference, if Johan demonstrated Mega Evolution in an official battle, the impact would be astronomical.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Did I say that?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But then again\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't entirely impossible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's just say the chances are low but not zero."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He couldn't say for sure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After analyzing Tobias's battles, Johan felt that\u8212?even with Darkrai and Latios\u8212?his opponent hadn't shown anything yet that truly forced him to reveal Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tobias was secretly hiding four more Legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that would be fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Tobias really had an entire team of Mythicals and Legendaries\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then Johan wouldn't hold back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They'd go down together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's\u8230?" Sycamore hesitated before laughing. "Well, let's see how things go. I'll be watching closely!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, by the way," he added, "I heard that after the tournament, a noble from Sinnoh plans to host an exhibition match\u8212?probably to capitalize on the hype. They're inviting some top trainers, and they might even extend invitations to the Elite Four."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was information Johan had learned from Cynthia.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he won the Lily of the Valley Conference, there was a high chance he'd be invited.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if that happened\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The timing would be perfect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The tournament's attention would still be at its peak, but the exhibition match wouldn't have the same intense competitive pressure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A public debut of Mega Evolution at an exhibition match would be ideal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm\u8230?" Sycamore murmured in thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If that's the case, maybe we should wait a little longer," he agreed. "That'll also give me more time to finalize some of my research."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sounds good," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright then\u8212?focus on your battles, and good luck in the tournament!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry, I'm sweeping through this."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
