{\qc
418: As Long as I Knock Them All Out Instantly, Stamina Won\u8217?t Be an Issue!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
January 21st.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The day of the Lily of the Valley Conference's quarterfinals had arrived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Today is!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The battle for the semifinals!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The host's energetic voice echoed through the Lily of the Valley Conference stadium.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tobias stood at the highest railing of the venue, leaning on it slightly as Darkrai emerged from behind him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Noticing Darkrai, Tobias remained expressionless and casually asked,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Do you think Mr. Johan will sweep all six today?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That depends on which Pok\u233?mon he sends out."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Recently, whenever Tobias had free time, he would come to watch Johan's battles in person. Darkrai, as a result, was "forced" to watch many as well, so it had developed a general understanding of Johan's strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What do you mean?" Tobias grew interested.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If it's that Gengar, then it shouldn't be a problem," Darkrai said seriously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tobias found something amusing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He highly admired Johan, while Darkrai greatly admired Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Perhaps that was the bond between them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then tell me, how confident are you if you face Gengar?" Tobias asked curiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Darkrai pondered for a moment before saying slowly, "Sixty-forty."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tobias showed a hint of surprise and remarked,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I remember Mr. Johan once said something very interesting."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What was it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There are three great illusions in life: 'My phone is ringing,' 'She likes me,' and 'I can counterattack successfully.'"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Darkrai's expression darkened for a moment, but it quickly turned into a teasing smirk.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who likes you?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey!" Tobias was furious. "Duel me!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Darkrai sneered. "Bring it on!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Saying that, it pulled out a deck of cards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a brief pause, it added, "Don't you dare use my card!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tobias smirked. "Not only will I use it, but I'll use the UR version!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and Kabu stepped onto the battlefield at the host's signal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cheers erupted in the circular arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu, a middle-aged man in his late 30s or early 40s, wore a standard Galar region red trainer outfit, with the number "187" printed on it, symbolizing "Spark."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A towel was draped around his neck, and sweat glistened on his cheeks as he lightly panted, as if he had just finished exercising.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once a Gym Leader but now stripped of his title, Kabu, however, showed no sign of discouragement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As he put it:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm still young. As long as I fight with the spirit of the young, it's all good! Strength speaks for itself\u8212?simple as that."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not everyone is willing to abandon everything and start over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu was definitely a trainer worthy of respect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mr. Johan, is it okay if I call you that?" Kabu wiped the remaining sweat off his forehead with his towel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Of course, Mr. Kabu. You can also just call me Johan," Johan replied with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu nodded, his eyes gradually growing determined. "I've been looking forward to this battle for a long time, so please, show me your full strength!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's expression also became serious as he replied solemnly, "Of course!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Trainers, send out your Pok\u233?mon!" the referee signaled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Torkoal!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation, Kabu tossed his first Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This match, which would determine a spot in the semifinals, followed a 6v6 rotational battle format.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oooh~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Torkoal appeared, the burning coal on its back released a scorching orange beam into the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The sunlight over the entire battlefield became more intense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drought ability activated!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The already clear weather turned into Harsh Sunlight!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone knew Torkoal\u8212?nicknamed "Little Groudon"\u8212?was one of the top weather setters for sun teams. It could even excel in Trick Room strategies with a devastating Overheat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the Pok\u233?mon Johan sent out was\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku~!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the red light emerged a small, gray-and-white bear with an intensely serious expression. It tightened its headband and waved its fists, exuding an aura of determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was none other than Johan's elite Kubfu!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who dares challenge me? State your name! I do not fight nameless opponents!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oooh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Torkoal blinked in confusion and looked at Kabu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What did it just say? Why does it sound like complete nonsense?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Battle begin!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Torkoal, use Overheat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu gave his command without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oooh!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Torkoal wasn't fazed by Kubfu's words. It lifted its head and roared, as flames erupted from the holes in its shell.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next moment, molten lava-like fire spewed from Torkoal's mouth, engulfing the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Overheat's power starts at 150, and with the boost from Harsh Sunlight, if it hit Kubfu, even if it didn't faint immediately, the battle would be tough going forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan had clearly anticipated this, so he remained calm and commanded:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kubfu, use Dig!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, dirt and dust flew up as Kubfu vanished underground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu frowned slightly and said in a deep voice, "Torkoal, use Smokescreen!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whooosh\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thick black smoke spewed from Torkoal's mouth, completely enveloping its body, making it difficult for Kubfu to locate it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what they didn't know was that Kubfu had already locked onto Torkoal using Aura!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To a Pok\u233?mon that could sense Aura, Smokescreen was practically useless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ground suddenly exploded, and a devastating underground strike flipped Torkoal over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Now, use Brick Break!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu seized the moment, targeting Torkoal's weaker underbelly, and delivered a powerful punch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a pained cry, Torkoal was sent flying before crashing heavily to the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A critical hit! Torkoal is unable to battle!" The referee waved his flag, declaring the result.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Battle Continued\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That was fast!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A critical hit! Otherwise, Torkoal's defense wouldn't have fallen that quickly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This battle style is totally different from Johan's previous matches!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite Torkoal's loss, Kabu showed little change in expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His Drought-Torkoal strategy was designed to go all-in with one powerful move. Since Overheat missed, its low Speed meant it wouldn't be able to mount another offense effectively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But it had done its job.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The harsh sunlight still burned intensely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And through that exchange, Kabu had also gained a newfound respect for Kubfu's Dig strategy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking a deep breath, he quickly tossed out his second Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kabu's second Pok\u233?mon is... Scovillain!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had a humanoid form, with green skin, and two heads resembling chili peppers\u8212?one green and one red.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scovillain, the Spicy Pok\u233?mon, was a Grass/Fire-type said to have originated from Paldea. It was an excellent Sun Team mixed wall and speed attacker.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the Harsh Sunlight, Scovillain's body shimmered with light.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Chlorophyll ability activated!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Chlorophyll: Doubles Speed during Harsh Sunlight.]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The battle resumed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Scovillain, use Solar Beam!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bright light rapidly gathered around Scovillain's two ferocious heads.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, Solar Beam required charging, but under Harsh Sunlight, it fired instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Johan gave a command that stunned everyone:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Charge forward, Kubfu!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu didn't hesitate for even a second\u8212?or rather, its thoughts were completely in sync with Johan's. It took a deep breath, sharpened its focus, and charged straight at Scovillain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The opponent was fast, but if it could close the distance, the advantage would be back in its hands!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No Dig this time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because while Dig was sometimes a great move, if the opponent predicted the narrow tunnel's location, Kubfu could become an easy target.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scovillain's Solar Beam blasted forward, radiating intense heat and light, aimed directly at Kubfu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Break through it!" Johan commanded, narrowing his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu, with its full concentration, swung its fists straight into the beam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boom!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Light scattered in all directions, as if fire itself had been shattered by sheer force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu had seen through it!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To the spectators, it looked as though Kubfu was punching through Solar Beam with its bare hands, evoking the image of someone deflecting a Kamehameha with pure strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The distance between the two Pok\u233?mon closed rapidly, in a way no one expected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu exuded overwhelming momentum.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And when it came to momentum\u8212?Kabu prided himself on never backing down!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Johan was going for an all-out offensive approach today, then Kabu would respond in kind!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Scovillain, use Overheat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whoosh\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two pepper-shaped heads of Scovillain began to move. The green head released a burst of spicy green powder, while the red head prepared to unleash all of its stored firepower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's lips curled into a slight grin, his gaze sharp as he clenched his fist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Close combat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most of the audience didn't even see Kubfu's movement\u8212?it was just a blur of white light, followed by an explosion in the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, Kubfu appeared directly in front of Scovillain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, it spread its arms wide\u8212?before unleashing a barrage of punches as fast as falling raindrops, each one hitting harder than the last.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such overwhelming power!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Speed and strength were often interchangeable\u8212?but sometimes, pure strength could also create speed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Scovillain's flames erupted at the same time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two attacks clashed in the most direct way possible!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?there was still technique involved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For example, Kubfu deliberately targeted Scovillain's red chili head, striking it several times in quick succession, forcing it backward\u8212?thus redirecting its flames away from itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And that\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Decided the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM\u8212?!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scovillain was sent flying, both of its four eyes spiraling into swirls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu, still wreathed in lingering flames, shook them off with a powerful stance, its fur scorched black, but its eyes shining with fierce determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku!! (\u9660?\u12295?\u9660?*)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It spread its arms wide and let out a victorious cry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I don't know why\u8230? but this battle just fired me up!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan's tactical skills are impressive, but\u8230? I think I like this straightforward brawler style even more!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But Kubfu's condition isn't looking great either. Close Combat is a high-risk move\u8212?it leaves the user worn down afterward."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"At this rate, there's no way it can sweep all six, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone knew that reckless brawler strategies, unless backed by a huge level advantage, usually maxed out at a 3-0 streak before running out of stamina.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Condition?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu simply clenched its fists and took a battle stance again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was in peak condition!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because as long as it could knock out every opponent in one hit\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then stamina wasn't an issue at all!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
----------\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
