{\qc
419: Who Isn\u8217?t a Legendary Pok\u233?mon at This Point!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Losing two Pok\u233?mon put some pressure on Kabu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't expected that in a direct exchange, Scovillain would ultimately fail to take down Kubfu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, just as the audience had noted, Kubfu's condition wasn't great.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On top of that, after using Close Combat, its defenses were lowered\u8212?this was the perfect time to finish it off!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, Kabu was a little more cautious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finally, he threw out his third Pok\u233? Ball, summoning his third Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kabu's third Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Arcanine!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A large canine Pok\u233?mon with a thick, flaxen-colored mane, a body covered in tiger-like black and orange stripes, and an expression that exuded majesty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcanine, the Legendary Pok\u233?mon, Fire-type!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcanine was a Pok\u233?mon of ancient Eastern legends, once said to have fought alongside a great warrior to govern a nation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in the day, Arcanine truly existed as a Legendary Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo\u8212?!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A long howl echoed, carrying an intimidating presence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Intimidate Ability, activated!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu tensed up, its fur bristling under the overwhelming pressure of Arcanine's roar, but it gritted its teeth and refused to take a step back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, Kubfu roared back at Arcanine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A faint aura of Aura energy surged around Kubfu, rippling through its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Noticing this, even Johan was slightly surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcanine's presence had actually further awakened Kubfu's Aura?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though Kubfu's physical condition seemed poor, Johan could sense that its mental state was exceptionally strong\u8212?stronger than ever before!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine, Extreme Speed!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu barked his command.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whether or not Arcanine's Intimidate had worked, its role was clear\u8212?to finish off Kubfu as quickly as possible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A white glow enveloped Arcanine as it lunged at Kubfu with the wind at its back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aura!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eyes gleamed faintly, syncing with Kubfu's Aura.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To them, Arcanine's movements seemed significantly slower.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Detect! Block it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the audience's perspective, all they saw was Arcanine turning into a streak of white light\u8212?then came a muffled impact as Arcanine's front paws clashed with Kubfu's hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More precisely, Kubfu had caught Arcanine's front paws.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu and Johan's expressions turned serious at the same time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine, Flare Blitz!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shhh!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Intense flames erupted from Arcanine's body, engulfing it instantly. Given their close proximity, Kubfu couldn't avoid being affected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Focus Punch!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu and Arcanine sought to use their close range to deal damage\u8212?but Johan had the same idea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu let out a low growl, ignoring the flames licking at its body. One paw held Arcanine's leg tightly, while the other clenched into a fist and drew back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A dazzling white glow enveloped its fist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Power surged within, gathering to a peak before Kubfu hurled its punch forward!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu's Focus Punch crashed down like a tidal wave, drawing gasps from the audience.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes!!" Flint clenched his fist tightly, as if he were the one battling instead of Kubfu. "Holding the opponent in place so it can't dodge\u8212?this Focus Punch is guaranteed to hit!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian and the others, despite their excitement, couldn't help but feel a bit worried.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint's strategy was exhilarating, but\u8230? Kubfu was likely at its limit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The punch struck Arcanine square on the head. With a whimper, it was sent flying, its flames extinguished in an instant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arcanine flinched, its head dazed from the impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu staggered slightly but didn't hesitate to chase after it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan furrowed his brows slightly but still commanded firmly:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Close Combat!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flurry of relentless attacks rained down on Arcanine, giving it no chance to dodge or counter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the time Kubfu's assault ceased, Arcanine had already collapsed, unable to battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu, breathing heavily, plopped down onto the ground.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Arcanine is unable to battle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Woah\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That was a comeback kill?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Other people's comebacks are flukes, but when it's Johan, it's real?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Still, Kubfu looks completely exhausted."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There's no way it can survive this too, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu truly was at its limit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike Charcadet, which could sustain itself with its Life Fire and practically acted like it had a Leftovers item, Kubfu had no means of recovery.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Kabu was no joke\u8212?he was a Gym Leader, after all. His Pok\u233?mon posed a serious threat to Kubfu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu recalled Arcanine and wiped his forehead with a towel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pressure was intense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He hadn't expected Kubfu to survive that exchange.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Taking a deep breath, Kabu calmed himself. He realized he had been too impatient, too eager to finish off Kubfu, which had disrupted his usual battle rhythm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With this realization, Kabu quickly adjusted his mindset.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regardless of Kubfu's current state, he would treat it as if it were still at full strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With that in mind\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu pulled out his fourth Pok\u233? Ball and tossed it forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Pok\u233?mon with a crimson body, burning flames along its tendril-like appendages, and a menacing presence appeared\u8212?Centiskorch!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Centiskorch, the Radiator Pok\u233?mon, Fire- and Bug-type, and Kabu's signature Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon entering the battlefield, its flame-like tendrils flared up intensely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Centiskorch, Will-O-Wisp!" Kabu commanded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since Kubfu was a physical attacker, burning it to lower its offensive power was the safest and most effective strategy!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ssshh\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Centiskorch hissed, its heater-like abdomen glowing as it launched a ball of eerie blue flames toward Kubfu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, Johan pulled out a Pok\u233? Ball.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew Kubfu's condition better than anyone\u8212?there was no need to force it to keep fighting just to satisfy the crowd's desire for a one-on-six performance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu had already done more than enough. He was proud of it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu braced itself against its knees and stood up, shaking its head firmly at Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu grinned, revealing a goofy smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What kind of general runs from battle?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If I fight, I fight until the last moment! If I fall, I fall on the battlefield!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: ...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah\u8230? He should probably stop telling Kubfu about {\i
Romance of the Three Kingdoms}. Maybe switch to {\i
Makka Pakka} stories instead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Kubfu's eyes were resolute.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Panting heavily, its thick eyebrows and sharp eyes burned with the desire for battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why should Tobias and Darkrai be the only ones allowed to sweep teams? Am I not just as good as them?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all my training, after all the "blessings" I've received from nature\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who isn't a Legendary Pok\u233?mon at this point!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ku!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ignoring its injuries, Kubfu twisted its body and delivered a powerful kick.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Will-O-Wisp was shattered on impact, its embers scattering around Kubfu like falling stars.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Standing tall amidst the flickering flames, Kubfu made its stance clear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This Kubfu\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kabu muttered, his gaze sharpening. Even he could feel Kubfu's unyielding determination.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It reminded him of himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once, he had been a renowned Gym Leader, respected by many\u8212?only to lose it all due to his own arrogance. But he never gave up. He persevered and climbed back up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder Kubfu had fought this far.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You are a worthy opponent. So\u8212?Centiskorch, Inferno Overdrive!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Centiskorch's fiery tendrils blazed, its heater glowing red-hot as a tidal wave of flames surged forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Facing the roaring inferno\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan exhaled softly, a relaxed smile forming on his lips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu, staring straight into the flames, wore the exact same smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The fire swallowed Kubfu whole.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if anyone with Aura vision were present, they would see it\u8212?Johan's and Kubfu's Auras intertwining.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's Aura poured into Kubfu like a raging river.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then let's fight\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From within the inferno, an explosion of energy erupted\u8212?followed by a radiant white glow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd erupted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait\u8230? is it\u8212??!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap, it's evolving!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kubfu evolved at the most critical moment?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A battlefield evolution!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the brilliant light enveloped Kubfu, its small frame expanded rapidly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The years of relentless training, the honed muscles\u8212?now fully realized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Standing over two meters tall, its chiseled physique exuded raw power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its gray fur rippled in the wind, its headband fluttering.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The embodiment of strength and elegance\u8212?Urshifu had arrived.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a mighty roar, Urshifu's aura skyrocketed, dispersing the surrounding flames.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap, it really evolved!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I see it now! Joha\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
n used evolution to restore Kubfu to full strength!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait\u8230? that's allowed?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who said Kubfu couldn't recover? Evolution solves everything!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Staring at the now towering and battle-ready Urshifu, the audience fell into stunned silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu has entered the battlefield!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
To continue where we left off:}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the previous battle, I contacted another victim through Officer Jenny and the former owner of the breeding house.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I figured that since we were both victims, we could discuss how to take down that damn Pok\u233?mon hunter together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, we decided to meet up for a meal first and then talk things through.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And guess what?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I had no idea before, but when I saw them in person, I was shocked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other victim turned out to be a stunning, fair-skinned, wealthy beauty! And if there was one thing that stood out about her\u8212?it was this:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Rich, rich, and rich!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She told me that while she was upset about getting scammed, she had no real way to recover her losses, so she just wrote it off\u8212?after all, it was just a small sum to her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I immediately thought, {\i
Man, if only I could have that kind of "small sum" too...} Ahem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I told her that we couldn't just let criminals roam free, so\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
