{\qc
421: Urshifu \u183? Grandmaster of Tai Chi?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The quarterfinals had concluded, and Johan advanced to the semifinals without any surprises.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, his method of victory had left many in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A complete sweep!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And his opponent was a former Gym Leader!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though Kabu had lost his position as a Gym Leader due to certain reasons and had decided to start over from scratch, his strength was widely recognized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For Johan to sweep such an opponent\u8212?who could even take a single point from him?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That said, the competition level in this year's Lily of the Valley Conference was ridiculously high. The remaining contestants all had a shot at the title.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This only continued to raise the tournament's popularity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But an interesting detail had surfaced among the spectators.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The runner-up of the Indigo Conference\u8212?Guderian\u8212?had witnessed Johan's full team firsthand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because of this, the value of Guderian's runner-up title had skyrocketed online.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, however, only chuckled at the discussions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was more concerned with Urshifu's current state.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar floated beside Urshifu, scratching its head, then hovering up to measure itself against Urshifu's height. It was surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, we're the same height now!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan glanced sideways at Gengar's levitating feet, which were still dangling in midair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You sure about that?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cha~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton, Charcadet, and Larvitar all tilted their heads up, staring at Urshifu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back in the day, the four of them were around the same height\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now? Urshifu had shot up to two meters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What were they supposed to do now? Jump up to punch his kneecaps?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite, on the other hand, was very satisfied.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Previously, it had been the tallest Pok\u233?mon on Johan's team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar was big too, but that was just because it was fat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that Urshifu had evolved, Dragonite no longer looked like a towering giant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu!! (\u9679?\u65344?()\u9679?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu crossed its arms, its face serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Enough posing," Johan said, petting his little Ninetales. "Relax already."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu~ (\u243?\u242?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu grinned sheepishly, scratching the back of its head. Its serious aura collapsed in an instant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been posing for the Rotom phone's camera.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, it crouched down and started fighting Larvitar over an energy cube.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking at this gluttonous Urshifu, who would have guessed it was the same Pok\u233?mon that had just dominated the battlefield with raw power and precision?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But as Johan watched Urshifu devour its meal, his expression gradually stiffened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A drop of cold sweat rolled down his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh no\u8230? oh no!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu had grown bigger. And according to the "size = appetite" equation (except for Larvitar, of course)\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its food consumption was going to\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu~ (\u969?`)_\u19988?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu held up its empty bowl, looking at Johan expectantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yep. Just as he feared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like when Dragonair evolved into Dragonite\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Financial disaster.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Larvitar already being a bottomless pit, Urshifu's evolution had added even more pressure to Johan's already tight budget.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After giving Urshifu another bowl of energy cubes, Johan checked its Pok\u233?dex entry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had glanced at it during the battle, but some details had confused him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Urshifu]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Type: Fighting/Water]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Ability: Unseen Fist]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Moves: Leer, Rock Smash, Endure, Focus Energy, Aerial Ace, Scary Face, Headbutt, Brick Break\u8230? Aura Sphere, Aqua Jet, Surging Strikes]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Mood: Excited, Joyful (Who isn't a Legendary Pok\u233?mon at this point?!)]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Status: Excellent (Everything tastes amazing!)]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Friendship: 100 (Do I look more like Guan Yu, Zhang Fei\u8230? or maybe Zhao Yun?!)]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?It's terminal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what really intrigued Johan was why Urshifu had evolved into Rapid Strike Style.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was it because its opponent specialized in Fire-types?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for why it had evolved, Johan wasn't surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There had been plenty of warning signs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Kubfu had already mastered both the Single Strike and Rapid Strike techniques.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Other Kubfu had to climb the Towers of Two Fists and read the scrolls to evolve because they needed to learn one of the two techniques.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But in reality, the requirement for evolution wasn't climbing the towers\u8212?it was mastering the techniques within the scrolls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan suddenly thought of something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Urshifu, aren't you sleepy today?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, Urshifu would get drowsy throughout the day, but today\u8230? it hadn't taken a single nap.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as Johan spoke, Urshifu yawned, stretched, and immediately fell asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the moment it did, everyone turned to stare at it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though Urshifu was snoring, its face looked serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It exuded a ferocious aura, then suddenly walked to the side and began shadowboxing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Each punch sent a sharp gust of wind through the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?CRACK.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Several meters away, the wall suddenly cracked open from the impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu\u8230? zzZ."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As if realizing that it might accidentally destroy the house, Urshifu took a few steps back before resuming its practice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But every punch still carried a terrifying force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kah~ (\u969?`)?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar rubbed its chin, deep in thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a Ghost-type, it normally wouldn't fear punches.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But for some reason\u8230? it felt threatened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, however, understood immediately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because Urshifu's Pok\u233?dex entry had changed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its Fighting/Water typing had shifted to Fighting/Dark!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And its Aqua Jet and Surging Strikes had been replaced by Wicked Blow and Sucker Punch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh, great.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It's a fusion-style Urshifu?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait a second\u8230? did Master Mustard forget to tell me something important?" Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, both Urshifu styles had identical base stats and similar fighting techniques\u8212?only their typings and move styles differed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So\u8230? does this mean that Urshifu is more aggressive when asleep because it's in Single Strike Style?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And more active when awake because it's in Rapid Strike Style?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was like a split personality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No, a split "bear"sonality.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, a crazy idea popped into Johan's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What if Urshifu could merge both styles\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Combining the raw power of Single Strike with the fluidity of Rapid Strike?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Would that create a new form?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu \u183? Grandmaster of Tai Chi?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Merging two different martial arts styles wasn't easy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Mustard hadn't achieved it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was just wishful thinking.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cha~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton walked up to Urshifu and tapped its knee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu? zzZ"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu looked confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cha~ Cha~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Give me your hands\u8212?I'll make you new knuckle guards!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton had recently crafted a set for Kubfu, but now that it had evolved, they no longer fit.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu~ zzZ"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu nodded and handed over its now-too-small knuckle guards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar waddled over, grinning as it pointed at the tiny knuckle guards.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You're not using them anymore\u8230? can I have them?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?CRUNCH.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar ate them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Larvitar\u8230? are minerals not enough for you anymore?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he could even react\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan! The semifinal matchups have been announced!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised his hand to stop Rotom. "Let me guess\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's either Tobias or Guzma."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Correct! Your next opponent\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Guzma from Alola!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Time to crush him tomorrow."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
January 22.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lily of the Valley Conference\u8212?Semifinals, begin!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
