{\qc
423: Johan\u8212?Next!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Guzma is switching Pok\u233?mon\u8212?entering the field is Orbeetle!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At first glance, Orbeetle looked like a seven-spotted ladybug, but beyond its beetle-like shell, it also had a humanoid body, complete with arms, a torso, a waist, and legs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Orbeetle, the Seven Spot Pok\u233?mon. A Bug/Psychic-type known for its incredible intelligence, making it one of the smartest Bug Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment Orbeetle landed, its eyes glowed faintly with psychic energy\u8212?it had just scanned Dragonite's held item\u8212?a Sharp Beak!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Orbeetle, Trick Room!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Guzma, with both hands still in his pockets, had learned his lesson from before. This time, he went for immediate control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the flapping of Orbeetle's wings, a twisted, transparent force field spread outward, reversing the speed order.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dragonite remained unfazed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its body shimmered white, and it rushed toward Orbeetle at extreme speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's Extreme Speed!" the announcer shouted. "Priority moves like Extreme Speed are unaffected by Trick Room!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Plus, Orbeetle was already fast\u8212?so Trick Room didn't give it a huge advantage anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Orbeetle was knocked backward by Dragonite's charge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Guzma didn't panic\u8212?he even chuckled slightly and ordered:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"U-turn!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BZZT!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Orbeetle's thin, translucent wings vibrated rapidly, its body glowing pale blue as it spun around and rammed into Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as the attack landed, Orbeetle would be recalled to its Pok\u233? Ball, allowing Guzma to send out a new Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Did he teach every single one of his Pok\u233?mon U-turn?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, if every Pok\u233?mon uses U-turn once per switch, couldn't he just wear down his opponent little by little?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This strategy is kinda dirty\u8230? it's got Johan's signature style."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Infinite U-turn switching?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Stealth Rock was on the field, Guzma's team would be in big trouble.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan had already identified Guzma's game plan\u8212?there was no way he'd fall for the same trick twice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the saying goes\u8212?"The same move won't work twice against a Saint Seiya!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan calmly commanded: "Air Slash."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite's small wings flapped rapidly, summoning a violent gust that carried two bright white blades straight toward Orbeetle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM! BAM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A dull impact sounded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CRACK!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A crack appeared on Orbeetle's shell, and as it let out a pained cry, its body suddenly stiffened\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flinch!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
U-turn was forcibly interrupted!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Guzma's expression froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was this a mixed-attacker Dragonite?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And its luck was this good?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Orbeetle flinched!" the announcer's voice boomed excitedly. "It looks like luck is finally on Johan's side!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wing Attack."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's voice sounded again, and Dragonite flapped its wings, striking Orbeetle with another blow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BAM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Orbeetle is unable to battle!" the referee immediately announced.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the giant screen, one of Guzma's Pok\u233? Balls turned gray.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan secured the first victory, and the crowd erupted in excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Trying to play dirty against Johan? Useless!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I hereby declare Johan the true master of underhanded tactics!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He actually got lucky for once\u8212?I'm so mad!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite hovered in the air, its expression unchanged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Luck?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was pure skill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just basic mechanics\u8212?no need to overreact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nice one!" Flint punched the air in the VIP box. "That punk was getting cocky\u8212?make him pay!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Flint calling someone else cocky was pure irony.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the battlefield, Guzma expressionlessly recalled Orbeetle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, he would scold his Pok\u233?mon for losing, but this time, he didn't.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In his mind, Johan had just gotten lucky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was nothing to criticize.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Guzma pulled out another Pok\u233? Ball, his expression more serious than before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Crush it, Vikavolt!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
