437: The Impact of Mega Evolution\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, Mega Evolution, and Super Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These three terms became the hottest topics across the entire Pok\u233?mon League network.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even in reality, the discussions were just as intense.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Gengar that had already reached its third evolutionary stage had managed to evolve once more!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
According to {\i
The Authenticity and Feasibility of Mega Evolution}, this phenomenon was called Super Evolution, also known as Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Professor Sycamore's research paper stated that, based on his and Johan's investigations, Gengar was not the only Pok\u233?mon capable of Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The exact number of Pok\u233?mon that could Mega Evolve was still uncertain, but some had already been confirmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pok\u233?mon such as Gengar, Metagross, Garchomp, and Gyarados had been identified as having Mega Evolution potential.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, the requirements for Mega Evolution were strict.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not only did it require the rare Keystone, but it also needed an even rarer specific Mega Stone corresponding to the Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More importantly, Mega Evolution required a strong bond between the Trainer and the Pok\u233?mon, though the exact threshold for this bond remained unclear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with these limitations, countless Trainers became obsessed with the idea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The search for Mega Stones was bound to trigger a massive wave of exploration and travel in the coming months.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But that was a story for another time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, Johan had single-handedly shaken the entire Pok\u233?mon world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it wasn't just about Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had defeated Elite Four Bruno!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although he had used Mega Evolution to do so, that power was still part of Johan and Gengar's own strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mega Evolution is insane! Johan is unbeatable!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He actually took down Bruno!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bruno got clapped!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch, it was just an exhibition match. No big deal. I'd only admit Johan is strong if\u8230? he gives me a Mega Stone."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bro, I can hear your scheming all the way from Kalos."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In short, Johan had once again blown up in popularity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, however, the impact extended far beyond anything before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The exhibition match had ended, but the roaring cheers of the crowd still filled the venue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had been called an exhibition match, but with the level of intensity, the strategies, and especially the shock factor of Mega Evolution, the battle had felt as real as any official League match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bruno's final resistance, Machamp's overwhelming power, and Gengar's ultimate counterattack had left the audience burning with excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This exhibition match had been worth every Pok\u233?dollar spent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it had also proven one thing\u8212?Johan's influence was enormous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was obvious that, in the future, many tournament organizers and corporate sponsors would be fighting to invite him to events, offering skyrocketing appearance fees.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unintentionally, Johan had just advertised himself using the power of Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, with that influence, more people would also come to him for answers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was no doubt that Trainers, researchers, and corporate executives alike would bombard him with questions about Mega Evolution.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Might as well open up shop and start charging consultation fees.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the waves of cheers continued, Johan and Bruno walked toward the ruined battlefield and shook hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You really lived up to your name, Johan." Bruno smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His battle aura had faded, replaced by a warm and friendly demeanor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No matter how intense the battle had been, at the end of the day, it was just a battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Win or lose, it didn't change anything between them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like how Flint had been beaten by Cynthia over a hundred times yet still called her "Big Sis" without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just got lucky," Johan said with a grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Gengar hadn't been able to Mega Evolve, the outcome might have been very different.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But one thing was certain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
