After resting in Twinleaf Town for a few days, Johan was preparing to return to Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
School was about to start!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Outside Twinleaf Town\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A League-assigned private jet was already waiting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan-sensei, I'll miss you!" Flint grinned. "I'll come visit you in Hoenn when I get the chance!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah! And when I do, we're having a battle!" Bruno flashed a thumbs-up, his pearly white teeth gleaming.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's expression twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Time to leave\u8212?fast!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He boarded the plane, closed the hatch, and waved at Cynthia outside the window.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sinnoh\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A land of endless trouble.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the plane took off, Twinleaf Town grew smaller and smaller in his view.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From above\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He spotted Darkrai, standing atop the Space-Time Tower, watching his departure in silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Phew\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan leaned back into his seat, exhaling deeply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was finally over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This five-million Pok\u233?dollar mission\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hadn't been worth it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He might as well have just competed in the Pok\u233?mon League.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unfortunately\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that his Trainer rank had increased, he could no longer participate in regular League tournaments.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It felt like\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Playing a game, discovering an exploit to farm rare materials, and just when he started grinding efficiently\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The developers patched the bug.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ugh. Guess I need to plan out my team's training next."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
January had been an extremely busy month.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While his Pok\u233?mon hadn't neglected their training, they had also been thrown into high-difficulty battles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, being a meticulous planner, felt there were some areas that needed improvement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar was already the strongest Pok\u233?mon on his team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under normal circumstances\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had combat power on par with an Elite Four's ace Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Mega Evolution\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It could even challenge some veteran Elite Four members.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Mega Evolution becoming widespread, this advantage wouldn't last forever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar had mastered a lot of unconventional moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the right strategy\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It could even cause trouble for a Champion's main team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Given its wide movepool, Johan decided\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After Dark Void, he would have Gengar learn moves from different types to expand its versatility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Ninetales\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its Ice-type abilities were already top-notch, so the focus should be on refining its Fairy-type skills.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ideally\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan wanted to find a Fairy-type expert to mentor it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since the Fairy-type was only discovered recently, there were very few Fairy-type specialists in the world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arceus itself was missing its Fairy-type Plate\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At present, the only known Fairy-type specialists were:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Valerie, the Laverre City Gym Leader in Kalos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Opal, the Ballonlea Gym Leader in Galar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe I should ask Giovanni if he has any connections\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan considered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maybe his school's headmaster had better connections in this area.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll ask when I get back."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Dragonite\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This time, it had used Dual Outrage for the first time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had almost lost control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mastering Dual Outrage was far more difficult than using it once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if it could fully master it\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It might be able to challenge some Elite Four aces head-on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then there was Tinkaton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like Dragonite\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton had also received a Legendary Dragon's scale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their priority was simply adapting to their new power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With this upgrade\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their "Dragon Knight" combo had become an absolute Dragon-type killer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This Sinnoh journey had brought the biggest change to one Pok\u233?mon in particular\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kubfu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had finally evolved into Urshifu.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a Legendary Pok\u233?mon, Urshifu's power boost was significant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But since it had just evolved, it still needed time to fully adapt to its new form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was also thinking\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was there a way to combine its Single Strike and Rapid Strike forms?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A move that combined Surging Strikes and Wicked Blow\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who could possibly withstand that kind of devastating combo?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan continued planning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As he gazed out the plane window, he murmured\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I need a new source of income\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Pok\u233?mon League tournaments were no longer an option.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had to find another way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If only\u8230? I had a Diancie."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Any Pok\u233?mon that could generate gemstones and rare metals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What Pok\u233?mon produce minerals\u8230??"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
