As long as there isn't a giant Tentacruel, it should be fine\u8230?} Johan thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Johto's maritime routes had been thoroughly tested and approved, so they wouldn't pass through truly dangerous waters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
