As he spoke, the communicator connected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I-I don't know!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite the sudden crisis, Tabitha's composed demeanor helped the grunt gradually calm down. "We're still unclear on the details!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, the connection was completed, and the projection of Maxie, the leader of Team Magma, appeared on the large screen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He sat at his office desk, hands folded before his face, his tone indifferent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tabitha, what is it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
