Maxie's eyes, hidden behind his glasses, narrowed slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Only a few people know about the plan\u8212?there's no chance of a leak. It seems some other event has caused chaos. This is a good opportunity."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as the League wasn't targeting them, the greater the chaos, the better for Team Magma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
