While quickly working to restore order, he turned to the grunt and commanded,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tell our operative to be ready. The moment I give the signal, move immediately!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, sir!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mossdeep City\u8212?Steven's house.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After reporting the possible crisis to the League, Steven and Johan returned to Steven's home in the city.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say Steven had a "home" in nearly every town in Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
