When Rayquaza was mentioned as a possible arrival, Steven fully grasped the weight of the situation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he still couldn't figure out why Rayquaza might descend upon Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed and spread his hands. "Honestly, I hope I'm just overthinking things."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Perhaps the worst-case scenario wouldn't actually happen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the appearance of the purple-core Deoxys was now a certainty.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
