If it sensed the presence of the green-core Deoxys and flew straight here, things would be simple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan would just hand over the core and let them reunite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the movie "Destiny Deoxys," the story took place in LaRousse City, yet here, things had already deviated significantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More importantly\u8212?Gengar and Larvitar had seen the aurora from a recording, not from Mossdeep City itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
