Steven paused, then pressed a button on the wall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An entire section of the wall silently slid open, revealing an enormous fridge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan clicked his tongue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once again, he was reminded of the wealth gap.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
