Johan didn't answer directly. Instead, he said in a calm voice,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If things really go bad\u8230? I'll need that friend to fight for me."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
