469: It\u8217?s Time to Burn Everything, Charcadet! (BONUS)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The Man Who Gets Everything Reimbursed?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan slowly focused on the figure before him. He blinked, then sat up from the ground with a surprised expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Elite Four Glacia?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Golden hair coiled into an elegant updo, a regal purple low-cut dress, pristine white gloves, and pale green eyes...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She was none other than Glacia, one of Hoenn's Elite Four and the overseer of the Hoenn League's finances\u8212?er, rather, the one in charge of reimbursements!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why was she here?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh, right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Last night, Rayquaza and Deoxys had clashed. As one of Hoenn's Elite Four, it was natural for her to be called in for emergencies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Johan hadn't expected to run into her here at Steven's mansion in Verdanturf City after everything was already settled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Glacia covered her mouth with a refined chuckle. "It's a pleasure to meet you, Johan-sensei."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stood up, feeling slightly awkward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all\u8230? he had just sent a reimbursement request to Drake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But wait\u8212?wasn't Drake supposed to be the one signing off on it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan didn't know much about Glacia. Even back when he played the games, there wasn't much information about her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He did know that she specialized in Ice-types and that she wasn't originally from Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had moved to Hoenn because of its warmer climate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Glacia had a unique approach to training Ice Pok\u233?mon\u8212?she believed that they didn't need to be in icy environments all the time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, training in warmer climates could help Ice Pok\u233?mon overcome their natural weaknesses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was similar to Cynthia's training methods\u8212?she often took her Garchomp to snowy mountains like Mt. Coronet to build resistance to Ice-type attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for why a non-Hoenn native became part of Hoenn's Elite Four...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That wasn't unusual in the Pok\u233?mon world.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For example, Drasna was originally from Sinnoh but became an Elite Four member in Kalos.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the future, Koga, a Kanto Gym Leader, would later become an Elite Four member in Johto.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As long as someone could contribute, their region of origin didn't matter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After Johan stood up, Glacia took out a piece of paper, her expression playful as she read aloud:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"500 Oran Berries, 500 Rawst Berries, 500 Aspear Berries, 500 Lum Berries..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's expression stiffened slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the exact reimbursement list he had sent to Drake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, the quantity was a bit excessive\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But considering he had used up less than 100 berries' worth of Pok\u233?blocks and still filed for reimbursement, he had already been pushing it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Glacia pulled out another paper.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"5000 Oran Berries, 5000 Rawst Berries, 5000 Aspear Berries, 5000 Lum Berries..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eyes widened in shock.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was his exact list\u8212?but with everything multiplied by ten.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A moment later, he understood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was Drake's reimbursement request.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was 'middleman profit' in action!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had thought his reimbursement request was already outrageous\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Drake's?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even worse!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder they call him 'Reimbursement King'!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Glacia smirked, putting away the papers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bad habits start from the top. If the old man misbehaves, of course, the younger generation follows suit."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her voice turned cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sweatdropped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake, old man\u8230? can you not mess around like this?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan-sensei," Glacia's tone softened again. She smiled. "Should I approve your reimbursement request?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ahem."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan cleared his throat, noticing the way she looked at him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a moment of silence, he nodded seriously and said, "Yes. You should."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh?" Glacia raised an eyebrow. "And why is that?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan spread his hands. "This was all necessary expenses\u8212?many costs aren't immediately visible\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How about this?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he could finish, Glacia interrupted him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're all trainers here. I've heard of your strength, Johan-sensei. Let's have a battle. If you win, I'll approve your request."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Isn't this abuse of power?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Elite Four Glacia, you know what happened last night. My Pok\u233?mon's condition\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could finish, Glacia held up two fingers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Double."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This isn't about how many times I\u8212?I always file reimbursements honestly\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Triple."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Accepted!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whew\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan exhaled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That many berries, tripled?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was enough for Gengar alone to eat for two months.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he rationed it properly, the whole team could eat for a month.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially since some of those berries were rare varieties.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So\u8230? now he understood what she meant by "bad habits start from the top."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Glacia was Drake's "younger generation" in terms of seniority.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder she was just as bad!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Should've asked Darkrai to stick around longer\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Don't worry," Glacia said with a smile. "I know what you all went through last night. This is just a friendly match\u8212?just for fun."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, she added, "Besides, since I'm being so 'reasonable,' I have a small favor to ask in return."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan narrowed his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What kind of favor?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's about Team Magma and Team Aqua. There's a meeting, and I'd like you to attend."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A meeting related to Team Magma and Team Aqua?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was worth going to.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they could eliminate both teams early, maybe the Groudon vs. Kyogre disaster would never happen.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That would make Hoenn a much safer place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a brief pause, Johan nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fine."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was just a meeting, after all.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not some dangerous mission.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Drake, you're really going all out, huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A young man\u8212?wearing a *{\i
black short-sleeved shirt, dark red capri pants, and loafers\u8212?}*grinned as he leaned back lazily. His mohawk-styled hair added to his delinquent vibe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was Hoenn's Dark-type Elite Four member, Grimsley.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake sighed heavily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, straightened his expression and said,\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This was the only way."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, he wouldn't admit that he had been caught red-handed by Glacia while trying to "adjust" the reimbursement form.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Instead, he added, "Johan has the potential to be more than just a teacher. He needs the right motivation to push himself."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grimsley's expression was unreadable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He saw right through Drake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But hey\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake and Glacia's 'strategy' was working.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even though they didn't realize that Johan didn't actually need any bribery to take down Team Magma and Team Aqua.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Groudon and Kyogre really woke up\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hoenn might be destroyed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if that happened\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Where was Johan supposed to go to be a teacher?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake, however, had his own long-term plan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Johan kept attending League meetings, then one day\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if Johan refused to become an Elite Four member, Drake could force him to handle things as his "representative."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Drake grinned inwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good thing he recruited Johan early.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Steven's mansion\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Elite Four Glacia versus Johan?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven and Wallace exchanged glances.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't surprising for trainers to battle on a whim.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Johan had fought Elite Four members before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who do you think will win?" Wallace asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven thought for a moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It depends on how much they both hold back."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And if they both go all out?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wallace nodded thoughtfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked at Charcadet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Charcadet."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The little Pok\u233?mon looked up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smiled warmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's time to burn everything."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
