He didn't want to blow up the entire training facility.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, this was enough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan carefully observed Armarouge as the last traces of heat dissipated from its cannon. The golden plating gleamed, cooling down after unleashing such concentrated firepower. A thin wisp of white smoke curled from the barrel, marking the residual energy of Armor Cannon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That\u8230? had been ridiculously strong.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Stronger than any Overheat Charcadet had ever used before.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this was without any additional boosts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rubbed his chin, deep in thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Armarouge had this level of destructive power, then\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Would Ceruledge be able to match it in sheer offensive capability?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The answer wasn't so simple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Armarouge specialized in powerful, concentrated ranged attacks, while Ceruledge focused on high-speed, sustained melee combat with Bitter Blade and its lifesteal effect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both forms had their strengths.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, next test\u8212?Aura Sphere."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan pressed another button on the control panel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A medium-sized target emerged from the floor, reinforced for Special Attacks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Armarouge's body pulsed with Aura energy, and a deep blue glow gathered at the cannon's core.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan could feel it\u8212?his own Aura resonating slightly in response.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the side, Urshifu glanced over, sensing the disturbance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Aura Sphere shot forward, its impact cleanly shattering the target.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The force was a little weaker than Armor Cannon, but the speed and precision made it an excellent spammable attack.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright, that's enough for today."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the tests completed, Armarouge twisted its chest piece once more\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And returned to Ceruledge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had considered testing that brief fusion form\u8212?where Ceruledge briefly gained a golden arm cannon\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But not yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't stable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not to mention, Ceruledge had only just evolved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mastering both forms was already a huge task.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There was no need to rush things.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stretched and glanced at his team.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had all been training independently during the session.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But when he turned toward Gengar\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ghost was already clapping its hands together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a mischievous grin, it beckoned the others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Team battle?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not the first time they'd done this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When there weren't suitable opponents, the best solution was\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fight each other.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, this was just training\u8212?no one would go all out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No Mega Evolution, no Aura, no special transformations like Reverse Scale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just pure skill and tactics.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright," Johan agreed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's keep it friendly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom zipped forward excitedly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll handle the refereeing\u8212?Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled and stepped back, watching as his team prepared for battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Team Rankings (Unofficial):\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar \u8211? As Johan's first Pok\u233?mon, Gengar had the most experience and was the best at coordinating with him in battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales \u8211? Its defensive capabilities were almost untouchable. Even Gengar had a hard time breaking through its ice barriers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton \u8211? While slightly lacking in battle focus, its type advantage against Urshifu and Dragonite kept it in the top three.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite \u8211? Despite its power, Dragonite's ranking suffered because it couldn't use Reverse Scale in friendly matches.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Urshifu \u8211? Strong, but vulnerable to Fairy and Flying-types.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ceruledge \u8211? Newly evolved and still adjusting to its full potential.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar \u8211? \u8230?Busy eating.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For now, Larvitar was the team's designated "free win."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But someday, it would climb the ranks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan nodded as the battle began, already analyzing the matchups and strategies unfolding before him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The more they fought together, the stronger they'd become\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And soon enough, he'd be able to take on even the strongest of Elite Four members.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
