Jigglypuff had wandered off, and now Marshadow had taken up the role of "Guide of Shadows."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Beep beep\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's phone rang.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the caller ID, he raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Looker?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once he answered, Looker's tone was serious, his voice carrying a hint of urgency.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Johan, we've detected traces of Hunter J."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had almost forgotten about the mission to eliminate the Pok\u233?mon Hunters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Where?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Pok\u233?mon in the yard perked up, ears twitching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They hated Pok\u233?mon Hunters.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We don't have an exact location, but the signal originated near Twinleaf Town."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Twinleaf Town?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was Professor Rowan's hometown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The 'Land of New Beginnings' in Sinnoh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Would Hunter J really dare to stir up trouble in Twinleaf Town?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Professor Rowan wasn't like Professor Oak or Professor Kukui\u8212?he wasn't a battle-hardened scientist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rowan might not be strong himself\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But because of that, the Sinnoh League took extra precautions to protect him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan refused to believe there were no security measures in place.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"She likely escaped to the ocean. Our forces are tracking her now."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ocean, huh\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a desperate Pok\u233?mon Hunter, there were only two escape options\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
1. Flee to another region.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
2. Disappear into the endless sea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Hunter J had truly gone out to sea, she was either intimately familiar with the waters or was about to have a bad time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If she managed to stay hidden, it would be ten times harder to track her down later.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Looker, in that case\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was about to suggest Looker take personal action\u8212?only to hear a tired sigh over the phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I know. I'm already in Twinleaf Town."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan chuckled inwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looker was too reliable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he were Cynthia, he'd absolutely make Looker his right-hand man.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I trust you to handle it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then he added\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If things get rough, call Flint or Riley to back you up."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Flint?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing the name, Looker perked up, sneering.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That idiot? He'd drown."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who are you calling an idiot?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint's voice suddenly came through the phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Whoever speaks up first."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"YOU WANNA FIGHT?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I don't fight idiots. That'd be unfair."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed and hung up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These two\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Take me with you."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
