480: You're Not Following the Script...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looker?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a way, Looker was basically the Rocket Trio of the International Police\u8212?whenever he showed up, something big was happening.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
