It wasn't far.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still within Ayasha Town.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not a big deal." He put away his phone and began recalling his Pok\u233?mon one by one.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Need help?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
