"Draaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite spread its small wings, and despite its large, round body, it shot forward at an incredible speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Coward," Caitlin muttered, pouting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The setting sun cast an amber glow over the horizon, half of it already sinking into the sea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the rocky northern coast of Ayasha Town, Looker was wedged between the jagged stones, his pirate disguise now soaked with seawater.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By his side, Toxicroak remained alert, guarding their surroundings.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
