A Mightyena, specialized in tracking prey by scent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even with precautionary measures, they had still found him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looker gritted his teeth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Battling wasn't his strong suit, but at this point, he had no choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Toxicroak!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxicroak reacted faster than Looker\u8212?if they had relied on Looker's battle instincts, they'd be dead already.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looker liked to think he was protecting Toxicroak, but honestly?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was the other way around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxicroak's eyes hardened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Mightyena charged, Toxicroak threw a punch, dark-red energy coating its fist\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Brick Break!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The rocks exploded, and before Mightyena could adjust to the narrow battlefield, Toxicroak slammed its palm onto Mightyena's head, sending it flying with a yelp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing hiding wasn't an option anymore, Looker stepped forward, emerging from the rocks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates who had surrounded him\u8212?about seven or eight in total\u8212?grinned menacingly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Finally coming out?" One pirate, dressed similarly to Looker's disguise, smirked. "Traitor. Hand it over."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looker ripped off his disguise, returning to his usual detective attire.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they already found him, no point in pretending anymore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I was never with you guys to begin with. So there's no 'traitor' here."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He pulled out his badge, flashing it toward the group.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"International Police! You're all under arrest!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Silence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates exchanged glances.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"International Police?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait, what?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hold up, when did he say he was a cop?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the submarine offshore, a cold voice spoke through a communicator.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's alone. What are you waiting for? Capture him, take the cargo, and dump him in the sea."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Realizing their numbers advantage, the pirates' hesitation vanished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Right! He's just one guy!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mightyena, Crawdaunt, Pinsir, Golbat\u8212?get him!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The feral Pok\u233?mon lunged at Toxicroak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Toxicroak glanced back at Looker, then shoved him aside\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go! I'll hold them off!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had no intention of backing down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Toxicroak\u8212?" Looker hesitated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Toxicroak had already turned, facing the incoming enemies alone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates smirked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just one Toxicroak? Hah, this'll be easy\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Right before a flash of blue light streaked through the battlefield.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ceruledge, Bitter Blade!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shing\u8212?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A ghostly blue arc slashed through the air\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And every single enemy Pok\u233?mon was knocked back instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone froze\u8212?Looker, Toxicroak, and even the pirates.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"WHO?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A gust of wind stirred the sand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the skies, a Dragonite slowly descended.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sat atop it, his expression calm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You're surrounded."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates looked around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Surrounded? By ONE guy?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They laughed, reaching for more Pok\u233? Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I thought this was a real fight\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before the sentence could finish, a shadow loomed behind them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From within the fading light, Ceruledge emerged\u8212?its swords glowing eerily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wha\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shing!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flames erupted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every previously hit Pok\u233?mon\u8212?Mightyena, Crawdaunt, Pinsir, Golbat\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ignited in blue fire.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their screams echoed, one by one collapsing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates stared in horror.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"One move... Took out our whole team?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A single gulp was heard\u8212?one pirate visibly swallowed nervously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's just ONE guy!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yeah, and you guys are just cowards."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates roared, summoning twenty more Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ceruledge was already in the middle of them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, from the shadows, another voice cackled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dark spheres rained down, knocking out Pok\u233?mon one after another.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The pirates were stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Numbers mean nothing against a 'Mob-Clearing Machine.'"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
