The navigation Rotom cheerfully projected a holographic map, using the Silver Wing's glow to determine their course.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan turned to Gengar, who had been lurking in the shadows near the wheel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, quit lurking. Go play on the deck."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar reluctantly floated away, sneaking a last glance at the steering wheel.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It really wanted to spin it for fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan rolled his eyes, stepping out onto the deck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bright morning sunlight reflected off the endless blue ocean.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gentle waves lapped against the hull.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Above, a flock of Wingull soared across the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan inhaled deeply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Setting sail!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Time to become the Pirate King!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beside him, Cynthia tilted her head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Pirate King?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan coughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah\u8230? just something random I said."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia chuckled softly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then, she unfolded a piece of ancient parchment\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A weathered sea chart.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What's that?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A map," Cynthia explained, tracing a route with her finger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If this is correct\u8230? the location of the Sea Temple is in the same direction as where the Silver Wing is guiding us."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan narrowed his eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Coincidence?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Were the Ghost Pirates still after the Sea Temple?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More importantly\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why had they captured a Lugia hatchling in the first place?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Something wasn't right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He exhaled slowly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well then\u8230? let's find out."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
