{\qc
483: A Day in the Life of Slowking\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
March 23rd, Monday.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The orange sun leapt out of the water like a smiling face, dyeing the sky and sea in golden hues\u8212?it was a truly delightful scene.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flocks of Wingull and Pelipper circled over the sea; from experience, this was when fish would gather near the surface to feed, and also when the birds themselves fed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On several protruding reefs, Staryu slowly turned their bodies and crawled up. The radiant red gems on their centers became even more vibrant under the sunlight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that moment, a chubby black hand reached for a Staryu. Unable to dodge in time, it was caught.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Gurgle gurgle\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Staryu struggled, but it was useless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A startled cry rang out\u8212?it was Gengar holding the Staryu, extracting a beautiful red gem shard from its back. Then, without doing anything else, it placed the Staryu back onto the reef as it was.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar cheerfully floated toward a familiar figure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"A Star Piece, huh? Not many Staryu can produce those. You're lucky, Gengar," came Johan's voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was leisurely riding a bicycle across the sea\u8212?yes, across the sea. Beneath him, the surface had frozen into a winding icy path. His Rotom Bike had switched to Ice Mode.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Running alongside him, Ninetales moved gracefully. Wherever her snow-white form passed, she left a trail of shimmering pink frost that looked like stars falling\u8212?utterly enchanting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A crisp, joyful cry echoed as her nine tails merged behind her, swaying with each step\u8212?elegant and flawless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, who had long wanted to try biking on the sea, had finally realized his wish today. He adjusted the hat on his head and chuckled to himself:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If I had an eyepatch right now, this would be perfect."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was their second day at sea. Johan had taken Ninetales and Gengar out early\u8212?partly to try sea biking, and partly to fulfill yesterday's "promise."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Catch a big fish and make fish head soup!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But all they had caught were Magikarp\u8212?not exactly suitable for the pot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pleased with Johan's praise, Gengar tossed the "Star Piece" into its mouth with satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Both Staryu and Starmie had a chance to produce Star Pieces and Stardust. The probability was low, and Star Pieces even rarer\u8212?less than one in a hundred.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was said that these Pok\u233?mon could use their red gem to "communicate" with the stars above. Some legends even claimed that Staryu and Starmie were fragments of stars that fell from the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The move Cosmic Power, which they could learn, seemed to support this theory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fishermen living near the sea often made their livelihood gathering Star Pieces and Stardust, which were seen as byproducts of their cosmic connection\u8212?like pearls from shells.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If we get a chance, I'll take you guys tidepooling," Johan said with a smile as the wind swept his black hair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Tidepooling?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar's eyes lit up. Sounded like fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's really taking it easy, huh?" Caitlin leaned against the rail on the deck, wearing a wide-brimmed straw hat and eating ice cream as she commented.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia smiled, letting the golden sunlight catch in her long flowing hair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"There's no rush."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her eyes reflected the morning sun, dazzling like an entire world hidden within.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, if the "king" wasn't in a hurry, why should they be?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Behind them, Baby Lugia and Larvitar were playing hide-and-seek without a care in the world\u8212?no sign of urgency to "find family."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bwooo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garrr\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From the distance, two figures approached quickly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was Dragonite and Garchomp.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One flew high, surrounded by a milky white stream of air. Despite its bulk, it flew fast and smoothly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other skimmed just above the sea, trailing long jet-like contrails behind it. Waves parted below as it sped along the surface.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The splashing water crystallized into ice midair, neatly sectioning off the frozen path Johan was on.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This guy..." Johan grumbled, locking eyes with Garchomp's teasing gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Thud\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A four-to-five-pound fish thudded onto the deck, tossed there by Garchomp. It folded its fins and stood beside Cynthia, exhaling a slow puff of mist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Garchomp muttered internally: That Dragonite can {\i
really} fly...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had circled half the sea; she was still full of energy, while Garchomp was feeling a bit winded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Bwooo~ Bwooo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite hovered beside Johan, flapping excitedly. The spray lifted by its wings froze again under Ninetales' influence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ahead, Dragonite and Garchomp had spotted a fairly large island, with signs of human activity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hmm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Human activity?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
