\u9834? \u8230?Our dream of becoming a Pok\u233?mon Master must\u8212?will\u8212?absolutely come true! \u9834?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom seemed moved by the lyrics. It quietly turned to look at Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Become a Pok\u233?mon Master?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This song was saved in Johan's phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he truly wanted it, then even Rotom would give everything to help him reach that dream.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And it wouldn't be alone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom's gaze swept the beach\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, Ninetales, Tinkaton, Dragonite, Urshifu, Ceruledge, even Larvitar\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone would strive toward the same goal\u8212?together!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's a beautiful song," Cynthia said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mm-hmm!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Caitlin, usually Johan's contrarian, nodded in agreement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That song\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For some reason, the first things Johan thought of were the Butterfree he released, the Pidgeot still waiting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ceruledge, make it hotter\u8212?we're having seafood hotpot tonight!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Maybe it was the song, or maybe just the moment, but Johan's spirits were high.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Pok\u233?mon Master, huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Honestly, as long as they could all be happy together, that was enough for him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If everyone shared that same dream, then why not give it their all?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The result didn't matter. What would stay with them forever was the journey.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Memories are radiant pearls; bonds, eternal diamonds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Goka!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ceruledge nodded solemnly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every meal\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every control of flame and heat\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was a way to train its mastery of its own power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The coordinate's speed just increased, Roto~" Rotom suddenly said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But not by much.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Good." Johan wasn't worried.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We'll head out after dinner."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A little later\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Campfire flames glowed on the beach.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Laughter echoed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The smell of food filled the air.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengar, go call Slowking."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But before Johan could finish\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yadong."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Slowking, hands clasped behind his back, waddled over\u8212?already drawn by the smell.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was really good at following the scent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dinner's ready!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised his coconut.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cheers~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Far beneath the ocean\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive submarine cruised through the deep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was so large, even a Wailord seemed small beside it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside the sub, humans and Pok\u233?mon bustled about.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Captain, we've locked on! It's in the current!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the main control seat, a bearded man laughed heartily.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What are you waiting for? Catch it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Catch it!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Chatot on his shoulder flapped its wings, mimicking his words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
BOOM\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The movement of the colossal machine devastated the ocean floor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And faced with something so massive, the wild Pok\u233?mon in the sea had no choice but to flee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had no hope of resisting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
