486: Lugia, Successfully Captured!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Temple of the Sea\u8212?Samiya!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A sanctuary slumbering in the ocean's depths, known only in theory to those who've found Manaphy, as only Manaphy's return path could lead one to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was built in ancient times by the People of the Water to worship the Sea Guardian.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Temple of the Sea, Sea Crown," Cynthia murmured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sea Crown?" Caitlin shot her a puzzled look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Legend says that whoever obtains the Sea Crown will possess the power to command the sea and become its sovereign..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The power to command the sea?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin's confusion deepened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Isn't that Kyogre's dominion?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"So... their goal is the Sea Crown?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If one could obtain the Sea Crown and be acknowledged by the ocean, then as a hunter in these waters, they'd no longer need submarines or similar tools and could hunt freely among the sea Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That... might make Ghost truly untouchable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If the League tried to capture him, he could simply retreat into dangerous waters. And many Pok\u233?mon hidden in the depths would no longer be safe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar's eyes lit up when it heard about the Sea Crown and its power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That crown... sounds even cooler than Slowking's. Maybe he could "borrow" it for a while?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Relax." Johan took off his monocle, wiped its lens with a cloth, and smiled. "He can't wear it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia and Caitlin looked puzzled, but Johan didn't explain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Should he tell them the Sea Crown is so massive that "wearing" it isn't even an option?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, even if one earns the ocean's recognition, it doesn't last forever.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the movie, Ash got the Sea Crown and turned into a golden superhuman who could fly and dive unaided. But in the anime? Everything was reset.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, it might just be Ash being Ash\u8212?Movie Ash is epic, TV Ash is... not.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, one thing's certain: Ghost doesn't know how to use the real Sea Crown.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless Hunter J told him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But even if they're working together, it's unlikely she would've shared that knowledge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What worries me more is Lugia's condition," Johan said grimly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What would keep Lugia from searching for its child? What's forcing it to stay here?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're almost there," Cynthia said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under the moonlight, the outline of a massive submarine was reflected off the barrier surrounding the Temple of the Sea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alongside it, a medium-sized sub was parked just outside the temple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
