Everyone was losing it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Retrieve the rest\u8212?before more escape!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even as they scrambled\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More Porygon escaped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Team Rocket's lab was in total disarray\u8212?enough to alarm Giovanni himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
