510: Johan\u8217?s Little Fanboy\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thick forest leaves, dense shrubs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A young man with a monocle was moving slowly through the woods. The surrounding wild Pok\u233?mon all kept their distance \u8212? because the Pok\u233?mon accompanying him were clearly extraordinary.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This scene was displayed on a monitor inside the P2 Laboratory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Doesn't this guy look familiar?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One Team Plasma grunt manning the surveillance monitors asked suddenly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Familiar?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No one had time to worry about that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The surveillance room's lead operative turned slightly toward his shoulder radio:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Target is moving from Zone A2 toward Zone A3. You may engage."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Understood," came the reply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the next second\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone watching the monitors suddenly jolted in shock. One even fell from his chair.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because on the screen\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A massive Gengar face suddenly filled the display, its eerie grin and crimson tongue giving everyone a chill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It waved cheekily at the camera like it was saying hello.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like watching a family-friendly drama and suddenly having Sadako crawl out of the TV.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Fzzzt\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The screen turned to static.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sweating through his shirt, the lead grunt quickly snapped back to reality and shouted into his radio:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Engage! Engage! The target has detected surveillance!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar floated over to Johan, proudly revealing the miniature camera it had yanked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"...A surveillance device?" Johan looked at it with some surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had already suspected the island was privately occupied, but seeing surveillance equipment confirmed it \u8212? they'd been watched this whole time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan pulled up the map on Rotom. Given their location and the previous data from Porygon-Z...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He could now confirm it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were in Team Plasma's P2 Laboratory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And the one who sent the distress signal to Porygon-Z?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most likely: {\b
Genesect}, the Prehistoric Destruction Bug Pok\u233?mon from 300 million years ago.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tch."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan clicked his tongue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Genesect and Mewtwo\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What a cursed pairing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the movie {\i
Genesect and the Legend Awakened}, Mewtwo tried to help Genesect and got blasted with high-tech lasers for its trouble.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Genesect, a Pok\u233?mon from the same era as Kabutops and Omastar, had undergone extensive modification by Colress. Now it was a hybrid of ancient life and modern tech.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan considered his next move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This place was an important Team Plasma base. Charging in alone was reckless \u8212? especially with no confirmation of whether Colress himself was inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Truthfully, Johan feared Colress more than Ghetsis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There were two eras of Team Plasma: one where Ghetsis propped up N as a puppet leader, and another where Colress took full control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Colress... was a true menace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His invention, the "Colress Machine," could control even legendary Pok\u233?mon \u8212? comparable to Cyrus's Red Chain.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without the DNA Splicers, it wasn't complete. But even as-is, it could control Kyurem.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Colress had Kyurem\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The forest rustled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leaves trembled, then the ground itself began to shake.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar slipped into the shadows and returned moments later with news:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bugs. Centipedes. Big tire-shaped centipedes!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They don't want us leaving now\u8230?" Johan's expression turned serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From all directions, massive rolling Pok\u233?mon appeared \u8212? red-armored, glaring, bloodshot.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Scolipede, Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom-Dex hid behind Johan. "Megapede Pok\u233?mon, Bug and Poison-type. Its venom can kill prey in one blow. Very dangerous, Roto!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They weren't normal Scolipede.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"These are Colress-enhanced and controlled Pok\u233?mon, aren't they?" Johan said grimly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress's research aimed to draw out a Pok\u233?mon's power to the absolute limit \u8212? even at the cost of its life.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That's why the League labeled him a dangerous scientist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But some saw him as more pure than evil \u8212? just dangerously obsessed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this horde? Likely victims of Colress's power-amplifying experiments.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Extremely dangerous.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without hesitation, Johan threw two Pok\u233? Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Dragonite} and {\b
Ceruledge} emerged, faces serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Whssshh}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Snow began to fall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Ninetales} stepped forward, tails fanned wide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The northern wind howled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Quick finish!" Johan ordered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was enemy territory \u8212? who knew how many more threats were nearby.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Scolipede rushed forward, eyes rabid, jaws gnashing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
KRAH!!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The largest Scolipede, a leader-type one-third larger than normal, leapt forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
BAM!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It slammed straight into a prismatic forcefield \u8212? a barrier that came from nowhere.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the signal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite beat its wings, intensifying the snowstorm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, Blizzard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, Fridge Mode \u8212? Blizzard!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Blizzard + Blizzard + Hurricane =\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A terrifying ice storm engulfed the area.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Scolipede saw only white \u8212? their world washed out to monochrome.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And within the wind...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A flicker of ghostly blue flame.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
One down.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Ceruledge}, cloaked in shadows and storm, flickered through the battlefield like an assassin \u8212? every sword slash dropping another Scolipede.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The storm softened them. Ceruledge finished them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the Scolipede charged on, unfazed by fear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Problem was, they couldn't {\i
see} anything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their attacks flailed into nothing \u8212? or were stopped by barriers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite Colress's enhancements, these Scolipede were outclassed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar didn't even need to move. It just stood near Johan, watching.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Crack-crack...}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finally, the first Scolipede froze solid \u8212? encased in glimmering ice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was the signal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Time to go.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan leapt onto Dragonite's back. The others returned to their balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They flew.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa\u8212?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite roared as it soared, escaping before any reinforcements could track them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Back on the ground\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"L-Lord Colress, the target... fled,"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
a nervous Plasma grunt reported from the now-snow-covered forest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had deployed Pok\u233?mon immediately \u8212? only to be steamrolled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The once lush forest was now frozen tundra.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If someone said Johan was a Four Heavenly Kings-level Trainer, no one would question it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress, however, remained calm. He stood before a frozen Scolipede, curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Touching the ice \u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Such strong cold..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even among Ice-types he'd studied, this was a new level.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If this could be enhanced further...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could it freeze an entire city?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That wasn't ordinary power \u8212? that was legendary.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress's interest in Johan \u8212? and his Ice-type Pok\u233?mon \u8212? deepened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Who was that man?" he asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It was... Professor Johan," the lead grunt replied cautiously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Professor Johan?" Colress's eyes sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The grunt began to explain, but Colress cut him off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I know who he is."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He began pacing \u8212? visibly excited.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The P2 grunts had never seen Colress like this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was Colress... a Johan fanboy?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
...Pretty much, yeah.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress wasn't content with studying average Pok\u233?mon anymore. He wanted to explore legendary Pok\u233?mon \u8212? and no one met more legendaries than Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Johan helped, Colress's research could leap forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially in one area: {\b
Mega Evolution}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Colress's whole research thesis was about maximizing Pok\u233?mon power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What did that better than Mega Evolution?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Mega Evolution required stones, Trainer bonds, and compatibility...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What if {\b
all} Pok\u233?mon could Mega Evolve?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Power of the heart..." Colress murmured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The one thing he couldn't replicate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan was known as the "Bond Master."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he could study Johan...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Lord Colress, are you... Johan's fan?" one grunt asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fan," Colress confirmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grunts: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's a high-ranking International Police officer, possibly future Elite Four in Hoenn or Sinnoh..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why not Unova?" Colress asked flatly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If he has that power..." Colress pointed to the frozen Scolipede. "Why not make him Unova's Champion?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Grunts: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They had no reply.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Their scientist-in-chief had gone full stan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Find someone who can contact him," Colress ordered cheerfully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uh... y-yes, sir!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"By the way." Colress remembered something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Didn't Rood mention a powerful unknown Ice-type Pok\u233?mon? Said if we helped, he could get me the DNA Splicers?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes! Lord Rood said capturing that Pok\u233?mon could help obtain the Splicers."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Agree to it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes, sir!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Finally \u8212? something good for Team Plasma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On a distant shore, Johan stood by the water, face pale, phone in hand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is Johan, Inspector."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Inspector Johan, this is the liaison."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He calmly reported the secret island, the illegal activity, and the encounter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The operator immediately understood the seriousness and said they'd escalate at once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The International Police had long suspected Team Plasma but lacked evidence.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now they had enough to move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If this checks out, we can officially list Team Plasma as a criminal organization."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Viridian City, Kanto \u8212? Rocket HQ.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Inside a sealed tank, beneath a dark visor...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A red glow flickered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It saw the future.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan would need its help.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
