{\qc
511: Zekrom? Rotom, Hit It with a Blast!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unova Region, Lacunosa Town.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After leaving the island where the P2 Laboratory was located, Johan didn't make any stops and headed straight for Lacunosa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, the International Police Department of the Unova Region sprang into action in response to the intel Johan had sent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that they'd finally caught Team Plasma slipping, they couldn't afford to waste time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
International Police agents were already on their way to Lacunosa.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Johan...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He paid a visit to Professor Juniper.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her lab was located in Lacunosa Town \u8212? one of the "starter towns" in the games, like Pallet Town or Nuvema Town.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Standing in front of the lab's open clearing, Johan gently rubbed his chin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is where Ash lost to Trip and his starter Snivy, huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was from that loss that the label "strong against strong, weak against weak" was attached to him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Poor Pikachu, forced to hold back and play dumb."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A Pok\u233?mon that had gone toe-to-toe with Legendaries\u8230? losing to a freshly-picked Snivy?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
