This legend stemmed from an ancient meteorite that had once crashed into the mountains far outside Humilau. The impact created a massive crater, whose searing heat burned deep into the ground, forming a sprawling, twisted underground labyrinth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Years ago, a company tried to develop the area, hoping to profit from the mysterious crater. But they went bankrupt in the end. The cold in the cavern was simply too extreme for ordinary people to withstand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And so, over time, the area came to be known as the {\b
Giant Chasm}, and the rest of the region stopped paying attention to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only the townsfolk of Humilau, whether believers of the legend or not, still strictly followed the rule: {\b
stay indoors at night.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Where are we going?" Keldeo followed behind Johan, step by step.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its wounds had visibly healed more, thanks to treatment from the Pok\u233?mon Center, Johan's potions, and energy cubes. It was recovering its strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
