517: Genesect Amidst the Ice and Snow!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing Keldeo, who had regained some of its confidence and taken the lead at the front of the group, Johan couldn't help but smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His Pok\u233?mon were starting to subtly influence others now\u8212?and Keldeo's transformation was the best proof of that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the Cryogonal appeared, Ninetales had fully acclimated to the mist, and could now sense and avoid the Ice-type Pok\u233?mon active within it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Keldeo leading the way, Johan and the team finally approached the "Giant Chasm," deeper into the intensifying cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Faint silhouettes of mechanical structures emerged in the mist\u8212?most of them corroded, but unnaturally sturdy due to being frozen solid.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We're here," Keldeo said, its voice trembling slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though its mental state had greatly improved thanks to Larvitar, Ceruledge, and Johan, change was never instant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, the fact that Keldeo could stand here, instead of running away like in the movie version, was a major step forward.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now that they were this close, Johan had to tread carefully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Kyurem wasn't captured and lashed out in fury, the only option might be to escape on Dragonite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Dragonite's speed\u8212?and its "Outrage Mode" it learned from Rayquaza\u8212?they might make it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though honestly, Johan would rather face Kyurem than ride Dragonite in that mode.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Kyurem was still here but weakened, they had less to fear.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if Kyurem was gone\u8212?captured by Team Plasma\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Either way, let's rescue the three 'Swords of Justice' first."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion would be valuable allies in battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And if Team Plasma was lurking ahead\u8212?without Kyurem, this battlefield belonged to Ninetales!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Snowfall," Johan commanded softly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
