Johan: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yeah. The only thing that could make Larvitar lose control like this... was rare ore.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton's eyes also sparkled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This crater wall was rich in rare metals\u8212?her favorite.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales absorbing Kyurem's frost made sense\u8212?it helped stop the spread.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if Larvitar and Tinkaton kept gouging the place...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What if Kyurem comes back and finds its lair 'eaten'...?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kyurem: "I left for ONE nap, and now my home's been stolen?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ah, whatever. Ninetales still needs time to finish absorbing the energy. Larvitar and Tinkaton can't wreck the whole place... probably."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once Ninetales was done, it could refreeze the wall. Problem solved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Time passed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar, Tinkaton, and Ceruledge went to work on the crater wall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales' absorption accelerated\u8212?the massive chunk of ice gradually vanished, and the temperature in the cave rose ever so slightly. More importantly, the spread of cold stopped altogether.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In Lacunosa Town, residents only noticed a slight chill, thinking it was a late spring cold snap\u8212?nothing serious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile, the wild Pok\u233?mon that had fled the cold now returned to their habitats.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked around the chewed-up cave wall and winced.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He may have underestimated Larvitar's appetite... and Tinkaton's destructive power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thankfully, Ninetales had finished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The frost in the cave had mostly dissipated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales returned to Johan. At a glance, there wasn't much change\u8212?but on closer inspection, its already snowy fur now sparkled like pure crystal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But what really caught Johan's eye...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was the item Ninetales carried in its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two palm-sized scales\u8212?mostly white with grayish-black edges. They had a rocky texture.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Scales?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan took them\u8212?and a surge of freezing cold immediately made his fingertips go numb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He quickly used aura to block the chill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Are these... Kyurem's scales?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And not just any scales\u8212?{\b
reverse scales}, perhaps?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That explained why the frost remained even after Kyurem's departure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Two scales...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan thought for a moment and handed one to Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You keep one."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It might be weird for an Ice/Fairy-type to hold a Dragon's scale, but the Ice energy within was too valuable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales accepted it without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"As for the other..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And spotted Dragonite backing away, smiling awkwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan grinned. "It's yours, Dragonite."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, it wanted the Dragon scale\u8212?but Kyurem was Ice/Dragon. And Dragonite, being Dragon/Flying, was 4\u215? weak to Ice...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I believe in you," Johan said, placing the scale in its hands.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Draaa..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fine. If he said so...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fatty."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it didn't toughen up against Ice, it'd end up like Lance\u8212?forever at the mercy of Ice-type specialists like Lorelei.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar had given the advice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, it was 4\u215? weak to Grass, yet it chewed the World Tree's branches daily for fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonite could do the same.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Warm up every day with a Kyurem scale. Problem solved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You don't want to lose to other Ice-Dragons, right?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because let's be honest\u8212?Ice/Dragon is a broken combo for Dragons to face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was only slightly more fair than that "Dragon Traitor" Altaria.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Kyurem wasn't the only Ice/Dragon around\u8212?there was also Baxcalibur in Paldea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"DRAAA!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At that, Dragonite firmly accepted the scale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even as it tucked it away with a pained grimace, the fire in its eyes was unmistakable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, help restore the cave."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking around at the wreckage, Johan's eye twitched again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Larvitar, Tinkaton\u8212?that's enough!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"{\i
BUURP~}"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar rubbed its full belly, glanced longingly at the crater wall, then nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cha!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tinkaton wiped her brow, patting her hammer with satisfaction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She was pretty sure her next Ice Hammer would hit way harder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Once they stepped back, Ninetales breathed out a wave of frost\u8212?sealing the walls in thick, pristine ice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Huh?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eyes narrowed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That speed... that power...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Glaciate?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd never seen Kyurem use it before, but... could this be?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though the Pok\u233?dex didn't list any new moves, it definitely looked stronger.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Crack, crack, crack\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The ice spread, restoring the cavern to a state of pristine cold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The frozen world returned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales had clearly gained a lot from this trip.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Within moments, the cave was whole again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales called out lightly, as if casting just a casual Icy Wind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cold in this place made Ice moves effortless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Maybe one day... we'll ask Kyurem ourselves."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Assuming it returns\u8212?and is open to a conversation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's head back."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cold had been stopped. Larvitar had feasted. Tinkaton had collected metal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mission accomplished.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now Johan needed to report Kyurem's disappearance\u8212?and the possibility of Team Plasma's next move\u8212?to Alder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Also\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Genesect issue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They were free now\u8212?unshackled from Colress's control\u8212?and would likely begin searching for a home.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But their home from 300 million years ago was long gone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If they started building one of their own...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It could mean devastation on a massive scale.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Why do I feel like I'm becoming their babysitter?" Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As he exited the maze-like tunnels\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He saw Keldeo, now transformed by its resolve, waiting outside the cave with the three Swords of Justice\u8212?slightly recovered, standing tall.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They expressed their deep gratitude.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And said\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Johan ever needed them, they'd come.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Also\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They offered to teach his Pok\u233?mon the way of the sword.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
