Not to mention\u8212?Team Plasma actually launched their airship and fired the "Kyurem Ice Cannon"\u8212?that was completely beyond Shaga's ability to handle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Wanlong and Lenwu's arrival had made a significant difference too. Between the two, they'd taken down dozens of Team Plasma members.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now, with Colress having fled and the airship fallen, most of the Team Plasma operatives had either escaped or been captured.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
