In fact\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew more than most.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kyurem, dubbed "the strongest dragon on the surface," didn't rely solely on its Ice-type power.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No wonder\u8230?" Shaga muttered. "No wonder the Ice Cannon was so terrifying. If not for your Pok\u233?mon, Teacher Johan, I'm afraid the entire city would've been frozen solid."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No wonder Team Plasma had acted so boldly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Shaga had been told by Alder that Kyurem may have been captured, he'd been skeptical. Not because he doubted Alder\u8212?but because he knew how terrifying Kyurem was. It shouldn't be that easy to catch.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
