"Excellent!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shaga accepted Johan's "borrow" phrasing with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Didn't matter. As long as Johan had it, that was enough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he ever gave it back\u8230? well, if Shaga was still alive by then, they'd talk.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
