"We're coming too," Cynthia and Caitlin said at once.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kyurem's power was immense. Even if Mewtwo had carried it off, it hadn't gone far.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even now, snow still fell over Opelucid.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Shaga nodded heavily. "Please\u8230? take care of it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had his hands full.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Plasma remnants remained. While the chaos had mostly subsided, order hadn't fully returned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As mayor, he had to restore peace.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, he doubted he'd be of much use anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most of his Pok\u233?mon were spent after fighting Vio and the Dark Triad.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No need to drag the team down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's go!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and Cynthia locked eyes, then turned to Caitlin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She pouted, then placed a hand on both their shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Buzz\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Teleport!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Mewtwo's psychic presence as a beacon, it was uncomfortable\u8212?but fast.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wanlong and Lenwu arrived a beat too late.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
