Shaga explained everything quickly, and they decided to help stabilize Opelucid and finish rounding up Plasma while waiting for the others to return.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meanwhile\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a forest outside the city.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Calm down!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo was encased in a spherical psychic shield, gritting its teeth as it blocked Kyurem's relentless icy blasts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
