"Oh, right." Alder suddenly snapped awake and sat up. "Johan, I heard the International Police are setting up a special task force for Team Plasma. The leader's spot is open. Interested?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A task force under the International Police?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These were usually temporary units, but with enormous power\u8212?like the UB task force in Alola, headed by Battle Tower boss Anabel, who had access to nearly the entire Alola League's resources.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So this new unit? Definitely no lightweight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Let Alder deal with Team Plasma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Not interested," Johan replied instantly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"All right."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder didn't press.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, it wasn't like he was offering him the position of Unova's Champion or Elite Four.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"One more thing."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hm?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Drayden from Icirrus City says there's been strange activity at Dragonspiral Tower."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dragonspiral Tower?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan blinked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That was where Zekrom was said to be sealed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Strange activity?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But hadn't Zekrom already appeared\u8212?back when Johan arrived in Lacunosa Town?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unless\u8230? Reshiram is the one sealed in that tower?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Either way\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not his business.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He just wanted a peaceful tournament experience in Unova, and the opening was just days away!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh! Wanlong, I just thought of a new idea!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He bolted to his feet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Really?" Wanlong's eyes sparkled behind her glasses.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Johan dashed off, Alder looked bewildered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
???\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Where'd that enthusiasm go?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder scratched his head, still mid-thought. "All I was going to say is\u8230? Dragonspiral Tower has a long history. It's full of Ghost-types. Might be useful for your Gengar."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, hiding nearby, perked up at the mention of a reward and emerged from the shadows.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gengaaa~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing Gengar, Alder chuckled warmly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar waved back with a grin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a brief stare-off\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, right." Alder pulled out a fist-sized, jagged black stone and handed it to Gengar. "Same deal for you and Johan. Help him keep it safe."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar accepted the stone, puzzled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What was this?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He even considered licking it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I don't know either. But apparently Team Plasma wasn't just after meteorites at the Nacrene Museum. This was something else they wanted."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder stretched and added, "Maybe Johan can figure it out. I'll leave it with you two."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
