538: Flint: "Johan, Help Me!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mistralton City.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A coastal metropolis located in the central part of the Unova region, Mistralton is the largest city and seaport in Unova, brimming with towering skyscrapers. It's the region's commercial and economic hub.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and the others had taken a ferry from Undella Town to reach Mistralton, docking directly at its massive port.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kaah~~"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar stood proudly, chin up, gawking at the skyscrapers scraping the clouds, clicking its tongue in awe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As an international city, Mistralton's port was likely the largest in the Pok\u233?mon world. With the Junior Masters World Championship around the corner, the harbor was packed with vessels large and small.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Despite having been in Unova for some time, this was Johan's first visit to Mistralton.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Its layout resembled Lumiose City in Kalos\u8212?a circular design with concentric ring roads, and a vast central park home to many wild Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The streets were decked out with lights and decorations, selling goods from all over the world. The local stalls were particularly popular.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oricorio feather fans! All four colors available\u8212?mix-and-match options too!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Got trash? Don't litter\u8212?give it to my Trubbish! It'll break it down. Just don't get too close\u8212?the gas is toxic. Me? Don't worry, I took antidotes!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Fortune-telling! Gothorita will read your fate, love life, career\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mistralton was already bustling, and the championship made it even more lively.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The economic boost from all the tourists and fans flooding in from around the world would surely multiply the city's revenue severalfold.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I heard Mistralton Ice Cream is famous."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could finish, Cynthia, Gengar, and Larvitar's eyes lit up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Welp. Shouldn't have said that.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But sure enough, when they reached the shop, a huge line had already formed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looks like it'd be at least half an hour.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thankfully, they weren't in a rush, so they queued up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
