"You did {\i
nothing}?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan raised an eyebrow.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
Really?} The entire ancient city was swarming with agitated Ghost-type Pok\u233?mon. You expect us to believe you did nothing?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, if I {\i
had} to say\u8230?" Flint slapped his forehead, suddenly recalling something. He rummaged around in his pocket and pulled out a crude, ancient-looking stone orb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This, maybe? At first, Infernape and I thought it was food."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From afar, the orb did vaguely resemble a Sitrus Berry.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Considering Flint never carried many supplies, it wasn't surprising he'd start foraging. But\u8230?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Looking for Berries in a forgotten ancient ruin? That's\u8230? profoundly brainless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Oh wait, Johan reminded himself\u8212?Flint had basically zero brainpower. That checked out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This object\u8230?" Cynthia's expression turned serious the moment she laid eyes on the orb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Woooosh\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As she spoke, a cold, eerie mist surged from the stone orb and snaked its way into Flint's body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, his eyes went vacant, only to ignite moments later with a maniacal gleam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Arms akimbo, chin lifted in defiance, he let out a dark cackle:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-ka-ka!! After thousands of years, this king is reborn!!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Melo?"} Meloetta squeaked, hiding behind Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar and Gengar exchanged {\i
what-the-heck} looks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's eye twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Possession?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a world filled with Ghost-type Pok\u233?mon, a person being possessed wasn't the strangest thing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even in the original series, Ash and Brandon once triggered an ancient trap that led to a spirit of an old king possessing Ash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This? It looked eerily familiar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"He's been possessed by a long-dead king from this ancient city," Cynthia said gravely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yup. Classic Ash move.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kaah?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar scratched its head and approached. Its gaze swept Flint from head to toe.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"What are you doing?!"} 'Flint' snapped at Gengar, indignant at being approached so casually.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-kaah\u8230?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar murmured thoughtfully, rubbing its chin.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
So humans really can turn into Ghosts\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It turned toward Johan with a curious gleam.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's stomach dropped.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Great. Now Gengar had confirmation for its {\i
