not} want to become some ageless undead wandering the world!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Hmph!!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Flint' scoffed, spreading his arms wide, laughing maniacally.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Ka-ka-ka! No one can stop me now! The world shall be mine!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching this overly dramatic performance, Johan muttered, "Feels like Flint is just\u8230? being his true self."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia nodded. "Sounds like something he'd say anyway."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Infernape looked confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had Flint's voice, face, and tone\u8212?but something still felt\u8230? off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then 'Flint' finally noticed the trio, raising his chin with arrogance:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
"Kneel before your king!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But they were ignoring him, staring instead at Infernape.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
