{\b
"Ku?"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a moment of hesitation, Infernape ran to Johan's side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes. That wasn't Flint.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint might be eccentric, but he wasn't this over-the-top.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Most importantly, Infernape couldn't sense his usual warmth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Which meant\u8212?Flint really had been possessed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
