{\b
"How dare you ignore your king!"} 'Flint' snarled. "Guards!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Boom\u8230? boom\u8230?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Heavy footsteps echoed. From the depths of the ruins, massive Golurks marched out and landed beside 'Flint' with thunderous impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
