"Golurk, the Automaton Pok\u233?mon. Ground/Ghost-type. Created by ancient humans, they follow their master's orders with absolute loyalty, Rotom~!"}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yes, even in ancient times, humans tried creating Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While not on Mewtwo's level, Golurk was still an impressive creation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Flint' grinned smugly. "See the might of your king?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan, however, just looked relieved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd thought the king might summon the ancient Volcarona. This? Just some Golurks and Ghost-types?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As a dead king, couldn't you just stay dead and {\i
not} be a bother?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia and Caitlin reached for their Pok\u233? Balls\u8212?but Johan beat them to it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Whirrr\u8212?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Six flashes of red: Ninetales, Tinkaton, Dragonite, Urshifu, Ceruledge, and Gengar (who was already out), plus Larvitar, all appeared beside him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia summoned Garchomp; Caitlin called out Gothitelle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They blinked at Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
