The next day.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Cynthia vs. Aaron} opened the day.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was a spirited battle\u8212?but Aaron lost.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Flint and Lucian weren't sympathetic. They laughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Aaron wasn't even that upset.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Losing to Cynthia? Old news.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, he'd grown. Cynthia praised him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then came {\b
Steven vs. Poppy}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The result? As expected.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But during the match, the two {\i
talked}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like, actually chatted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Poppy asked about Johan's teaching style. What he taught. If he gave homework.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven? He answered {\i
everything}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A championship match turned into a meet-and-greet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
By the end, Poppy was calling him "senpai" every other sentence. Steven was embarrassed to have KO'd his junior.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan facepalmed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
He's just a psychology teacher, not their homeroom teacher!}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, from that point on, Johan gained a new nickname\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Professor Johan, whose students span the globe.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven. Poppy. Not to mention Roxanne, Flannery, Penny...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The man was a top-tier educator.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan sighed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
