Flint's grin froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh, great."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ground-types? I'm not scared."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd faced Cynthia {\i
hundreds} of times!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
