Sonia, oblivious to Johan's thoughts, explained:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's about Raihan's Torkoal and Duraludon. After yesterday's match, they're... uh..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked at Raihan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan didn't hesitate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He released Torkoal and Duraludon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Cha?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar and Tinkaton paused their eating and hammering to glance over.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mooh..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Torkoal whimpered, shrinking into its shell under Larvitar's gaze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Duraludon, meanwhile, twitched slightly at the sight of Tinkaton's hammer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's face twisted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Good grief.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Did we cause psychological trauma?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't that serious, right?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon closer inspection, it wasn't true trauma.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
More like residual fear from facing them again so soon after the battle.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If left alone, they'd recover in ten days or so.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Since the "clients" came willingly, Johan wasn't about to refuse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ninetales, Meloetta."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales gracefully landed beside Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Melo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meloetta fluttered down onto Johan's shoulder, confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a brief explanation, she understood.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sing, Hypnosis.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Her specialties!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon, ancient, soothing melodies filled the courtyard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With Ninetales' Hypnosis and Johan's Aura boosting it, Torkoal and Duraludon quickly fell asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Simple mental barriers\u8212?easily fixed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan couldn't help but mutter:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This could be... a new business chain."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Beat opponents into psychological issues\u8212?then heal them as a famous Pok\u233?mon psychologist.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not a bad cycle...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thanks to Raihan's livestream, the audience picked up on this too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Is this Johan's new business model?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Create problems\u8212?then fix them! Genius!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No wonder Johan fights so 'dirty'\u8212?it's profitable!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Raihan had another reason for visiting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the "Weather Child," he had been totally outplayed by Johan in weather control.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wanted to ask for advice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Torkoal's Drought lost to Larvitar's Sandstorm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flygon's Sandstorm lost to Ninetales' Snow Warning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He was utterly schooled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's advice was simple:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Better one than many."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan tried using too many weather types:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rain Dance with Goodra, Sunny Day with Torkoal, Sandstorm with Flygon and Duraludon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But none were specialized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Too scattered\u8212?weakening their impact.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Better one than many?" Raihan puzzled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But wait\u8212?didn't Johan use both Sandstorm and Snow?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shrugged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mine was... an accident."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
An accident?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Well\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar's Sandstorm was supercharged by Earth Plate shards and sacred earth materials.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales' Snow Warning was strengthened by Articuno's feather, the blessing of the North Wind, and Kyurem's energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hard to replicate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Raihan fell deep into thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Against weaker foes, his scattered weather worked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Against equals or stronger\u8212?like Johan and Leon\u8212?problems arose.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
