Eevee?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon still fixated on that...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sonia also looked curious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
She had heard Leon hype up Johan's "legendary" Eevee endlessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Yet after half a semester at Rustboro Academy, she'd never seen it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
(Though Peonia had a herd of Eevee.)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uh, you probably won't see it this time," Johan coughed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Really...?" Leon sounded disappointed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then he froze.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
Did that mean Johan hadn't even been using full strength?}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just then\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The quarterfinal matchups are out!" Sonia exclaimed, checking her phone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone crowded around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The first match\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sonia looked shocked, glancing between Johan and Leon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Tomorrow's first match... Johan vs. Leon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone stiffened.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Especially Johan and Leon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: So my opponent is the "Undefeated Champion," the walking billboard Leon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Leon: Facing a teacher who hasn't even gone all out yet...?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hope I can make you take it seriously," Leon muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nothing," Leon shook his head, then declared:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'm going to prepare now!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Facing Johan\u8212?he had to be ready!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He turned... and immediately went the wrong way.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uh... Leon, the exit isn't that way," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Oh."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sonia sighed. "Still wrong."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Uh..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I'll lead you," Sonia said helplessly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan followed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan browsed the full matchup list:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan vs. Leon\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lance vs. Caitlin\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven vs. Diantha\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia vs. Flint\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Holy crap," Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The organizers are making Cynthia personally eliminate all the Sinnoh seeds?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
