Dragon Darts!?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raihan was stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait\u8212?did Dragonite learn Dragon Darts by watching Dreepy?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
