"If Dragapult can't even out-speed it, how can it win?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wandering Dragon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
No.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
THIS is the true 'Wandering Dragon!'"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
