{\qc
575: Lance: Objection, How Am I Supposed to Win a 2-on-1?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"The Youth Masters World Championship, huh?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In a remote forest of the Unova region, a young man with teal hair and a cap sat quietly on a cliff's edge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Behind him, a massive black dragon\u8212?Zekrom\u8212?stood tall, silently gazing down at the swirling mist below.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Around the youth were several playful wild Pok\u233?mon: a Pidove perched on his hat, a Deerling and a Cottonee nestled at his sides.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This young man was none other than N, who had escaped Team Plasma and earned the recognition of the Ideal Dragon\u8212?Zekrom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N smiled and held out his hand. The Pidove fluttered down to his finger and proudly dropped a green caterpillar from its beak, chirping eagerly as if offering a gift.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N gave a sheepish smile and turned to Zekrom, silently asking:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You want it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"ROOOHHH\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The dragon let out a disgruntled growl and looked away, staring into the sky.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If it were a Caterpie, maybe he'd tolerate it. But a Wurmple? What, is he supposed to vent on Rayquaza's descendant?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N chuckled awkwardly and quickly stuffed the Wurmple back into Pidove's mouth, steering the topic away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I heard Johan is in the championship\u8212?and made it to the finals?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[You want to go?]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom turned back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It still remembered Johan quite well.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N lowered his eyes. "Yeah\u8230? I want to see him."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had unresolved questions\u8212?questions he hoped Johan could answer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
WHRRRRRR\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom spread its wings and dove off the cliff.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[What are you waiting for?]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
N grinned, placed the Pidove gently down, and leapt into the sky after him, vanishing from the sight of the watching wild Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They all froze, scurrying to the cliff's edge to peek down\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
There, black-winged Zekrom carried N into the horizon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Next Day \u8211? Clear Skies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan yawned as he sat with Flint, Lucian, and the others, watching Cynthia vs. Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Didn't sleep?" Lucian asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nah." Johan waved it off, yawning again. "I was helping Gengar mess with his 'digital pet.'"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
\u8230?Digital pet?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The others blinked, confused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Giratina had played a major role in Gengar's development\u8212?especially this time, when they were tinkering with the DNA Splicers and Dragon Stone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the help of Giratina's ghost energy, Gengar had developed a new trick.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone knew: DNA Splicers = Fusion and Separation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar had already learned energy fusion from Aaron's Gengar\u8212?but this time, he advanced further.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He fused his own ghost energy using techniques from Urshifu's Rapid Strike Style.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Here's the comparison:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram's {\i
Fusion Flare} and Zekrom's {\i
Fusion Bolt} double in power if used after the other.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, you'd need both dragons\u8212?or Kyurem, fused with one of them\u8212?to use both moves in succession.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar couldn't use those divine moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But he could spam Shadow Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
One wasn't enough? Try two. Two wasn't enough? Throw three.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he could stack the move's power, that was enough.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wouldn't double like the dragons' moves, but he could boost it by 50%. That was already huge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And Giratina?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ghost-type energy battery, of course. The best "charger" around.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shrugged. "It's a long story. I'll show you Gengar's 'digital pet' next time."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Digital\u8230? pet?" Lucian squinted. Something about that sounded off.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before he could follow up, Flint laughed. "C'mon, it's just a pet, and an electronic one at that\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
CLICK.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan tapped his phone. Recording saved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Huh? You recorded that?" Flint looked baffled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Just documenting something," Johan replied with a smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian's eye twitched. Yep, something felt off. He was right to be cautious.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Next time, let's all visit the 'pet' together." Flint slapped Lucian's and Aaron's shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian: "\u8230?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Sure." Johan grinned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian: {\i
Flint, I'll remember this.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"They're starting," Aaron said seriously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crowd roared like thunder, waves of cheers cascading toward the arena's center.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
BOOM! BOOM!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Under dazzling spotlights and deafening screams, the excitement reached its peak.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's welcome the Dragon Master from Kanto\u8212?Lance!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He stepped forward, red cape billowing, waving to both sides with stern composure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?How many capes does Lance have?" Johan muttered.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The host's voice rose again:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"And now, from Sinnoh, the peerless Miss Cynthia!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The cheers were even louder than for Lance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When the radiant blonde beauty stepped forward, her presence lit the arena on fire.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Objectively, Lance and Cynthia were equals in presence\u8212?but Cynthia had the beauty edge.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A woman with queenly might and flawless looks? Total crowd magnet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar cupped his hands and shouted in support.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He wasn't eager to face Cynthia, but setting that aside\u8212?he was loyal to the one who always snuck him treats.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?That's some terrifying popularity," Johan clicked his tongue.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian shot him a look.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You of all people don't get to say that. Cynthia's popularity might not even top yours.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Behind them, Flint and Aaron had unfurled a banner:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Boss Lady \u8211? Majestic and Mighty, Charge!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and Lucian immediately covered their faces in embarrassment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"\u8230?Teacher, who do you think will win?" Steven asked, now relaxed after his match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shook his head. "Hard to say."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then added, "If we're going by odds, Cynthia's got a slight edge\u8212?60/40."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Really?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Steven was surprised.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He'd fought Lance before, but never Cynthia. All he knew was that Lance was incredibly strong\u8212?closer in age to Johan and himself than the others.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Johan wasn't underestimating Lance, despite calling him "Dodo Bird" as a joke.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the Masters Eight arc of the original timeline, Leon took first, Lance second, Cynthia third.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, Johan didn't think much of that Galar-based Masters Tournament.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Only allowing Dynamax, banning Mega and Z-Moves\u8212?it was clearly rigged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sure, Leon's Gigantamax Charizard was a beast, but still.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
