Out of 149 matches, he challenged her 149 times and lost every single one. Cynthia probably learned everything about countering Fire-types from battling Flint.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint grimaced.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still, Cynthia's strategy here strengthened her own field while keeping Ceruledge at bay.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On the field\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As Cynthia gave her command, Johan acted in sync.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Urshifu, Wicked Blow!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Garruu!! zzZ"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The moment the words left his lips, the once wide-eyed, snarling Urshifu began snoring\u8212?yet its movements didn't slow. It stomped forward with force.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
