"Gastrodon, take it head-on!" Cynthia said, still smiling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Take it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's Urshifu's punch\u8212?just tank it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
