Plus, this tactic compensated for its slowness\u8212?using soft counters rather than speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Gastrodon, distance yourself\u8212?Muddy Water!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Cynthia was surprised\u8212?not because Gastrodon had taken the hit, but because it had still {\i
cried out in pain.}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Had Johan's Urshifu gotten even stronger?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wochuuu!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\i
