That punch\u8212?was {\i
stronger}.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Had Johan merged Rapid Strike and Single Strike styles?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cynthia was stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just as Johan understood her, she knew his team well too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His Urshifu mastered both styles\u8212?but could only use their special moves in the correct state: awake or asleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But after repeatedly switching between sleep and awareness...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was he fusing the two styles?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If so, even though he used Wicked Blow, it was infused with Rapid Strike's principles\u8212?each punch getting stronger!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastrodon's defense boosts became irrelevant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Still\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gastrodon endured the attack and started to liquefy again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
{\b
