"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar and Larvitar both looked back at Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You two only remember me when it's time to pay...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
