She had also seen such legendary stories in historical documents.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And some had actually been proven.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Caitlin might not believe Johan's words, but Cynthia's...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
