"Au-Audino~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Audino lowered its head shyly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ding-a-ling~~\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just then, the Pok\u233?mon Center's door suddenly opened with a chime, but no one seemed to enter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Melo?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Meloetta, sitting invisibly on Johan's shoulder, suddenly turned its head, showing a puzzled expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar, after tossing the ice cream cone into its mouth, also looked in the same direction as Meloetta, scratching its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Strange...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mimi~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
