Wouldn't Larvitar just try to gnaw on Terapagos?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan shook his head, quickly suppressing this thought.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such ideas... were too dangerous, better not to entertain them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This Tera Orb is filled with Terastallization energy, but it can only be used once. To use it again, it would need to be recharged. I'll keep it as a trump card," Johan said.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the Tera Orb's energy is depleted, it needs to be recharged.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the Paldea region, recharging was relatively simple\u8212?just make contact with crystals containing Tera energy or visit a Pok\u233?mon Center.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But outside the Paldea region, apart from Blueberry Academy grounds, there was nowhere else to recharge it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So for Johan, this Tera Orb was currently a one-time item.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
