"Oowoo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Let me keep this Tera Orb.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ninetales said with a serious face.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing how serious it was, Johan didn't refuse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It didn't matter where it was kept.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unova Region, Reversal Mountain, Abundance Shrine.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the lush forest, an ancient, seemingly dilapidated shrine stood, its stone sculptures covered with patches of moss.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This should be the place." Team Plasma's Sage Ghetsis, holding his staff and leading a group of Team Plasma members, appeared here.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He stared intensely at the shrine before him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
