Rumble\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire ground began to shake, dark clouds appeared one after another in the sky, and fierce winds began to howl.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The power of legendary Pok\u233?mon lay not only in their inherent strength but also in the authorities they wielded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although the Forces of Nature might not seem like particularly powerful legendary Pok\u233?mon, in the Unova region...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
