"Dr-Dragon Vein?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Juanita looked at the cracking earth outside Eindoak Town with a horrified expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How was this possible?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Others might not know what the Sword of the Earth was about, but as one of the People of the Earth, she clearly understood their history. It was precisely because of the Dragon Vein's upheaval that the King of the Kingdom of the Earth had to use the Sword of the Earth to suppress it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nothing had happened for thousands of years.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With the Sword of the Earth suppressing it, how could the Dragon Vein suddenly become active?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
