"Landorus?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone was startled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"One of the Forces of Nature that governs abundance in the Unova region, Landorus has authority over parts of Unova's land. The 'Dragon Vein' itself is an embodiment of the earth, which aligns with Landorus's affinity and authority," Johan explained briefly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone fell silent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If what Johan said was true, it was indeed possible...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If Landorus appears, Thundurus and Tornadus probably came as well."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Forces of Nature\u8212?individually, none were particularly powerful except for Landorus, but if all three came together... their mastery over Unova's natural forces would be formidable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The true power of legendary Pok\u233?mon lies in their control over nature.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mother!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, a young man with black and white split-colored hair, dressed similarly to Juanita and Carlita, ran down from the castle atop the Sword of the Earth, coincidentally encountering Johan's group.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dread." Juanita called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was Juanita's son, one of the protagonists in the movie "Victini and the Black/White Hero, Zekrom/Reshiram," a young man who had gained the acknowledgment of either Zekrom or Reshiram\u8212?Dread.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His expression was also somewhat panicked, clearly not expecting the Dragon Vein to suddenly become active.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Dread quickly noticed Victini hugging Larvitar by Johan's feet, and his eyes immediately lit up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Victini?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
