"Team Plasma?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's too complex to explain all at once, but I'm guessing Team Plasma's target might be the power of the Dragon Vein, or perhaps Reshiram sleeping inside the Sword of the Earth."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone's bodies tensed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, Dread, who had been silent after listening to the explanation, suddenly spoke:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Perhaps... I have a way to resolve this crisis."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone looked at him, but his gaze fell on Victini.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan frowned slightly, seemingly guessing what he wanted to say.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dread continued on his own: "According to legend, the King of our Kingdom of the Earth used Victini's power to suppress the Dragon Vein with the Sword of the Earth. If we could once again use Victini's power, perhaps..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a pause, his expression gradually became more determined.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Perhaps we could also use Victini's power to suppress the Dragon Vein again, or even... return the Sword of the Earth to our homeland, restoring the land of our homeland to its original state!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As one of the People of the Earth, Dread's dream was to return the Sword of the Earth to their homeland and restore the land to its former glory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For this purpose, he often spent time in the castle atop the Sword of the Earth, quietly studying the ancient texts left by the king, pondering the seals he had left, and the methods to control the Sword of the Earth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although he hadn't fully mastered it yet.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
