"Melo~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mimi~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smiled and patted both Meloetta and Victini, then turned to look at the three People of the Earth with a profound tone:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Victini, the legendary friend of the King of the 'Kingdom of the Earth,' and that king used Victini's power to suppress the Dragon Vein, protecting all the People of the Earth and Eindoak Town."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"However, after the war between the two princes ended and the Dragon Vein stabilized, Victini remained forever sealed within this city..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
