Thousands of years!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To put it in Johan's words on behalf of Victini\u8212?do you know how I've spent these thousands of years?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Juanita, Carlita, and Dread looked at Victini on Johan's head with gratitude and guilt in their eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Though it was a hero, it couldn't even have freedom.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mimi~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini again showed an innocent smile, nuzzling Johan's head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Pok\u233?mon like Victini are willing to selflessly help friends they acknowledge, even if the outcome isn't favorable for them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This is the nature of such Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But such nature\u8212?exploiting it once is enough!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan took out a macaron, offered it to the top of his head, and gently pinched Victini's soft cheek.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Soon, "crunch crunch" sounds came from above his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But, this is all for..." Dread's eyes also turned serious, and despite his guilt, he still had to say and do this, "...for everyone, for Eindoak Town, for the homeland of the People of the Earth..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This is all for everyone!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan interrupted Dread again, looking at him sternly, and asked:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Then tell me, by using Victini's power, what will it experience, what will it encounter, what will happen to it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dread's pupils contracted, his mouth opened and closed, at a loss for words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan gave a cold laugh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"You know too, don't you? Although Victini has infinite energy, the recovery of that energy also has a speed limit. Using the old king's seal to draw on Victini's power might be fine at first, but later... the little one will become extremely, extremely pained!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, if drawn upon excessively, Victini might even die from exhaustion.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That the little one survived thousands of years ago was partly due to luck.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What?!" Juanita and the others looked at Dread in surprise.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dread showed a painful expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He knew, but he was still studying the texts left by the king...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To be honest, when watching the movie, Johan hadn't had much fondness for Dread's character.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini was clearly a hero, yet not only did it receive no thanks or freedom, but it was to be used again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
All because of Dread's... for the sake of his dream, for everyone.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar at Johan's feet shouted loudly, standing in front of Johan with arms spread wide, glaring fiercely at Dread.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Touch my underling, and you'll have to deal with me first!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint and Caitlin also stepped forward, standing beside Johan and Cynthia, their meaning clear without words.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
