After all, it was unfair to Victini, and they truly owed it far too much...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dread believed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For the sake of all, sacrifice the individual...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dread's expression turned serious, and he took a deep breath, his eyes determined as he said, "I'm sorry, but for the sake of all Eindoak Town, for the homeland of the People of the Earth..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hum\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Psychic waves fluctuated, and a Gothitelle and a Solosis appeared beside him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then numerous Solosis appeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearly, he had been preparing for this plan for a long time, just waiting to find Victini.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But upon seeing these Pok\u233?mon, Johan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
