Infernape's flame on its head rose high, looking at the Psychic-type Pok\u233?mon before it with an eager expression.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing these three Pok\u233?mon, Dread's breath caught.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He immediately felt an enormous threat.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
