[What is thy truth?]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram's voice echoed in Johan's mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For a moment, Johan couldn't answer, only silently observing the snow-white twin-tailed, ahem, snow-white giant dragon before him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While Johan was observing Reshiram, Reshiram was also observing him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
On Johan, Reshiram discovered several unfamiliar yet formidable auras, including that of its brother Zekrom!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Zekrom had acknowledged this human!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But if acknowledged, why hadn't it followed him?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Upon closer inspection, Reshiram understood the reason.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodness!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rayquaza, Giratina, Dialga, Palkia, Regigigas, and many other legendary Pok\u233?mon all seemed to have some connection with him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could Zekrom be worried about not gaining the acknowledgment of this person?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This thought suddenly surfaced in Reshiram's mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And as Johan and Reshiram fell into silence, a patch of black shadow rose from Johan's feet in this pure white space.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram frowned slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was its "territory"\u8212?what could possibly infiltrate it?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar gradually "squeezed" in with a sharpened head\u8212?literally sharpened, not metaphorically.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah! Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar placed its hands on its hips, standing beside Johan, and called out to Reshiram.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hey! My truth is to protect Johan and prevent him from suffering any harm!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
From Gengar, Reshiram saw the bond between it and Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It must be because of this bond that it could appear here.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So this truth\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Thy truth is sincere and heartfelt.]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reshiram's gaze softened somewhat as it nodded slightly to Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just after saying this, Reshiram paused.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The other party is a Pok\u233?mon...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Surely it couldn't follow a Pok\u233?mon?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It quickly looked back at Johan and spoke again.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[What is thy truth?]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
