"If Johan were to use his true full power, between him and me, it would probably be... 90-10, or perhaps 100-0."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "???"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Whoosh!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The arena was once again in an uproar, with everyone's jaws practically hitting the floor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Teacher Johan's "true full power"... could crush a Champion?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan also looked at Alder with complete astonishment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Boss, you can eat whatever you want, but you can't just say whatever pops into your head!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
100-0 against a Champion?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not even in his dreams.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Faced with Johan's gaze, Alder just smiled and winked, then shrugged his shoulders.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder felt what he said...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Was perfectly accurate!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
