607: Teacher Johan, Is Your Pok\u233?mon Legal?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The arena was buzzing with excitement, as Alder and Johan's exhibition match had instantly ignited the audience's enthusiasm.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, the post-match interview also sparked endless imagination among the Blueberry Academy students.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just how strong was Teacher Johan?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Amid the audience's cheers, Johan temporarily left the stage, yielding it to Dulse who was preparing to enter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Originally, the exhibition match was supposed to be between League Champion Alder and Academy Champion Dulse, but Johan's "intrusion" had extended the schedule.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the audience actually quite enjoyed this type of exhibition match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They expressed: If they could continue watching Champion Alder versus Teacher Johan battle, please give us more!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Of course, a League Champion versus an Academy Champion also had some appeal.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan stood by the player tunnel without immediately leaving, instead walking toward the Pok\u233?mon Center set up inside the arena.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, he was pondering something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Using Gengar against Alder was a no-brainer, but for an exhibition match against Dulse, who specialized in Dragon-type Pok\u233?mon, he couldn't very well use Ice Ninetales, could he?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
That would be somewhat inhumane.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed Dragonite was his only option.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, when facing Dragon-type Pok\u233?mon, his Dragonite always showed particular excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While he was considering this, the second exhibition match on the field had already begun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Alder was using his Bouffalant, while Dulse was using his ace Duralodon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Shine with brilliant metallic luster, Duralodon!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse threw out a Terastal Orb, and crystals formed around Duralodon. Already made entirely of duralumin steel, with an added layer of Terastal sheen, Duralodon now looked even more valuable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan, do you need your Terastal Orb recharged?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, Nurse Joy's soft voice came from beside Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At Blueberry Academy, the best way to recharge a Terastal Orb was through the Pok\u233?mon Center.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you, Nurse Joy," Johan smiled slightly, handing over the Terastal Orb that had lost its energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It-it's my duty\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Nurse Joy took the Terastal Orb and turned to walk into the Pok\u233?mon Center with Chansey.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"By the way... where does Blueberry Academy's Terastal energy come from?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Terastallization originated from the ancient legendary Pok\u233?mon Terapagos, but if Johan remembered correctly, Terapagos had become extinct two million years ago, with only one remaining due to crustal movement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And this last remaining Terapagos had fallen into slumber, currently likely with the grandmother of Riko, one of the protagonists of "Pok\u233?mon Horizons."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"But then again, if Terapagos is sleeping... where does the Paldea region's Terastal energy come from?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Thinking of this, Johan shook his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who cares where it comes from? Anyway, he didn't believe Terapagos would suddenly appear before him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But just at that moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Ding-ding-ding\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The crisp sound of ice crystals colliding rang in Johan's ears, growing closer and closer. The sound was like when Gengar Terastallized, only more delicate.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"No way\u8212?" Johan's mouth twitched.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could his random thought actually come true?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His vision briefly blurred, and a Pok\u233?mon resembling a land turtle, deep blue all over, with eyes like stars and a hexagonal crystalline shell, suddenly appeared before him and Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Terapagos?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-ka-kaah? (\u8857?_\u8857?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar rubbed its eyes twice, then its eyes lit up.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It-it looks so valuable...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hum\u8212?\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With a red flash, Larvitar automatically came out, looking at the "Terapagos" floating in the air. Its eyes were even brighter than Gengar's, and drool even flowed from the corner of its mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yo-Yoji...(@\u961?@)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It-it looks so delicious...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He covered his face. This was bad\u8212?Larvitar really was interested in Terapagos's crystals.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If Larvitar were to Terastallize in the future... would this little thing get so carried away it might even try to eat itself?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Normally, when Pok\u233?mon face Gengar's money-obsessed ghost eyes or Larvitar's starving-ghost eyes, they would feel scared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But this "Terapagos" before them not only wasn't afraid, but even playfully winked, showing a "got you" smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hmm?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A clear, ethereal voice rang out, making Johan instinctively pause. Gengar and Larvitar also came to their senses, showing puzzled expressions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This voice... sounded so familiar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was the first to react, looking at the "Terapagos" and tentatively calling out:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~(\u65342?\u9661?\u65342?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
