"Mew~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing Johan say "fatter," Mew immediately puffed up its cheeks, pretending to be angry, which drew laughter from Johan and Gengar.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Come to think of it, the last time Mew came to find him, although they had fun together, Johan had promised Mew he would bring it to play again at the next academy Spring Festival.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But later, due to a series of events in the Unova region, plus the "Youth Master World Championship," Johan hadn't made it to the academy's Spring Festival.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So, Mew, having waited for a long time, came looking for him itself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew? Mew?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After burrowing into Johan's arms, Mew suddenly twitched its little nose and began sniffing him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The more it sniffed, the more puzzled its expression became, with a hint of curiosity.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What's wrong, Mew?" Johan couldn't help but ask, seeing this.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew\u8212?" Mew showed a thoughtful expression, "Mew?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had detected from Johan's body... a scent that was somewhat familiar yet somewhat strange, a very... odd scent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Have you been secretly seeing other little Mews?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing this, Johan couldn't help but laugh.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
How many Mews were there in this world? He... wasn't really sure.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Johan also understood what scent Mew had detected. It wasn't Mew's, but Mewtwo's.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But explaining Mewtwo's existence also posed a challenge for him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, little Mew was only curious for a moment before its attention was drawn to Victini.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After the two little ones curiously sized each other up for a few moments, a mischievous gleam flashed in Mew's eyes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~" (Rock-paper-scissors!)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nii-nii mi?" Victini instinctively extended its hand\u8212?scissors.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew extended a small, clenched pink fist.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~" (Rock, I win~~)\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini: ...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The little one dove into Johan's clothes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan, your Terastal Orb\u8212?" Nurse Joy's voice came from behind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew reacted quickly, immediately transforming into an Eevee and landing in Johan's arms.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What was that sound?" Nurse Joy looked puzzled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan turned around, and the Eevee in his arms casually licked its paw.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nothing, I must have misheard," Nurse Joy said, holding a tray with the fully recharged Terastal Orb in the center\u8212?a transparent black crystal ball with rippling waves inside.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan, your Terastal Orb is fully charged."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you, Nurse Joy," Johan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew also called out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"How cute, this little Eevee, so plump\u8212?obviously well-fed," Nurse Joy remarked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-Ee-vui?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan quickly pressed his hand on Mew's head, hurriedly saying, "Um... Nurse Joy, I need to go prepare."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Alright."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan then carried Mew, pulling Gengar and Larvitar along as he quickly walked away.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Eevee that Mew had transformed into puffed up its cheeks.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan directly inserted his hand into its fluffy fur, saying with a smile: "But you are quite cute."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With its fleshiness and smooth fur, wasn't it much better to pet than something like Garchomp?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Hearing Johan's words, Mew's expression immediately improved. It raised its paw to paw at Johan's clothes.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Knowing what it wanted, Johan immediately took out some Pok\u233? Puffs and macarons.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nii-mi?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Smelling the aroma of the macarons, Victini, who had suffered a thousand-mile defeat on the "rock-paper-scissors" road, also came out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before long.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The "crunch-crunch" sounds and "Ee-vui Ee-vui" voices became the main theme.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar, with a mineral in one hand and a macaron in the other, indicated: Macarons paired with minerals is the perfect combination, you guys just don't understand.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, Mew's sudden appearance gave Johan some new ideas.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew, would you be interested in... participating in the exhibition match?" Johan asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Eevee blinked twice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When it came to battles and fighting, Mew actually didn't have much desire for it, as it wasn't a Pok\u233?mon that particularly enjoyed fighting\u8212?quite different from Mewtwo in this regard.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But an "exhibition match," or rather a "performance," immediately caught little Mew's interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, it was just an exhibition match, so winning or losing didn't matter, nor did the fighting style.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mew hopped and changed back to its original form, then became invisible as it passed through the player tunnel to the edge of the field. Hearing the cheers of the entire arena, its little eyes immediately showed interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Returning to Johan's side.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"We can do... this and that..." Johan said in a low voice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Mew~~" Mew covered its mouth with both hands, revealing a sly smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar scratched its butt, tilting its head slightly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Why does it feel like this little Mew is also learning from me?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan also showed a similar "Johan family style" smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Let's give them a little shock."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Thank you, Champion Alder and Student Dulse, for bringing us such an exciting exhibition match!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The entire arena erupted in cheers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It had to be said that while Dulse VS Alder wasn't quite as thrilling as Teacher Johan VS Alder, it still gave the audience a different feeling.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan VS Alder gave them the excitement of watching a celebrity match.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse VS Alder gave them more immersion, allowing them to imagine themselves in Dulse's position, fantasizing about the future scene where they themselves would reach the hall of the Champion Cup and face Champion Alder.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for the upcoming Dulse VS Teacher Johan\u8212?why did it mysteriously feel like a subject teacher giving one-on-one individual guidance to a student?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After giving Dulse some rest time, as well as time to recharge the Terastal Orb, Johan and Dulse slowly appeared on the field under the announcer's introduction.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan! Dulse has been held back for three years, you need to give him a good 'remedial lesson'!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan, Dulse likes to doze off and has a lazy personality, you need to 'cure' him properly!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Many students cupped their hands like megaphones, shouting to Johan on the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse: "..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Before Johan could react, Dulse had already inserted his hands into his hair, covering his forehead.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Headache.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Dulse was strong, being the undisputed Champion of Blueberry Academy's Blueberry League, as well as the president of the League Union.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If this were translated to the real League, it would be equivalent to combining Leon and Rose\u8212?Champion and League Chairman in one person.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But Dulse's laziness was also well-known. For studying and going to school... he really couldn't muster much interest.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Those who didn't know better might think he was Alder's grandson, rather than the grandson of Mr. Shaga, the strict Gym Leader and teacher.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Because Dulse and Alder actually had some similarities.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse quickly adjusted his state. He knew that those voices were just Blueberry Academy students joking around. Rather than these jokes, he was more concerned about his match with Teacher Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan, my grandfather has mentioned more than once on the phone that I should learn well from you, and I've actually been looking forward to battling you for a long time!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse held a Pok\u233? Ball in his hand and threw it without hesitation.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, Kingdra!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When battling Alder, Dulse's Pok\u233?mon was Duralodon, but facing Johan, he chose Kingdra, a Water and Dragon-type Pok\u233?mon!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Clearly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was a precaution against Johan's Ice Ninetales.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kingdra was quite talented in terms of weather, and its Water-type also made it less afraid of Ice-type moves.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It seemed Dulse had a good understanding of Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It was just an exhibition match, no need to be so serious. Even if Mew hadn't come, he probably wouldn't have used Ice Ninetales, which would be too targeted against Dulse's Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But now...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Go, 'Eevee'."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
'Eevee', transformed by Mew, jumped from Johan's arms onto the field.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee?" Dulse was taken aback.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The audience was also stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Does Teacher Johan have an Eevee Pok\u233?mon?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"I think... I heard someone mention it before?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
