"'Eevee', Misty Terrain!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui\u8212?\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A pink field spread from 'Eevee', expanding in all directions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Everyone: ???\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wait.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eevee... can use Misty Terrain?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Teacher Johan, is your Pok\u233?mon legal?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
