{\qc
608: So This Is Teacher Johan's True 'Trump Card'?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar}\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eevee?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the Pok\u233?mon summoned by Teacher Johan, Dulse was obviously taken aback.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the information he had obtained, there was no mention of Teacher Johan having an Eevee.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Could it be a Pok\u233?mon Teacher Johan had just captured?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although this was an exhibition match, using a newly captured Pok\u233?mon to battle him\u8212?wasn't that a bit disrespectful?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Dulse couldn't help but have such thoughts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In fact, he wasn't the only one thinking this way; many Blueberry Academy audience members shared similar thoughts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dulse, show Teacher Johan what you're made of!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dulse, show Teacher Johan the experience you've accumulated from being held back three times!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Come on, defeat Teacher Johan, Dulse!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Saying it was "mass excitement" might be an exaggeration, but this rare opportunity to defeat Teacher Johan\u8212?Dulse, you must seize it!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Some people even wished they could replace Dulse on the field. How did such a "good" opportunity fall to Dulse?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As the announcer declared the official start of this exhibition match, after Johan issued his first command, everyone including Dulse did a complete 180-degree turn on their previous opinions.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"'Eevee', Misty Terrain!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ee-vui~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With 'Eevee's' gentle call, the light pink Misty Terrain immediately spread rapidly, covering the entire field at incredible speed.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This left everyone stunned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Wait! I may not be well-read, but Teacher Johan, don't fool me\u8212?can Eevee use Misty Terrain?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Eevee? This isn't the Eevee I know!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Teacher Johan! Is your Eevee legal?!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eevee could actually use Misty Terrain?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then Groudon could probably fly too!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But the facts were right before their eyes. The Blueberry Academy students couldn't help but feel amazed and began to doubt... whether the knowledge in their textbooks was wrong?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, Dulse also realized.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Perhaps... Teacher Johan's Eevee wasn't as he had imagined.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Instantly, Dulse focused all his attention, clearing all extraneous thoughts from his mind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Kingdra, Rain Dance!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Doru~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Kingdra raised its head, blue light flickering in its eyes. Dark clouds quickly gathered above the arena, and torrential rain began to pour down.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Large raindrops fell on Kingdra's body, soaking its scales while creating a thin mist around its body.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In an instant, Kingdra's gills and the fins on its back fluttered, and bathed in the rain, its body seemed to become more agile and flexible.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Swift Swim!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Swift Swim: Pok\u233?mon with this ability have their Speed doubled in rain or heavy rain weather!]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Undoubtedly, this was an ability that perfectly complemented rainy weather.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
