However, whether intentionally or not, when Dragonite took out its "Dragon Scale cookie," it let Johan see its little "pocket's" inventory.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Not much left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan's heart ached as he silently took out a Leppa Berry Pok\u233? Puff and put it in his mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He felt... the prize money from winning the "Youth Master World Championship," the remaining forty million plus, wouldn't last much longer.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Tightening his belt...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"When will this end..." Johan sighed inwardly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beep beep\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
His phone suddenly received a message. After a quick glance, Johan immediately sat up straight.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Ten million Pok\u233?dollars deposited by Rocket Media Entertainment Corporation!]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The transfer also included a note.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
[Storm Plan (winking emoji)]\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Without question, the transfer was definitely from Boss Giovanni's assistant and general manager, financial director, marketing director, and operations director of Rocket Media Entertainment Corporation\u8212?Matori, who had just returned to Kanto.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The reason for this transfer was... Johan's compensation as temporary commander of Team Rocket members in the Unova region for settling the "Storm Plan" remnants.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan took a deep breath.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Indeed, Boss Giovanni understood him best. He loved this feeling of being corrupted by money...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Through fire and water, Boss Giovanni!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
June 1st, Monday.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan finally returned to Kanaz City in Hoenn, which he had left for so long. When he left it was mid-April, and when he returned it was already June.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Hoenn region's temperature had completely warmed up, at the transition between spring and summer, with quite pleasant climate and temperature.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan had stayed at Blueberry Academy for several days, mainly to let little Mew have a good time and enjoy itself fully.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After Mew left, he also took a plane back to Hoenn.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I, Gengar the Great, am back!!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Wearing sunglasses, Gengar stood outside the airport, excitedly shouting.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This trip to Unova was quite an experience.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Beside it, Larvitar, also wearing matching sunglasses like Gengar, held a branch longer than itself, eating it bite by bite, looking quite like it was eating... sugar cane!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Except it ate the "sugar cane" without spitting out the "pulp."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan walked quickly, pretending not to know these two particularly attention-grabbing little ones, immediately hailed a taxi\u8212?back to the caf\u233?!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, Gengar and Larvitar followed closely without being left behind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although he'd been away for over a month, the caf\u233? hadn't changed much from when Johan left. Even the upstairs residential area hadn't accumulated much dust, showing that the Indeedee siblings and Alcremie had managed the caf\u233? excellently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Indeedee~!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Receiving the gifts Johan had specifically brought, the Indeedee siblings and Alcremie were all very happy, especially the female Indeedee, who directly clung to Johan affectionately.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then came the welcome ceremony\u8212?everyone together welcomed Victini's joining!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Although Johan hadn't used a Pok\u233? Ball to capture Victini, humans and Pok\u233?mon didn't necessarily need Pok\u233? Balls as a "medium."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Crunch crunch\u8212?\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
To welcome Victini, the male Indeedee and Alcremie specially made its favorite macarons\u8212?various flavored macarons, including cream macarons.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan looked at Victini sitting on the table, with cream and crumbs at the corners of its mouth, contentedly munching macarons, and smiled gently.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nii-mi~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini happily closed its eyes, the V on its head glowing with gentle light, seemingly radiating "victory" waves to all the Pok\u233?mon in the caf\u233?.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini now felt that following Johan was incredibly happy!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So happy it felt like flying!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar patted Victini's small shoulder, eyes gleaming cunningly as it spoke.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Don't rush, tonight I'll show you the empire I've built here!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nii-mi?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Victini tilted its head, blinking twice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Empire?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was also considering something.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Now that he'd suddenly returned from Unova to Hoenn, where should his group of little ones train in the future?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It felt like the academy's training facilities and fields couldn't keep up with his little ones' progress...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He couldn't train near home, could he?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Forget about those powerful Normal-type moves the Unova League had given him\u8212?just a few kicks from Larvitar would destroy the house!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"If only I could have a small island..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was becoming increasingly interested in owning his own island and being an "island master."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He also had a rather bold idea.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What if, if, hypothetically... after befriending the awakened Groudon in the future, could he ask it to help create a small island?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Building islands... he'd probably need to discuss it with the fat fish too.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But thinking about those two guys... Johan felt quite a headache.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He didn't know when they'd wake up, and they were both hot-tempered creatures, not easy to communicate with.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Forget it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan temporarily set aside the thought. "Although the Pok\u233?mon world doesn't have this celebration, but... June 1st is Children's Day, we should celebrate properly."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who isn't a "child"?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
