"Yo-Yoji..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar tucked in its head and gave an embarrassed smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I was just checking if it was ice or mineral...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
