"Alright, are you going back to sleep now?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing Regice carefully extend its hand to "absorb" the two boxes of Pok\u233? Blocks into the ice crystals of its arm, Johan asked.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Regi?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regice cautiously asked back.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Should I continue sleeping?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was speechless, paused for a moment, and then said: "You don't have to sleep. We'll come find you to 'play' next time when we're free."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As he spoke, he revealed a "kind" smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah~ (\u9660?\u30410?\u9660?)"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar and all the other little ones also showed similar smiles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was the ultimate "training partner."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for capturing Regice or taking it back?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Take it back to use as a refrigerator?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
A seven or eight-meter-tall Regice would be too extravagant.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Besides, it could sleep perfectly well on its own, so why give it a different place to sleep? When they really needed it... Johan believed it wouldn't refuse.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The Regi clan, possibly due to Regigigas, were powerful but mostly simple-minded, making them relatively easy to communicate with.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Between humans and Pok\u233?mon, building a friendly relationship didn't necessarily require capturing them with Pok\u233? Balls.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Take Victini, for example.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Until now, Johan hadn't captured it with a Pok\u233? Ball, instead letting it wander and move around freely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing the smiles of Johan and Gengar and the others, Regice seemed to shrink its head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Regi..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then I'll go back to sleep.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This "play" didn't sound like a good thing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As they spoke, the ice crystals on Regice's body moved again, and two empty boxes fell out, with all the Pok\u233? Blocks inside having disappeared.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
So that's how it eats?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That works too." Johan nodded and took out three more boxes of Pok\u233? Blocks, placing them in front of Regice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"REGI!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regice's lights flashed with some excitement.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This battle seemed worth it.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After a pause, the ice crystals on Regice's body fluctuated again, and then one, two, three... a total of four blocks of never-melting ice, plus a mineral that seemed to contain special minerals, fell in front of Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"This is..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Regi..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Compensation...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regice answered honestly.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
These never-melting ice blocks were produced from the accumulated ice energy at its sleeping place over many years, and that mineral was a rare stone it had collected, rich in energy.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan was somewhat moved.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had only made a joke, but Regice had taken it seriously. What a straightforward creature...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then he dug out five more boxes of Pok\u233? Blocks from Gengar's mouth.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Give and take, that's how to better establish a friendly relationship.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In Johan's view, exchanging merely ten boxes of Pok\u233? Blocks for four blocks of never-melting ice and an extremely rare special mineral was absolutely profitable.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
While in Regice's view, exchanging a few slightly harder pieces of ice for such food was also a huge win.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The two looked at each other, both showing smiles.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Regice put away the eight boxes of Pok\u233? Blocks, stood in place for a while, scanned the area for a moment, apparently finding its bearings, then brushed away the snow on the ground, revealing a hole leading below the small island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At the same time, the ice and snow on the sea surface and the island receded like a tide.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Noticing this scene, the International Police and League Police outside all let out sighs of relief, knowing that the situation had been resolved by Teacher Johan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Watching Regice, who had regained consciousness and become honest and simple, slowly walking towards the cave, Gengar waved vigorously.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Goodbye! We'll come play with you again in a few days!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As soon as those words were spoken, Regice's speed suddenly increased, as if turning into a cold current, disappearing into the hole in a flash.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then "crack crack crack" a layer of ice crystals covered the entrance.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sealed!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing this, Gengar's expression froze for a moment, then it stuck out its tongue proudly and made a couple of mocking sounds.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just a little ice crystal, it can't stop me.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji..."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar smacked its lips.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What a nice "Gundam"...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
