"Teacher Johan!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At this moment, Officer Jenny and the others finally arrived on the island, looking at the island that had almost turned into an ice island, secretly amazed at Regice's power, and even more amazed at Teacher Johan's strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
