"Riding my beloved bicycle~ I'll never get stuck in traffic~"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan hummed an off-key tune, his lips curved in a slight smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Want to challenge me? You think I don't know what Lance and Wikstrom are thinking?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The "mission" of challenging for Duke rank to exchange for a Mega Stone was complete. There was no point staying at the Battle Chateau - he wasn't planning to challenge for "Grand Duke" rank, he'd eaten Siebold's free cuisine several times, and feeling satisfied, he naturally left.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Rotom, accelerate!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Understood, Rotom!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After recovering from the battle, Rotom was now in good spirits, having gained some understanding of its own strength.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
