"It's not me, Rotom\u8212?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Rotom-Bike's speed continued climbing, quickly exceeding Johan's control range.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The next second.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Bang\u8212?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
