"Yoji?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flying again?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then it heard Johan shout:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Dragonite, save\u8212?!!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
