"It's getting late. Let's camp here tonight."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Ka-kaah!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Gengar reacted fastest, immediately springing into action to set up the tent!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then the other little ones also started moving, leaving only Regieleki standing in place, not knowing what to do.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"It's fine. Watch what everyone's doing, learn from them. When you've learned and want to help, then help."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
