When its gaze fell on Larvitar, who was heartily gnawing on minerals, it suddenly gained some understanding.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Eating!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
I know how to do that!\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
