Ninetales, curled up beside Johan, opened its eyes a crack and glanced at Gengar and Larvitar preparing to go out.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It wasn't afraid of anyone else, but when it came to Johan and Ninetales as Johan's "representative," Gengar was still a bit intimidated. It immediately put on what it thought was a "harmless" smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
