When they had gone far enough, the two little ones became bolder in their movements.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yoji?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Larvitar stared hard at the pitch-black forest but couldn't see the "glowing thing" Gengar mentioned.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
