"Miscalculation, miscalculation..." Johan shook his head.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But there was no choice.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Who made these three the best at "hiding"?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, it was without incident.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was also part of Mewtwo's human experience plan.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
At least...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Mewtwo shopping was much more reliable than Gengar shopping.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
If he dared let Gengar shop, Gengar would definitely bring back a Mareep, the electric kind.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Hey, Teacher Johan, what's for dinner tonight?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
