Current Flint had also made a name for himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Single-handedly holding off Palkia\u8212?when some capable trainers in Kanaz City learned it was him, they literally lined up to challenge him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This made Flint "battle happy."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Seeing his expression, Johan was speechless.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Look at this\u8212?no wonder Lucian was exhausted.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Lucian would be crazy not to be tired.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Suddenly, Johan's eyes turned, showing Gengar's signature smile.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"That's fine."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He drained the remaining coffee in his cup. "I happen to have something tomorrow that needs your help."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Flint became surprisingly alert, showing suspicion, asking carefully:\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"What is it?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Nothing major." Johan waved his hand, his smile becoming increasingly strange.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such an energetic person\u8212?it would be too wasteful not to use him as labor.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Island development was imminent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Sending Flint to the island, one person could do the work of four or five, beautifully called "training."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Freeloading?\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Go ahead and freeload.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After all, it's all work.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
You might profit, but we definitely won't lose.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Best to get everything completely finished before summer vacation ended\u8212?then everything would be perfect.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
