Wake up at eight in the morning.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Morning jog, prepare breakfast, pet Pok\u233?mon, basic training\u8212?before he knew it, it was noon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After lunch, everyone rested for an hour, then went to the island for development while conducting some "advanced" training.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anyway, the island currently had almost nothing but soil and grass.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The island's foundation had been extremely solidly compacted by Groudon at Johan's request. As long as they didn't go completely wild, it wouldn't cause much damage.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This so-called "advanced" training was quite simple.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He and Rotom together formulated daily, weekly, and periodic training plans. Gengar led the team, and the little ones were quite self-conscious, showing signs of beginning to compete intensely.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
As for Johan himself.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Reading books, enriching his knowledge, then ensuring energy supply and providing guidance during specific training\u8212?otherwise, there wasn't much else.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was like a real recovery period after experiencing the Dahara City incident.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In the evening, they would return together, then prepare dinner. Mewtwo gradually began learning about shopping, cooking, and serving customers.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After dinner, he would first call Cynthia, then play with his Pok\u233?mon.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
For example.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Playing Pok\u233?mon poker together.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But often, various big and small amusing incidents would occur.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Like Gengar "accidentally" dropping cards under its butt, Tyranitar "accidentally" eating cards, Ninetales "accidentally" freezing cards to powder, Ceruledge "accidentally" burning cards...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
And so on, countless examples.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Fortunately, no matter what happened, after all the roughhousing and pushing, it always ended in laughter.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Or everyone playing games Johan had devised, like "Rayquaza Flying Chess," "Pok\u233?mon Mahjong," "Monopoly Gengar," etc.\u8212?all the same.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
In short.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
What they played wasn't important\u8212?what mattered was everyone had fun.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
After playing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Cleaning up dinner's aftermath, they would either huddle together watching movies, bathe together, or go shopping, strolling, being mischievous, etc.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
The final "activity" before bed remained constant\u8212?Teacher Johan's storytelling time.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
This was more addictive than watching TV shows or movies.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Every night before bed, everyone, including Mewtwo, would gather around Johan's bed or on it, listening to his stories.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
