Then he'd forget the previous part in the next segment, and the little ones would correct him.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Anyway.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Except for stories Johan remembered clearly, most stories became unrecognizable due to everyone's input.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Instead, it was like... everyone brainstorming together, creating story after story.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Creating stories that only Johan and they understood and appreciated.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and the little ones didn't mind this\u8212?instead, they had Rotom record everything.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
