It didn't need a fancy name\u8212?just call it "Our Story."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Such ordinary days.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Often ended only when Gengar turned off the lights.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
