"Once the vegetables and berries are planted and can be self-sufficient, I definitely need to raise a few more Pok\u233?mon."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Unlike training Gengar and the others, which consumed too many resources, energy, and costs.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even if this island were planted full of berries and such crops, who knew if it would be enough for them to squander.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
It would just be purely raising them in a "semi-free-range" manner.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Raising and training were still somewhat different concepts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Just like... Garganacl, who was already preparing to move to the island.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
