Regarding Garganacl's condition, Johan had already discussed it with Gengar, and their conclusion was... it was "lonely."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
They needed to find it a wife.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
When that time came...\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
