"Skwo!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan and his group also reached the giant tree at the center of Ballimere Lake's hill.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However, just like Moltres, as soon as they approached, a chubby Skwovet that looked like a ball immediately appeared before them and stretched out its hand to stop them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
With this stance, Johan really wanted to step forward and flick the Skwovet's nose, then arrogantly say\u8212?"Still blocking? We're here to collect you!"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
But obviously, this wasn't Johan's style. Maybe if it were Flint, it might be about right.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
However.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Even Galarian Moltres protected this giant tree so much that it wouldn't start a fight. Johan naturally couldn't casually provoke conflict either.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
