"Let the energy cubes fly for a while."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Johan smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Entering the canopy and cutting a few valuable branches were two different concepts.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Moreover, compared to the giant tree whose purpose was still unknown, Johan was more interested in the berry trees scattered everywhere.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
